  <para style="h">Tar fathlǝngya Yeeso</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tar fathlǝngya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Tar fathlǝngya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tar fathlǝngya Yeeso</para>
  <para style="mt">Tar fathlǝngya Yeeso</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="s">Ndaagha Yeeso nǝn a thlǝn Sǝsǝna ɓa tǝ Pǝɗǝnda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Tiyafulus ahu ɗeleewar na ˈwani chirethleu ɗǝ chirethleu ɗi ǝnggina hai katǝra na Yeeso ǝnaarha heu tǝ tsahadghǝn ha, <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />ta farɗaɗǝ tǝrang nanda talara ɗǝ kapa na nda tǝrang nda talara ɗǝ kalang ɗǝ fathlǝnggighǝn sǝ tǝ thlarra Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />A hu ɓenɗi kumnggit faɗa a kwasamadɗi tawang nanda ɗǝ kyadɗǝ fadghǝn a fathlǝnggighǝn sayi-sayi tǝ ƙǝm ahu kwamangya hangga kyaɗang nǝn ndaarha kanda nǝghǝn tǝ yibrha fa. A hu ɓenggini ya pǝrang ɗǝ laɓara kanda aten kutǝryid Faara.<verse eid="ACT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Ndǝghǝn ɓalɗǝ tǝ kanda ahu sayidɗi na nanda a hǝb ǝnnarhami ndanggǝn kanda, “A mal ɗun Urshalima wa kǝl a thlǝnang Pǝpa ǝnɗi kun ɓa ndanǝn. Ɗalama teena hai ˈwaɗi pǝrang ǝnɗi kun ya. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Ənagha Yahaya mbaptisǝma tǝ aama, amma ahu ɓengya na ɓayi tǝ Sǝsǝna tǝ Pǝɗǝnda na nda a ǝnang mbaptisǝma kun.”<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tǝrang nda Yeeso a talara ɗǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Tǝrgha wumngga fathlǝnggighǝn hai a thlǝmadghǝn na nda a tsahang mee ha “Chinǝm na a kal Isǝrela hai nanǝnya nggǝrgha wuɗang kutǝryirha kan ha wa?”<verse eid="ACT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Ndanggǝn kanda, “Faara katenggǝn ndǝna tǝ sǝsǝmnda ǝna ɓengya, amma fǝrang ngwanda kwaman sǝndǝghǝn kun wa. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Amma a ɓad Sǝsǝna tǝ Pǝɗǝnda aten nun ɓa kun nagha ndǝn tǝ yid nun, nun a wal sǝsǝmnda na a pǝr laɓar na nun a fiya ko a yanggi ni a Urshalima, tǝ chehweed Yahudiya, tǝ Samariya ɗǝgha ta mii ngwala ƙǝshiirha ɗǝ.”<verse eid="ACT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />A kwasamadɗi thlǝknǝn ǝngginiya, tǝrang ngganda talara sǝ, kanda a ƙǝlang nda, timngga hu hashmbe ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Nana nda a tutuk yirha talara ɗǝ ka a naghǝn nda. Kula sǝndǝ ndan sǝ kǝla nda hai nafiya sǝri tǝ lukkya fa pǝpet ƙǝƙǝt nagha a pathlang ndan. <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />Ndangganda kanda, “Nafiya Nggalili, kama na nun ƙǝƙǝt a ƙǝlarha talara ɗǝ? Yeeso tǝrang nda ma kun ɗǝnda tǝghǝn talara ɗǝ. A fara sǝmǝn ƙǝm ƙǝla nanun ndǝn a wiirha, nǝn a nggǝr wutta ɓa kee!”<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mattes ndǝn nggǝrgha a mbǝd Yahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Fa thlǝngya Yeeso na nda a wumnda ɗǝfya Dzaitun katǝrana ǝnɗa hai ya, wuɗa nda Urshalima ɗǝ na iundǝghǝn takh ɗǝ a sǝl mel tal. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Tǝrgha kya nda hu ƙǝnɗa ɗǝ tǝnna nda aten shadghǝn nana nda sǝ tǝ tsaurha. Kulo thlǝm nafini ya na a mbǝɗi: Mbiturus, tǝ Yahaya, tǝ Yakubu, tǝ Andrawus, tǝ Filibus, tǝ Toma, tǝ Mbatalomi, tǝ Mattiyu, tǝ Yakubu wan Halfa, tǝ Siman (tǝsǝrǝk chehweedghǝn) tǝ Yahuda wan Yakubu.<verse eid="ACT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Wuma nda hai heu na nda naarha hwan Faara, tǝ fingya nishya hangga, heu tǝ Mairamu man Yeeso, tǝ wan mangya Yeeso hǝshya.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Na farɗa sǝ wumna fatakkwaya Yeeso hai takh nda a sǝl haru tǝ kumnggit sǝri, tǝrgha Mbiturus thliigha sǝ ndaagha:<verse eid="ACT 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />“Wan manggina, kamɗǝ a lǝghǝdgha ˈya ndana ɗeleewar Faara aten Yahuda, ɗǝgha ɗǝ tǝ fa ƙǝla Ƙǝn Faara ha na manggǝn ka a ƙǝsang ngganda Yeeso. ˈWad Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda thlǝkƙǝn ƙǝtǝm a mii Kutǝra Ndauda. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Yahuda nǝghǝn tal ahur nǝm, yi wurna nda ka ǝna tar ɗa nǝm ya tǝghǝn.”<verse eid="ACT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />(Yahuda hiiɗǝ heerha tǝ wuɗǝɓǝl ɗi thlǝnǝn ka thlǝrɓuyidghǝn, mukka hai tǝ man tenggǝn, ɗalthgha hurghǝn kyagha haɗighǝn ƙǝshi. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Laɓar mǝrrǝghǝn welɗa ɗǝ ƙǝkar a fiya heu na a Urshalima, ɗǝfang thlǝma nda mbǝɗi tǝ mii Aramaya “Akeldama,” ndaarha ni “Pǝpal Fara.”)<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Ɗǝgha Mbiturus mbeeɗǝ tǝ ndaarha, ƙǝsǝr nǝghǝn chichireethlee hai hu ɗeleewar Dzabura tǝ ndaarha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">“Ngwa tsauka wurighǝn kwadwure; ko niifa ahurghǝn tǝ tsaurha tǝ kǝm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">Ngwa tǝrangga niifa pak mamnggitghǝn.”<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />“Tsaunǝn kee, tǝtani a wur niifa nǝm na a tsaurha a mbǝd Yahuda. Tǝtani ƙǝm niifa ni na narha tǝ ƙǝm ka a sayidɗi heu nanǝm tǝ Chinǝm Yeeso. <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />Ka a farɗi ǝnang na Yahaya mbaptisǝma ta ɓagha farɗa ɓa tǝrangna nda ma thlǝman nǝm ɗǝnda tǝghǝn talara ɗǝ. Kala niifa wur nǝm nǝn a wum teena tǝ ƙǝm hu pǝr laɓar thlid Yeeso sǝ ahu mǝrra.”<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Aah thlǝm nafiya nda sǝri: Yisufu na thlǝmnggǝn Mbarsaba na nda aarha ƙǝm Yustus tǝ Mattes. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Tǝrgha hwan Faara nda aten niifa kamngga a wura nda, ndaa nda, “Chinǝm sa sǝngga hur nafiya heu, ahur nafini sǝri ya kyaɗang yanɗi kan wur nana, <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />a tsauka tǝ thlǝndǝwa a meghed Yahuda tǝ thlǝrɓu ahu tar wa, ƙǝsǝr karɗǝ kan fa ɗǝgha mbǝɗaɗǝ kamangga fa.” <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Tǝrgha ǝna wura nda aten ndan, wur Mattes nda tsauka tǝ thlǝnda Yeeso tǝ fingya na kumkap tal.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Ɓad Sǝsǝna ɓa tǝ Pǝɗǝnda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />A far wutsǝfayirha na nda aarha pentikos, wumngga fatakkwaya Yeeso hai a mbǝrha tal. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Kula sǝndǝndan sǝ sǝk fad ˈya nda a riirha ƙǝla ɓereu ˈyaara a fǝrakh amshi hai lǝɗanggǝn wuriɗi nana nda sǝ tsǝtsau. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Tǝrgha na ˈya nda kǝla sheneu waarha kyagha sǝ a pathlang ndan a ndǝkrhaɗe tǝ kǝm tǝrgha ten nggindan hai. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Lǝɗangga Sǝsǝna tǝ Pǝɗǝnda kanda heu tǝ kǝm katǝrang ngganda ndikrha hai tǝ fingya miiya ɗǝɗamǝn-ɗǝɗamǝn, kala yanɗi fǝrangna Sǝsǝna tǝ Pǝɗǝnda kanda.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Yahudaya na a tǝrǝm Faara, ɓagha ɓa ahu chehweeya ɗǝɗamǝn na nda ahu Urshalima a sayidɗi. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Sǝk na fiya wumngga hai riirha ǝnɗi kee, tǝrgha ɗaa nda ɓa ka ɓa nda na ǝnɗi katǝragha hai. Ƙǝsangga ǝnwulteena kanda ƙǝsǝr ko wunni sǝkɗǝ kanda a ndikrha tǝ miiyi ndan a mii fatakkwaya hangga wumngga hai.<verse eid="ACT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Əna ǝnwulteena nda, tsakhmee nda, “Nafini heu naa a ndikrha ya, mbǝ Nggalilaya ni wa? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Ƙǝƙǝn ƙǝm kowunni ahur nǝm a sǝk ˈya nanda ndikrha tǝ miighǝn? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Kulo kan kǝm ya Fartiyaya, tǝ Mediyaya, tǝ Elamayaya, tǝ nafiya chehweed Mesofotamiya, tǝ Yahudaya, tǝ yi Kafadokiya, tǝ yi Fantus, tǝ yi Asiya, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />tǝ yi Firijiya, tǝ yi Famfiliya, tǝ yi Masar, tǝ kǝm yi na tsau tǝ chehweed Libiya ɗǝgha Sayirin ɗǝ. Rongya ɓagha ɓa a Roma, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />Yahudaya tǝ kǝm fingya kyahargha hai na takkwa Yahudaya Kǝrǝstaya, tǝ Laraɓaya. Ƙǝm heu sǝkɗǝm nafiniya a ndikrha tǝ mii nǝm aten ǝngya na mǝmanggǝn ǝnana Faara! <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Kanda heu na ǝnwulteena nda tsangga teena kanda, tsahang mee nda fandan, Tur mani ya?” <verse eid="ACT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Amma fingya na ahur fiya wumngga hai na nda a waa farha ndaa nda, “Kanda heu tǝrangna mbaala kanda in!”<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbiturus pǝrɗǝ laɓar Faara a fiya wumngga hai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Tǝrgha Mbiturus thliighasǝ tǝ fathlǝngya kum kab talɗi, tǝranggǝn uradghǝn sǝ ndanggǝn fiya wumngga hai, “Kun heu kaama thlǝmaarha hai ngga, wanmanggina Yahudaya tǝ fingya na tǝ tsaurha a Urshalima! A sahad ɗun aten ǝnɗiya wa. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Fingya ahur nun a ndaarha nafiniya tǝrang mbaala kanda teena. Mbǝ ƙǝkafek ni wa! Tsar ni ˈwan ya. Mbǝ mbaala tǝrang fiya teena a tsar kiya wa. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Awo, ˈya nanun a tsar ɗiya ˈwad annabi Djoyel thlǝkƙǝn ƙǝtǝm.”<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />“ ‘Ndagha Faara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">a mii ngwala ƙǝshiirha, niya fǝrang Sǝsǝnna fiya heu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Wangginun nda hǝshya tǝ nishya na nda a thlǝk ˈya ndana Faara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Wundǝlayi nun na nda a na ǝngya kyaɗang ni kanda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Tǝ kǝm shinggi nun na nda a sǝsǝniirha.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Ko aten mafayina ni nda nishya tǝ hǝshya heu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">Niya fǝrang sǝsǝnna kanda ahu ɓengginiya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">Tǝ kǝm nanda a pǝr ˈya ndani.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Niya kyad ǝnwulteena hai a frakh amshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">Tǝ ǝnsakhrha hangga a hweeɗe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">Fara tǝ waarha, tǝ kǝm hashmbe tǝ ine na tikɗik.<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Na nda a tsawang yanfaara wula,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">Ndǝre kǝm tsauka yiɓa kǝla fara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">Kapa na mamnggit far Chinǝm ɓarha ɓa.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Kala niifa aagha thlǝm Chinǝm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:21">Nǝn wal hǝrǝkrha.’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Djoyel 2:28-32.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />Nafiya Isǝrela, kaama thlǝmarha hai! Yeeso tǝ Nadzarat niifɗi kyaɗang na Faara kun tǝ ndaarha ka niifani, ǝnaɗǝ ǝnwuteengya mǝmanggǝn tǝ ǝnsakhkya ahur nun kun tǝ altennun sǝnɗunsǝ. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Faara fǝrgha niifɗiya a kun tǝ sǝndǝghǝn, kun kǝm tǝ thlarra fa mbǝlfeeya ɓǝlanggun tǝ taurha ɗǝ aten kaɗiirha. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Amma Faara thleng ɗa sǝ ahu mǝrra tǝ kǝm thliiɗa sǝ tǝ yibrha, ƙǝsǝr mbǝ mǝrra mbang ƙǝsghǝn ha a kwarha wa. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Ndauda kǝm thlǝkɗǝ pathla atenggǝn ndǝghǝn, “Naɗi Chinǝm ƙǝtsar a thlǝmanna. Ƙǝsǝr nǝghǝn a yisǝmanna, mbi tǝrǝm nda wa.”<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />“Nanǝn kee, na hurna a lǝghǝtta tǝ wutsefayirha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">Tǝ ƙǝm na miina a falghǝn!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">Na fanna a yibrha tǝ mbǝrsaarha.<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />Ƙǝsǝr mba mal nggi ahu kwad mǝrra wa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">Tǝ kǝmɗa mba nggǝmfa tǝ Peɗǝnduwa mǝlthgha wa.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Kyaɗenna kwaman yibrha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">Na lǝgɗeerha tǝ mbǝnafa a thlǝmad wa.”<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />Kun wanmanggina numama aten ǝnɗiya, mbǝ Ndauda a ndikrha a altenggǝn ahu palthɗi ndani ya wa, ƙǝsǝr mǝrɗǝ pangganda, tǝ ƙǝm ten kwadghǝn ɓalghǝn a thlǝmannǝm. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Amma nanǝn ndǝghǝnggi annabini tǝ kǝm sǝnda sǝ ndangga Faara har tǝ ɗǝf mee, tǝ ndaarha nǝn a tǝrang niifa ahu chichiyighǝn tsawanggǝn ahu tsǝnggam nggǝn. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Nana Ndauda ǝnɗi ɓagha katǝrarha hai a mbee thlǝk pathla nǝn aten thlid Ƙǝrǝsti sǝ ahu mǝrra tǝ ndaarha mal wa ndan hu kwarha wa tǝ ƙǝm mbǝ thlu fadghǝn a mǝthla wa.<verse eid="ACT 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Faara thleng ɗǝ Yeeso sǝ ahu mǝrra ƙǝm heu na ɗǝm ndǝn ƙǝkafek ni. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Nanǝnya fǝrang nda mbǝd tsaurha yi tsǝnggam mamnggirha a talara a yisǝmad Faara. Ƙǝla ndana Chinɗi nǝn a fǝrang Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda, fǝranggǝnǝn kan ƙǝm ndǝghǝn ɓangga ǝnɗa ɓa nun a naarha tǝ sǝkrha a weeriya. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Ƙǝsǝr Ndauda tafadghǝn ˈwawa tǝra talara ɗe wa, amma ndǝghǝn,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 2:34" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">Chinǝm ndanggǝn China,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">“Tsawu a yisǝmanna.<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />Ƙǝl a tsawang ɗi fa tsanggiwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:35">A kamu saryi wa.”<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />“Nanǝn kee, ngwa tsauka tǝ sǝnda ko wunni a Isǝrela tǝ ndaarha Faara ǝnagha Yeeso ɗiya tawang nun ɗǝ a tsauka ndǝghǝnni Chinǝm tǝ ƙǝm Ƙǝrǝsti.”<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Sǝkna nafini laɓarɗi ki Mbiturus tsuwar hur ndan nǝn fa, ndangganda Mbiturus tǝ fingya fa thlǝnggini, “Wan manggina ma nan a ǝnaarha?”<verse eid="ACT 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Nggǝrangga Mbiturus kanda sǝ, “Kowunni ahur nun tǝtani a malanggǝn ɗimiyidghǝn kyahargha thlǝmad Faara ɓa, ǝnang mbaptisǝma nda ahu thlǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti yi chakh ɗimiyirha, tǝ nun wal fǝrra Sǝsǝna tǝ Pǝɗǝnda. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Thlǝkna nda pathɗiya ka kun tǝ wangginun tǝ fingya mbuwa wa Yahudaya tǝ nafiya na Faara a aarha ɓa ƙǝm.” <verse eid="ACT 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Yiyang thlǝmaarha nǝn kanda teena; tǝ fingya pathya hangga tǝ ƙǝm hwan kanda nǝn, “Hǝrgha man fannun ahu ƙǝshiid weeriya yi mbǝlfeerha.”<verse eid="ACT 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Fingya thlǝgha palth Mbiturus kǝm ǝnang mbaptisǝma nda kanda, a farɗiya chik nda tǝ fiya fǝrgha ƙǝkafek takh nda a sǝl haru kumnggitghǝn mahan.<verse eid="ACT 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wum ten fatakkwaya Yeeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Wum teena nda tǝ fingya fatakkwaya Yeeso, ɗǝf teena nda tǝ tsahad fa thlǝngya Yeeso ha tǝ tsau ɗǝɗemnggirha tǝ ndan hu kyang nda mburodi hai tǝ hwan Faara.<verse eid="ACT 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Ko wunni tǝrǝm Faara nǝn, ƙǝsǝr fathlǝnggini a ǝna ǝnwuteengya hangga. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Fa takkwaya Yeeso tsawa nda a mbǝrha tal ndǝghang ngganda ǝnggindan hai na nanda tǝghǝn ha heu. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Heng ngganda ǝnggindan ɗǝ ndǝghang wuɗǝɓǝlghǝnda a fiya na tǝ ɓillarha. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Ka fad ɗathla mbǝrha fa hai na nda ɗǝfang shilee Faara teena ahu Ƙǝn Faara na a Urshalima. Na nda narha wumnda hai ahur wurayindan na nda a kyang mburodi hai hǝb ǝnnarhami nda tǝ wutsǝfayirha tǝ hura tal. <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />Na nda narha fal Faara nagha shili ndan sǝ a fad fiya heu. Ka parra fara fa na Chinǝm narha chighang fingya kanda walgha hǝrǝkrha. Na nda narha fal Faara nagha shili ndan sǝ a fad fiya heu. Ka parra fara fa na Chinǝm narha chighang fingya kanda walgha hǝrǝkrha.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Mbiturus kǝnang ɗǝ sǝfǝnda tǝhwanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Na farɗa sǝ nda Mbiturus tǝ Yahaya kanda ɗiye a Ƙǝn Faara ɗǝ na manggǝn a sayid hwanda na fiya ǝnaarha yi yarra yanfaara hai. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Ndusang nanda Ƙǝn Faara fa na a Urshalima, na niifa sǝ sǝfǝnda ka nggǝttǝghǝn hai na nda narha ɗǝfang nda a kwatkirǝm Ƙǝn Faara na manggǝn na nda aarha “Kwatkirma na ngga,” ka nagha a hwanang nda fiya na kyarha a pǝpal Ƙǝn Faara ɓa na manggǝn. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Nanǝn nda Mbiturus tǝ Yahaya takh nda a kyarha Ƙǝn Faara ɗǝ hwanang wuɗǝɓǝla nǝn kanda.<verse eid="ACT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Nda Mbiturus tǝ Yahaya irang yirha nda fa, ndangga Mbiturus, “Ƙǝlang kan!” <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Sǝfǝndǝɗi ƙǝlanggǝn kanda ngga na midghǝn sǝ a fǝrang wuɗǝɓǝla nda. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Amma ndagha Mbiturus, “Mbǝ wuɗǝɓǝla sǝ a haar na a furoyi wa. Amma ˈya nani tǝghǝn ha ndǝn niya furorha. A hu thlǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti tǝ Nadzarat, thliu sǝ wiina!”<verse eid="ACT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Tǝrgha Mbiturus ƙǝs harghǝn nǝn yisǝma, thlenggǝn sǝ. A mbǝɗi tsu saryighǝn tǝ kukwathladghǝn nagha kanglang. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Thliigha sǝ harat ishgha ƙǝt tǝ saryighǝn. Katǝranggǝn wiirha hai, kyagha ƙǝn Faara ɗǝ tǝ kanda nagha a wiirha hai tǝ pǝra sǝ, nagha a fal Faara.<verse eid="ACT 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Fiya heu naghǝn nda a wiirha hai ndǝghǝn a fal Faara. <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />Kanda kǝm kukwalang ngganda hai ndǝghǝnni na tsaurha a mii kwakirǝm Ƙǝn Faara na manggǝn, na hwanda wa, tǝrgha ǝnwulteena kǝssanggǝn kanda, ka ǝnɗi naa nanda.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Laɓar Mbiturus ahu Ƙǝn Faara na a Urshalima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Na sǝfǝndǝɗi tsǝb tǝ Mbiturus tǝ Yahaya ha, fiya heu ƙǝsangga ǝnwulteena kanda mbǝna nda thlǝmandan ɓa a mbǝrha ɗǝ na nda aarha Mǝthlǝm Sulemanu. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Nana Mbiturus ndǝn kee, ndanggǝn kanda, “Nafiya Isǝrela, kama na teena wulang kun kee? Kama kǝm nun a ƙǝlang kan kǝla tǝ sǝsǝmnda alten nan ni nduwa ka takkwa nan Faara ngga ndǝn ǝnagha ndǝn na kamshiɗi a wiirha ya wa? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Faara yi Ibrahim tǝ Ishaku tǝ Yakubu, Faara yi chichiyinǝm ndǝghǝnni manangga mafadghǝn Yeeso ndǝn ƙǝnangga niifɗiya. Yeeso ɗani fǝr nun ka a ɓǝlang ngganda, kar nun a mbed Mbilatus, na midghǝn sǝ kwang a kalghǝnǝn hai. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Karɗun tǝ Peɗǝnda tǝ, tǝ nggayirha fa, a meghedghǝn kaɗa kalla niifɗa nun hai na ɓǝl farha. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Ɓǝlanggun tǝ fǝr yibrha, amma thlengga Faara sǝ hu mǝrra. Kan ni ƙǝm nagha ndǝn!”<verse eid="ACT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />“A hu fǝrƙǝkafekirha hu thlǝm Yeeso, ndǝn walna niifɗi ƙǝnda ya, kun ƙǝm ˈwaɗun teena sǝnɗun sǝfǝnggidghǝn sǝ. Fǝr ƙǝkafek hu thlǝm Yeeso ndǝn ƙǝnangga a yid nun.”<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />“Nanǝnya shayina, sǝnɗisǝ ˈya ǝna nun kun tǝ mamnggid nun a Yeeso ka yamid sǝnda ni. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Amma Faara nǝghǝn a lǝɗang nda ǝngya ndana annabiya aten Ƙǝrǝsti tǝ ndaarha nǝn tǝta ni na sǝsarha aten ǝngginiya. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Nanǝn ya malaman ɗimiyid nun, kyakhrun a thlǝmad Faara ɓa, tǝna nda tsaɓang ɗimiyid nun ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />Na farghǝn ɓayi ɓana Chinǝm hunang hur nun hai. Nǝn a nggǝr thlǝnang Yeeso kun hai, Ƙǝrǝsti wur nǝn. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Tǝtani a tsauka a talara, pa ɓagha sayid ɗaɓa nanda a wuɗang ǝnggina ɓa heu ndana Faara a mii annabiya tǝ peɗǝnda ƙǝtǝm.” <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Ndagha Musa, “Chinǝm, Faara nun nǝn a thleng annabi kun sǝ ƙǝla nggi ahur nafi nun. Kaaman thlǝmarha fa ahu ǝngya nǝn a pǝrang kun heu. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Kala niifa kargha kang thlǝmarha annabi ɗa fa ya na nda a ndǝghang hai tǝ nafiya Faara.”<verse eid="ACT 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Ka aten Samaila ɓa, annabiya heu thlǝk nda ǝnggini na a katǝrarha hai a weeriya. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Kun chichiiya annabi yina ni, nuwun sǝ ƙǝm ahu ɗǝf mii ɗi ndangna Faara chichiyi nun. Ƙǝsǝr ndangga Faara Ibrahim, “A fad chichiyiwa na nafiya ƙǝshiirha a wal parka.” <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />“Thleng na Faara mafadghǝn sǝ, ˈwaghǝn thlǝnanggǝn kun ɗǝ Isǝrelaya, ka a fǝrang parka nǝn kun, kyakhrang nǝn kun ɓa ahu tar ɗimiyid nun.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Mbiturus tǝ Yahaya a mbed kognaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Nana Mbiturus tǝ Yahaya a kalang fiya sǝ, fingya firistaya yi Yahudaya, tǝ mamnda fa ƙǝla Ƙǝn Faara ha na manggǝn, tǝ fingya sadukiyaya ɓa nda wal kanda. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Mamnggini ya ɓillad nda kaan ka nana Mbiturus tǝ Yahaya a tsahang fiya ha tǝ ndaarha ahu thlǝm Yeeso na thliirha sǝ tǝ yibrha ahu mǝra. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Ƙǝsang ngganda kanda, nanǝn tsǝ figrha hai muwang ngganda kanda a ƙǝnɗǝ ƙǝl a tsar. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Amma fiya hangga sǝkka laɓar ndan fǝr nda ƙǝkafek, chikka hang nda hǝshya takh nda a sǝl haru kumnggitghǝn tuf.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Ɗalthna mbǝrha hai mamngya Yahudaya heu tǝ shingya tǝ fa malǝmngya ngyakhrha wuma nda hai a Urshalima. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Hanana mamnda firis na manggǝn a mbǝɗi, tǝ Kayafa, tǝ Yahaya, tǝ Aledzanda, tǝ fingya hurfaya firis na manggǝn. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Kyang ngganda nda Mbiturus ɓa tǝ Yahaya tsahang mee nda kanda, “Tǝ tur yanggi sǝsǝmnda, nduwa ƙǝm tǝ thlǝm wun ǝnanun ǝnɗiya?”<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Tǝrgha Mbiturus lǝlǝgɗa tǝ Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda ndanggǝn kanda, “Kun mamngya tǝ shingya chehweed nǝm, <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />nun a tsahang mee kan ka ǝna nan ˈya ngga aten sǝfǝndǝɗi ya wa? Na min nun sǝ a sǝn kwaman ɗa nun walnǝn ƙǝnda wa? <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />Ngwa pǝrang nggǝni kun a pǝpal tǝ nafiya Isǝrela heu, tǝ ndaarha wal nǝn ƙǝnda tǝ sǝsǝmnda thlǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti tǝ Nadzarat. Niifɗa ni tawang nun ɗǝ, thleng na Faara sǝ ahu mǝrra. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Laɓar Yeeso ni thlǝk na nda ahu ɗeleewar Faara, nda nǝn, Ferɗi kar na fa tǝngya, ndǝn tsauka fer sar ƙǝnna.<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Mbǝ wal hǝrǝkrha sǝ a ki niifa pak wa! Mbǝ thlǝma sǝ ahu ƙǝshiirha fǝr na nda a fiya, nǝm wal hǝrǝkrha sǝ wa.”<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Wulangga teena mamnggini ka nana nda hǝhasyid nda Mbiturus tǝ Yahaya. Sǝnda sǝ ƙǝm fathlǝnggini sǝri ya pakhtǝɗuya ni, karatawa nda wa. Ɗal teena nda hai kaar na nda tǝ Yeeso. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Amma na nanda a na niifɗi ƙǝnang nanda ƙǝt a thlǝman ndan, mbǝ ˈyasǝ na nda mbang thlǝkrha wa. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />A mbǝɗi kee ndang ngganda nda Mbiturus tǝ Yahaya a mal ƙǝnɗa nda. Tǝrgha kokhnayini ndang ngganda ndan,<verse eid="ACT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />“Ma nǝm a ǝnaarha tǝ nafiniya? Mbǝm ngaala tǝ ndaarha ǝnawa nda ǝnwulteena wa, fiya heu a Urshalima sǝnda sǝ kee. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Amma a nggǝr nda pǝr laɓarɗiya wa, tama ƙǝs thlǝman ndan nǝm a nggǝr nda pǝr laɓara ahu thlǝm Yeeso wa.” <verse eid="ACT 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Tǝrgha aah fathlǝnggina nda ɓa ndang ngganda kanda a nggǝr nda kala sǝ tǝ ƙǝm tsaha nda ha ahu thlǝm Yeeso wa.<verse eid="ACT 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Amma Mbiturus tǝ Yahaya nggǝrang ngganda kanda sǝ ndanda, “Tamnggun ndaarha na mid Faara sǝ a fǝrang mamnggirha nan kun ama ndǝghǝn wa? <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Mban tam malang pǝr ˈya na nan tǝ sǝk nan wa.”<verse eid="ACT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Nggǝr nanda yiyang thlǝmaarha kanda teena, kal kanda nda hai. Wulangga kwamana kanda na a tsǝtsǝl kanda nda, ƙǝsǝr fiya heu kanda a fal Faara aten ǝnɗi katǝragha hai. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Niifɗi kǝnang nanda tsauka ǝnwulteena huradghǝn kalɗǝ kumnggit faɗa.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hwan Faara yi fatakkwaya Yeeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Kal na nda kanda hai, Mbiturus tǝ Yahaya ɗǝnda thlǝma fingya fatakkwaya ɗǝ pǝrang ǝnggina nda kanda ndana mamnda firistaya tǝ shingya.<verse eid="ACT 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Sǝk nanda palthɗi, tǝrangga fatakkwayini urad ndan sǝ ka a hwan Faara nda, ndaa nda, Chinǝm sani na tǝ ngyakhrha ha ǝnagha talara tǝ hweeɗe, wuri aama tǝ kǝm ǝngya heu na ahur ndan. <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Ka ƙǝtǝm thlǝkna pathla Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda tǝ mii mafadwa Ndauda na chichid nan, tǝ ndaarha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">“‘Kama na nafiya mbuwa Yahudaya tǝ sǝbrha hura?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">Kama na nda a mbǝtta hai aten numad ǝngya ka?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Kutǝrya ƙǝshiirha ngwanda fa ka yanda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">Wum kutǝrya hai na nda a tsan Chinǝm tǝ Ƙǝrǝstidghǝn.’”<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Hirdus tǝ Mbuntus Mbilatus tǝ fiya mbuwa Yahudaya tǝ nafiya Isǝrela ahu wupǝri ɗiya wumang nda tendan kar nda mafadwa Yeeso tǝ pǝɗǝnda, wurna na. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Ƙǝkafek, kala ˈya ǝna nanda nǝghǝn tǝ sǝnduwa ƙǝla ndana ka ƙǝtǝm nǝn a katǝrarha hai tǝ sǝsǝmnggit wa tǝ nggǝmnduwa ƙǝmɗa. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />“Nanǝnya, Chinǝm suwu mbǝlfed ndan, fǝrang kanlanggirha kan mafayiwa na a pǝr laɓar wa nǝn. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Pǝpǝnang harwa ɗǝ yi sǝsǝmnda ƙǝnda, tǝ kǝm yi ǝna ǝnwuteengya ahu thlǝm mafadwa Yeeso tǝ Pǝɗǝnda.”<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />A kwasamadɗi hwan na nda Faara, mbǝɗi na nanda sǝ rǝbgha fa, na nda heu lǝlǝgɗa tǝ Sǝsǝna tǝ Pǝɗǝnda. Tǝrgha pǝr laɓar Faara nda tǝ kanglang nggirha.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kala ˈya yi fatakkwaya Yeeso yindan ni heu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Fatakkwayini heu hur ndan tǝ numad nda tal ni. Tǝ ƙǝm ˈya nana nda tǝghǝn ha mbǝ niifa ndaarha yighǝnni katenggǝn wa, na nda ndǝghang nda ǝnggindan hai a pathlang ndan. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Fa thlǝnggini tǝ sǝsǝmnda pǝr nanda laɓar thlid Chinǝm Yeeso sǝ ahu mǝrra, mamnggit nggayid Faara nagha aten kowunni ahur ndan. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Mbǝ yamirha sǝ a fandan wa, ƙǝsǝr nafiya na tǝ pǝpalya tǝ wuraya ha heng nda kanda ɗǝ <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />ɓa nda ɓa tǝ, tǝ wuɗǝɓǝlɗi fǝranggǝnda fathlǝngya ndǝghang nggǝnda nafiya mbuwa tǝghǝn ha.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Ƙǝla, Yisufu, na fa thlǝngya aarha Mbarnaɓa, ndǝna wan tǝ shik farha. Tǝ Lawirha ni ɓaghǝn ɓa a Sayifurus. <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />Na pǝpal ghǝn sǝ henggǝn ɗǝ ɓagha ɓa tǝ wuɗǝɓǝlghǝn fǝranggǝnǝn fathlǝnggini ndǝghang nggǝnda nafiya mbuwa na ˈya sǝ a har ndan.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Hananiya tǝ Shafratu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Na niifasǝ thlǝmnggǝn ni Hananiya, thlǝm nukkun ƙǝm Shafratu, henggǝn pǝpal ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Tǝ sǝnda nukkun sǝ, ɓǝɓee nda ha ahur wuɗǝɓǝlɗi a altenggǝn. Amma ɓagha ɓa tǝ tahadghǝn ɗǝfanggǝn hai a mbed fa thlǝnggini.<verse eid="ACT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Tǝrgha ndagha Mbiturus, “Sa Hananiya, kama nda na malang nda Sheetan kyagha hurwa hai, na nggaɓang nda Sǝsǝna tǝ Pǝɗǝnda fa na ɓǝɓeng nda tahad wuɗǝɓǝl hedɗi a alten wa. <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Kapa na hengɗǝ mbǝ yiwa ni wa? A kwasamadɗi heng naɗǝ kǝm, wuɗǝɓǝlghǝn mbǝ yiwa ni ǝna taara na sǝ ƙǝla na midwa wa? Kama na ǝna ǝnɗiya kee? Mbǝ kanni nggaɓangna fa wa, amma a Faara ni.”<verse eid="ACT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Sǝkna Hananiya pathɗiya, fǝlgha hai mǝrgha, nafiya heu sǝkka ndǝn kǝm ƙǝsangga hǝrenga kanda. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Thliigha wundǝlaya ɓa faɗang ngganda tǝ kaɓad pa mǝrra tǝrangganda ɗa nda pang nda.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Tsǝɓaku kyagha nukkun ɓa, kula ndǝghǝn sǝn ǝnɗasǝ katǝragha hai. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Tsahangga Mbiturus mee, “Pǝrekǝn, sa tǝ Hananiya ǝnɗa wal nun ahu pǝpalɗi heng nun ɗǝ?” Ndǝghǝn, “Nǝghǝn kee.”<verse eid="ACT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Tǝrgha ndangga Mbiturus, “Kama nun numa ˈya kiya wumanggun mee ka a ƙǝƙǝranggun Sǝsǝn Chinǝm? Kulo! Sar nafini pangga chimadwa a kwatminda, nanda a tǝrorha ƙǝshaaɗǝ kǝm.”<verse eid="ACT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />A mbǝɗi tsu kee fǝlgha hai a mbendan mǝrgha. Ɓana wundǝlayina ɓa, ɓa nda walghǝn mǝmǝra tǝrang ngganda ƙǝshaaɗǝ ɗa nda pang nda tsau tǝ chimadghǝn fa. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Ƙǝsgha hǝreenga fatakkwaya Yeeso heu tǝ fingya sǝkka laɓarɗi.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fa thlǝngya ƙǝnang nda haaya hangga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Fa thlǝnggini ǝnanda ǝnsakhkya tǝ ǝnwuteengya hangga kyadgha sǝsǝmnda Faara. Fa fǝrƙǝkafekkya ƙǝtsar na nda naarha wumnda hai ahu Ƙǝn Faara na manggǝn a mbǝrha na nda aarha, Mǝthlǝm Sulemanu. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Mbǝ niifa sǝ a ƙǝshi na midghǝn wum teena tǝ kanda wa, ko nanǝn fiya a fǝrang mamnggirha kanda. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Hǝshya tǝ nishya hangga katǝrang ngganda fǝrƙǝkafek hai a Chinǝm.<verse eid="ACT 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Ƙǝsǝr ka ǝnwultenggini ǝnana fa thlǝnggini, nagha fiya a kyang haaya ɓa hunang ngganda kanda hai a mii kwamana fingya ahu sǝrya tǝ ɗǝnggǝlya tǝna shishingnda Mbiturus ɓarha ten fingya ɓa a na ɗǝ a mbǝraɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Fiya hangga wumngga hai ɓagha nda ɓa ahu talya na tsǝtsau tǝ Urshalima fa, kanda a ɓarha ɓa tǝ haya, tǝ fingya na tǝ ǝnkaheeya fa, kanda heu wal nda ƙǝnda.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sǝsad fa thlǝnggini ƙǝsǝr ka Yeeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Tǝrgha firis na manggǝn tǝ nafiyighǝn heu na nanda tǝ kanda, nafiniya Sadukiyaya ni na nda a sǝrghang fathlǝnggini fa. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Ƙǝsang ngganda kanda, muwang ngganda kanda ahu porsǝna ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Amma a fiɗikrha ɓagha tǝthlǝnda Chinǝm ɓa inanggǝn kwatmingya porsǝn ɗa ɗǝ, kyanggǝn kanda hai. Tǝrgha ndanggǝn kanda, <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />“Ɗaama ahu Ƙǝn Faara ɗǝ na manggǝn ɗun pǝr laɓar weerǝnda yiɓǝdɗiya a fiya!” <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Ɗalthna mbǝrha hai, fathlǝnggini kya nda ahu pǝpal Ƙǝn Faara ɗǝ na manggǝn ƙǝla thlǝghang na tǝ thlǝnda Faara kanda. Katǝrang ngganda tsaharha ha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Firis na manggǝn tǝ fingya nanǝn tǝ kanda aah kognaya nda ɓa heu tǝ shingya Isǝrela. Tǝrgha thlǝn farha nda ahu porsǝna ɗǝ ɗa nda ɓarha ɓa tǝ fathlǝnggini. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Amma sǝlna nafina ɗǝ thlǝn nanda ɗuwa nda wal kanda a kǝn porsǝnɗi wa, wuɗa nda thlǝmad mamnggina ɗǝ ndaa nda <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />“Ɗǝ ɗan ɗǝ ɗan wal kwatmin porsǝnɗi chicha, fa ƙǝlaya ha ƙǝƙǝt a mii kwatkirǝm ɗi. Amma inang nan hai kyanan saɗǝ, walwan niifa sǝ wa!”<verse eid="ACT 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Sǝkna mamnda fa Ƙǝn Faara ha tǝ mamngya firistaya kee, tǝrgha wulangga teena kanda tǝna mii ngwala ǝnɗi a ǝnaarha ƙǝn ya. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Tǝrgha ɓagha niifa ɓa ndanggǝn kanda kulo nafini muwang nun kanda ahu porsǝna ɗǝ ƙǝƙǝt a pǝpal Ƙǝn Faara na manggǝn kanda a tsahang fiya ha.<verse eid="ACT 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Tǝrgha mamnda fa kǝla Ƙǝn Faara ha tǝ nafiyighǝn ɗǝnda ɗǝ ka a ɗanda ɓarha ɓa tǝ fa thlǝnggini. Amma mbǝ tǝ kanglanggirha wa, kanda a tǝrǝmnda na ɗǝ fiya muk kanda tǝ ferya. <verse eid="ACT 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Tǝrgha ɓa nda ɓa tǝ fathlǝnggini isha nda a mbed kognaya ka a tsahangga mamnda firistaya mee kanda ha. <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />Ndangganda kanda, “Yanang ɗan kun a pǝpal tǝ ndaarha a nggǝrɗun tsaharha ha tǝ thlǝmɗiya wa, amma kulo hai tsahang ɗun fiya ha hangga a Urshalima, har kun a puwang hakked mǝrra niifɗi kan fa ɓa ya.”<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Amma Mbiturus tǝ fingya fathlǝngya nggǝrang ngganda kanda sǝ ndaa nda, “Tǝtani a fǝrang mamnggirha nan Faara ama ngyakhrha niifa. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Faara yi chichi yinan thlengga Yeeso sǝ ahu mǝra, a kwasamadɗi ɓǝlang nun ahu taurha ɗǝ aten kaɗiirha. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Tǝrangga Faara a yisǝmadghǝn ɗǝ, tsawanggǝn mamnda tǝ kǝm tǝ hǝrǝkrha, ka a inanggǝn kwaman chakh ɗimiyirha ɗǝ tǝ chakh ɗimiyirha a nafiya Isǝrela. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Kan kǝm naɗan ǝngginiya ƙǝkafek ni, na Sǝsǝna tǝ Pǝɗǝnda kee kǝm, fǝrang na Faara nafiya na sǝk mighǝn.”<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Sǝkna ndan kee, sǝbgha hur ndan ɗǝ kaan na mindan sǝ a ɓǝlang ngganda kanda. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Amma tǝ farisarha sǝ ahur ndan na thlǝmnggǝn Ngamaliya, tǝmalǝmnda ɗǝlewar ngyakhrha Musa, na fiya heu a fǝrang mamnggirha thliigha sǝ ahur kogna yini ndagha a kyagha nafini ƙǝshaaɗǝ ˈwan. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Tǝrgha ndanggǝn kanda, “Kun nafiya Isǝreela, kwarama tǝ ǝnɗi na minnun ǝnaarha a nafini ya! <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Huraya mbǝrgha ɗǝ na niifa sǝ kyagha ɓa na nda aarha Tudas, tsawanggǝn altenggǝn ƙǝla manda niifa. Nafiya takkwagha ndǝn takh nda a sǝl haru kumnggit faɗa. Amma ɓǝlang ngganda, weleng ngganda fa takkwayighǝn ɗǝ, tsauka mii ngwalan ndan ni. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />A kwasamadghǝn kǝm a sayyid thlǝtta fiya, Yahuda tǝ Nggalilarha kyagha ɓa lǝm fiya nǝn fa mbusamadghǝn nda, ndǝghǝnggima ɓǝlang ngganda, nafiya heu mbuwa samadghǝn weleng ngganda kanda hai.”<verse eid="ACT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />“Nanǝnya, niya pǝranggǝn kun kalama nafina hai ya, malaman kanda wii nda, ana numandan tǝ tar ndan yi farha ni mbǝ tǝra hai wa. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Amma ana numandan tǝ tar ndan yi Faara ni mbǝ kwamana sǝ a ˈyaɗanggunun nafina fa ya wa, nun a wal altennun kee a yanda tǝ Faara.”<verse eid="ACT 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Palthɗi keeghǝn tsuwarɗǝ kanda tǝrgha aah fa thlǝnggina nǝn ɓa, tsaɗa kanda nǝn. Tǝrgha ndangganda kanda ma nggǝr nda ndikrha tǝ thlǝm Yeeso wa, a mbǝra kal kanda nda hai. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Tǝrgha thliigha nda sǝ a mbed mamnggini na nda a na wutsǝfayirha tǝ ndaarha tsǝk nda a sǝsanda ka thlǝm Yeeso. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Ka fad ɗathla mbǝrha fa hai na nda narha ɗǝrha a Ƙǝn Faara tǝ ƙǝm kya nda wure-wure na nda a tsaharhaha tǝ pǝr laɓar Faara tǝ ndaarha Yeeso ndǝna Ƙǝrǝsti wa.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Wur nda nafiya mǝd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />A far yini na fatakkwaya Yeeso aten chikrha, tǝrgha fingya Yahudaya na a ndik mii Helenaya na a huhurumnda aten Yahudaya na a ndik mii Aramaya tǝ ndaarha mba nda ɗang nu mǝr yindan sǝ hu ndǝk ǝnnarhami wa. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Tǝrgha fathlǝnggini kumkap sǝriɗi wumang ngganda fa takkwayina ɓa heu ndaa nda, “Mǝmǝlwa wa na a mal pǝr laɓar Faara nǝm, kyam hu tar ndǝk ǝnnarhami ɗǝ wa. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Nanǝn ya wanmanggina, wurama hǝshya mǝd ahur nun na lǝlǝgɗa tǝ Sǝsǝna tǝ kǝm na tǝ huteena fa. Nǝm a fǝrang tarɗi kanda ya <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />ƙǝm ɗǝm mbeeɗǝ tǝ hwan Faara tǝ tsahad laɓar Faara ha.”<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Palthɗi thlǝk nanda mɓenanggǝn fiya heu wumngga hai, wur nafina nda ya: Istifanus, niifa ni na tǝ fǝrƙǝkafek fa lǝlǝgɗa tǝ Sǝsǝna tǝ Pǝɗǝnda, tǝ Filibus, tǝ Mburokoras, tǝ Nikano, tǝ Teman, tǝ Mbarminas, tǝ Nikalas niif Antakiya mbǝ tǝ Yahudarha ni wa amma kyagha hu takkwa Yahudaya hai, nanǝn ya tsauɗǝ ƙǝrǝsta. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Nafini mǝd ya kyaɗang nggǝnda fa thlǝnggini hwan Faara nda ɗǝfang haara nda kanda teena.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Welgha laɓar Faara a mbǝya ɗǝ hangga. Nagha fatakkwaya a chikrha kaan a Urshalima, tǝ ƙǝm firisya hangga yi Yahudaya fǝrgha ƙǝkafek tǝ Yeeso.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kǝsang nda Istifanus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Istifanus nǝghǝn lǝlǝgɗa tǝ nggayid Faara tǝ sǝsǝmnda ƙǝm, ǝnaɗǝ ǝnwultengya tǝ ǝnsakhkya hangga ahur fiya. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Amma farɗa sǝ fingya nafiya ahu Ƙǝn Faara ɓa na ngguchit na nda aarha yi fiya hǝrghang nanda kanda hu mafayirha, katǝrang ngganda ngaala hai tǝghǝn. Na Yahudaya sǝ ɓagha ɓa a Sayirin tǝ Aledzandǝriya tǝ kǝm chehweed Kilikiya tǝ Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Mbusǝ ahur ndan na mbang tsan huten Istifanus tǝ Sǝsǝn Faara na atenggǝn wa.<verse eid="ACT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Tǝrgha shighang ngganda fingya fa ɓǝɓee a nggaɓang ngganda Istifanus fa tǝ ndaarha, “Sǝkɗan ndǝn a ndik laɓar sar farha a Musa tǝ Faara.” <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Thlenggǝn hur fiya, tǝ shingya tǝ fa malǝmngya ɗeleewar ngyakhrha Musa. Ƙǝsang ngganda Istifanus ɗǝnda teghǝn a mbed kognaya ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Nggaɓang ngganda fa tǝ ndaarha, “Niifɗiya ƙǝtsar nǝn narha thlǝk ˈya ɗimi aten kǝn hwan Faara na manggǝn tǝ kǝm ngyakh Musa. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Ƙǝsǝr sǝk ɗan ndǝn a ndaarha Yeeso tǝ Nadzarat nǝn chang Ƙǝn Faara hai na manggǝn tǝ kǝm mbeɗenggǝn ǝntin Musa hai malang nanda ƙǝm hai.” <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Kogna yini heu irang yirha nda Istifanus fa, ƙǝsǝr pǝmnggǝn nǝghǝn a chimnda fa kǝla yi tǝthlǝnda Faara.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Laɓar Istifanus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Tǝrgha Firis na manggǝn yi Yahudaya tsahang mee nǝn Istifanus, “Palth yiniya ƙǝkafek ni wa?”<verse eid="ACT 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Nggǝmangga Istifanus ndǝghǝn, “Wan manggina tǝ chinggina, keema thlǝmaarha fa! Faara tǝ mamnggitghǝn ɗǝɗǝ thlǝmad chichid nǝm Ibrahim ɗǝ ndǝghǝn ɓalɗǝ a Mesopotamiya kapa nǝn ɗǝrha Haran ɗǝ tǝ tsaurha.” <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Ndangga Faara, “Malang chehweed nggǝttǝwa tǝ hurfayiwa, ɗǝnna ahu chehweed ɗaɗǝ niya saworha.” <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Nanǝn kee malangga Ibrahim chehweed Kaldiyayini tsauka a Haran. A kwasamadɗi mǝrna chin, thlǝnangga Faara ahu chehwedɗa ɓa mbǝɗi nanun sǝ tǝ tsaurha ya. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Amma Faara fǝrangwa langaarha a mbǝɗiya wa, ko ɗǝf saara tal yi chehweerha. Ɗǝf Faara miighǝn a ndǝghǝn tǝ chichiyighǝn na ɓayi a samadghǝn nǝn a fǝrang chehwedɗi kanda ko nanǝn mbǝ wanggighǝn sǝ wa. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Ndangga Faara Ibrahim, “Na chichiyiwa a tsaurha ahu chehweerha pak, ǝna tar mafayirha nda sǝsangganda kanda yi hurarha haru faɗa. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Amma niya sǝsang chehwedɗi kyangga kanda ahu tar mafayirha hai, a kwasamadghǝn na nda a kyarha sǝ fǝree mamnggirha nda a mbǝɗiya.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Katǝrarha 12:7; 15:13-14; Kyarhaɓa 3:12</char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />“Faara ƙǝm fǝrang ɗǝf mee nǝn Ibrahim yi thlee muwa a farɗi. Nanǝn tsauna Ibrahim chin Ishaku, thleng muwa nǝn a far ɓeena wuvaɗa. Tsauka Ishaku chin Yakubu, tǝ ƙǝm tsauka Yakubu chin chichiiya Isǝrela kumkap sǝri.”<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />“Ƙǝsǝr chichiiyini na nda a sǝrghang Yisufu fa, hengganda a Masar ɗǝ ƙǝla mafarha. Amma Faara nǝghǝn tǝghǝn ha <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />kyanggǝn sǝ ahu ɓilladghǝn heu. Fǝrang sǝnda nǝn Yisufu tǝ ƙǝm nagha fadghǝn pet a mbed Firˈauna kutǝr Masar; nanǝn kee faɗangga Firˈauna tsauka ngwamna hu chehweed Masar tǝ ƙǝm mamnda ahu wuri kutǝryidghǝn.”<verse eid="ACT 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Tǝrgha miirha kyagha hu chehweed Masar hai tǝ yi Kanˈana. Nagha sǝsaarha sǝ kaan, tǝrgha chichiyinǝm ngwalagha ǝnnarhami hai a haar ndan. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Sǝkna Yakubu ndaarha ɓalgha hwarma sǝ a Masar, thlǝn wanggighǝn nǝn ɗǝ ɗa nda hiirha ɓa, kanda tsauka chichiyinǝm. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Wuttǝ ndan ɗǝ yi sǝri, Yisufu chalmang fadghǝnǝn wan manggighǝn, kyaɗang wanmanggighǝn nǝn Firˈauna. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Tǝrgha Yisufu thlǝngga ɗǝ a chin, Yakubu, tǝ hurfayighǝn a ɓa nda a Masar ɓa, kanda heu kumggit mǝd kap tuf. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Tǝrgha Yakubu ɗǝgha Masar ɗǝ. Mǝrgha a mbǝɗi ndǝghǝn tǝ chichiyinǝm. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Mǝr yindan tǝrangganda kanda a Shekem ɗǝ pangganda kanda ahu kwadɗi hiina Ibrahim a haar wangya Hamor.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />Nduwusna sayidɗa ɓa na Faara a lǝɗang nda ˈya ndanǝn a Ibrahim, hang nda nafinǝm a Masar chikka kaan. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Tǝrgha nggǝrgha nda ǝna kutǝra a pak a Masar sǝngwaa Yisufu. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Kutǝr ɗiya huk ɗǝ nafinǝm nagha a ngyaɓang nda fa nggǝtya a muwangganda wufar waya ɗǝ nggǝt nanda ka a mǝra nda.<verse eid="ACT 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />A hu sayidɗi nggǝt nda Musa, wundakhne ngga a yid Faara. Ƙǝrghǝna fa nggǝtyighǝn ahur minda yi ndǝree mahan. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Ɗǝfang nanda a ƙǝshaaɗǝ, malghǝnda wutarad Firˈauna tǝranggǝn ƙǝrghǝnǝn tsauka yighǝn. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Tsahang thladwayid Masarya nda Musa ha heu, ndǝghǝn nggi ƙǝm nǝghǝn tǝ sǝsǝmnda fa hu laɓara tǝ ǝn ǝnadghǝn.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />Tsǝna Musa hurarha kumggit faɗa, na midghǝn sǝ a weng tala nǝn nafiyighǝn, nafiya Isǝrela. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Na wan tǝ Masar nǝn a ɗǝghang nda tǝ Isǝrela ɗǝ. Ɗǝgha ɗǝ ɗanggǝn tǝ Isǝrela ɗa sǝ, ɓǝlanggǝn tǝ Masar ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Tamngga Musa ndaarha na nafiyighǝn a sǝnda sǝ tǝ ndaarha na Faara a ǝna taara tǝghǝn ka a hǝrghanggǝn kanda, amma sǝngwa nda sǝ wa.<verse eid="ACT 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Ɗalthna mbǝrha hai nggǝrghǝn weng tala kanda fadɗǝn ɗǝgha wal Isǝrelaya sǝri a kanda ndan a yanda. Midghǝn sǝ a ndǝghanggǝn kanda hai, ndanggǝn kanda, “Kun nafiniya, nuwun a wanmanggi. Kama nda nun a yanda tǝ ndan?”<verse eid="ACT 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />“Amma yanɗi na a ɗǝghang nda shadghǝn ɗǝ puwanggǝn Musa man patu ɗǝ ndanggǝn, wunni tsawowa kutǝra nan, tǝ ngwa kumarha aten nan? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Na a ɓǝleerha ƙǝla ɓǝlang na tǝ Masar ɗi ɓǝrarha wa?” <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Sǝkna Musa ndǝn kee, ɗaagha mal chehweed ɗa nǝn ɗǝgha tsau ronggirha a chehweed Mediyan nggǝt wangya hǝshya nǝn sǝri a mbǝɗi.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />“A kwasamad hurarha kumnggit faɗa, tǝthlǝnda Faara ɓagha thlǝmad Musa ɗǝ ahu ƙǝssa waarha ahu ɗǝfrha ngguchit a kaheerha na tsau tǝ wumnda Sǝnai fa. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Nanǝn ndǝn kee, ƙǝsgha ǝnwulteena ndǝn a mbǝɗi. Nduwus nǝn ɗǝ ka ɗǝgha ƙǝlang nda, sǝk urad Chinǝm nǝn, ndanggǝn, <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />Nggini Faara yi chichiyiwa, Faara yi Ibrahim, tǝ Ishaku tǝ Yakubu.” Tǝrǝmngga Musa nagha fadghǝn a rǝprha fa, nggǝrwa fadghǝn ndang nda a ɗǝgha ƙǝlang nda ɓal wa.<verse eid="ACT 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />“Tǝrgha Chinǝm ndanggǝn, Ƙǝɗang paham wa hai, ƙǝsǝr ishgha a mbǝd tǝ Peɗǝnda. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Naɗi sǝsadɗi na nafina a saarha fa a Masar. Sǝkɗi tendan ndǝn ɓani ɓa a ɓi hǝrghang nda kanda. Nanǝn ya ɗuwa ɗǝ, ƙǝsǝr niya thlǝn sa a wuɗana Masar ɗǝ.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Katǝrarha 7:31-34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kyarhaɓa 3:5-10.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />“Musa ɗani kar nanda tǝ ndaarha, ‘Wunni tsawowa kutǝr nan, tǝ tǝ ngwa kumad nan?’ Musa ɗani thlǝnang na Faara ɗǝ ɗǝgha tsaurha kutǝr ndan tǝ ƙǝm tǝ hǝrǝkrǝ ndan a mii thlǝnda Faara kyaɗang nǝn fadghǝn ahu ɗǝfǝdɗi ƙǝsgha waarha a kaheerha. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Kyanggǝn kanda sǝ ahur Masar tǝ ǝnsakhkya tǝ ǝnwulteengya hangga ǝnanǝn. Kyagha tǝ kanda tǝ hur wuri aama na yiɓa, tǝ ƙǝm tǝ hur kaheerha yi huraya kumggit faɗa.”<verse eid="ACT 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />“Musa tafadghǝn ndanggǝn nafiya Isǝrela, ‘Na Faara a thlǝnang annabi kun ɓa ƙǝla nggi ahur nafi nun.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɗeleewar Ngwa Kumaarha 18:15</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Na Musa ahur fiya wumngga hai a kaheedɗi, tǝ tǝthlǝnda Faara ndik ɗǝ tǝghǝn tǝ chingginǝm a Wumnda Sǝnai. Thlǝɗǝ laɓara ɓa yi yibrha fǝrang nǝn ƙǝm.”<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />Amma chingginǝm kar nda sǝk miighǝn fa. A meghedghǝn karghǝnda fa ndaa nda ahur ndan a nggushi wudnanda a Masar ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Ndangganda Haruna, Tangsang faarya ƙǝm sǝ na a naarha a mben nǝm, ƙǝsǝr sǝnggum ǝnɗi walgha Musa ɗiya wa kyangga ƙǝm ɓa a Masar. <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />41 Əna ɗaharha nda ƙǝla wan thlaarha, ǝnang sataka nda na nda a ǝna wutsǝfayirha a ǝnɗi ǝnana nda. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Tǝrgha Faara kyahargha ma kanda malanggǝn kanda na nda a fǝrang mamnggirha wufǝlngaarya na a fǝrakh amshi tsawa nda faar yindan. A hu ɗeleewar annabiya nǝghǝn chichirethlee hai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">Nafiya Isǝrela, a nggini nun a ɓee satakhkya ɓa tǝ ǝn fǝrya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">Ahu hurayini kumnggit faɗa a kaheedɗi wa?<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Awo, nggǝmnda hur nun nǝghǝn hu takkwa ɗahaa yinun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">Mbǝd paa ɗahad Molek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">Tǝ wufǝlngaar ɗahad Rifan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">Tǝ ǝngya tak sanun tǝ har nun non a fǝrang mamnggirha kanda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Nanǝn kee niya ɗǝrha tǝ kun hu tar mafayirha ɗǝ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">A mbǝrha ɗǝ inggun ma Mbabila.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amos 5:25</char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />“Chichiyinǝm tǝrang nda cham hwan Faara a kaheedɗi. Ənagha ndan mǝmǝl ƙǝla kyaɗang na Faara Musa. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Thlǝna nda cham ɗaɓa, chichiyinǝm na a kamu Djeshiwa tahang nda ha ɓa thlǝ nanda chehwedɗi a haar nafini mbuwa Yahudaya rǝghang na Faara kanda ɗǝ. Tsauka cham ɗi a mbǝɗi ta thlakh mbǝd Kutǝra Ndauda ɗǝ.”<verse eid="ACT 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Walgha Ndauda nggayirha a mbed Faara, hwanggǝnǝn na a tǝnang mbǝd tsaurha nǝn Faara sǝ yi Yakubu. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Amma Sulemanu ni tǝngga ndǝn. <verse eid="ACT 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Ko nanǝn kee, Faara Amshi mbǝ tsaurha ahur minda tǝnna niifa tǝ haarghǝn wa. Ƙǝla ndana annabi,<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />Ndagha Faara, “‘Na tsǝnggam nggina a fǝrakh amshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">Chehweerha ndǝna mbǝd ɗǝf sarna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Tsakhka Chinǝm mee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">Nun mbang tǝne Ƙǝn Faara sǝ ngga kee wa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">Nun mbang tǝne mbǝd yibrha sǝ kee wa?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Mbǝ tǝ haryi na ni ǝnani nda talara tǝ hweeɗe wa?’”<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />“Kun nafiya mbuwa wa sǝk ˈya! Na huryinun kakrak mbun sǝk path ƙǝkafek wa. Pa kwanɗǝ nun narha kar Sǝsǝna fa tǝ Peɗǝnda? Chichiyinun ǝnanda kee, kun kǝm nuwun kee! <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Aah ma thlǝm annabi tal sǝsangwana chichiyinun! Ɓǝlang nda fingyayini thlǝkka laɓar ɓad ka niifɗa ɓa Ƙǝrǝsti fǝr nun tǝ ƙǝm ɓǝlang nun. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Thlǝmǝn kee kar nun ngyakhrha Faara fa, ko nanǝn thlǝwun ndǝn ɓa a haar fa thlǝngya Faara.”<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Ndengga mamngya Yahudayini pǝmnggindan hai ka sǝbrha hura sǝk nanda palth Istifanus. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Amma Istifanus lǝlǝgɗa tǝ Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda, ƙǝlagha talara sǝ na kukwaryid Faara nǝn a yanda hai, tǝ ƙǝm na Yeeso ƙǝrǝsti nǝn ƙǝt a yisǝmad Faara. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Ndagha, “Kuloɗǝ, naɗi talara inɗaɗǝ haang Wan niifa ƙǝt a yisǝmad Faara!”<verse eid="ACT 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Tǝrgha nggǝlang ngganda thlǝmayi ndan tǝ haryi ndan na nda ahuhwaarha. Ɗa nda thlǝmadghǝn ɗǝ <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />rǝghang ngganda sǝ ma talɗi katǝrangganda mukƙǝn hai tǝ ferya. Fingya mamngya Yahudaya tsangga ndǝn ƙǝɗangganda kaɓayindan hai ɗǝfang ngganda a mbed wundǝlarha na nda aarha Shawulu.<verse eid="ACT 7:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Muk na ndan, hwangga Istifanus Faara, “Chinǝm Yeeso, thlu yiɓǝd na.” <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Ɓǝrgha hai tǝ waɗedghǝn, tǝranggǝn uradghǝn sǝ, “Chinǝm, a ƙǝsna ɗimiyid ndan ha wa!” Ndanǝn kee mǝrgha.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Shawulu nggǝmɗafa a ɓǝllang ngganda Istifanus.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">Sǝsaarha welengɗǝ fatakkwaya Yeeso hai</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">A farɗa ni katǝrana sǝsarha ɓarha ten fatakkwaya Yeeso ɓa na ahur Urshalima, wel nda hai kanda heu a chehweed Yahudiya ɗǝ tǝ Samariya. Ƙǝl fa thlǝnggini kee ndǝn takhka. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Tǝrgha fingya nafiya na a tǝrǝm Faara pang ngganda Istifanus tǝnda kaan atenggǝn. <verse eid="ACT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Amma Shawulu katǝranggǝn sǝsang fatakkwaya Yeeso hai. Na midghǝnsǝ a kwanggǝn kanda hai. Nǝn kyarha wure-wure nagha a kǝsang hǝshya tǝ nishya ka a muwanggǝn kanda ahu porsǝna ɗǝ.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filibus pǝrɗǝ laɓar Faara a Samariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Fingya weleng na nda kanda hai na nda narha pǝr laɓar Faara kala mbǝrha ndǝn nda saɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Filibus ɗǝɗǝ hu wupǝri Samariya ɗǝ, pǝrɗǝ laɓar Ƙǝrǝsti a mbǝɗi. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Fiya wumngga hai hangga kang nda thlǝmarha fa ngga, ƙǝsǝr na mindan sǝ a sǝk laɓarghǝn nda tǝ ƙǝm na ǝnwuteengya nda ǝnanǝn. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Ənkaheeya hangga kyagha sǝ tǝ huhwaarha a fad fingya fiya. Fiya hangga mǝrna fandan hai tǝ sǝfǝngya wal nda ƙǝnda. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Ko wunni ahu wupǝriɗi ƙǝl ǝna wutsǝfayirha ƙǝsǝr ka ǝnɗi katǝragha hai.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Na niifa sǝ a wupǝri ɗi tǝ kulaarha thlǝmnggǝn Siman nǝn ǝna ǝngya na fǝrang ǝnwulteena Samariyayini. Nǝn narha ndaarha mbǝ tǝ kallǝghǝn sǝ wa. <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Nafiya Samariya heu, yi na manggǝn tǝ na ngguchit, na nda narha ndaarha, “Niifɗiya sǝsǝmnda Faara tǝ pamǝnda ni atenggǝn.” <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Na nda kan thlǝmarha fa ƙǝsǝr ka ǝnwuteengya nǝn narha ǝnaarha ka ƙǝtǝm. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Amma fǝr nanda ƙǝkafek a Filibus pǝr nǝn Laɓara na mbǝnggǝn a kanda yi kutǝryid Faara tǝ ƙǝm aten thlǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti, ǝnang mbaptisǝma nda kanda, hǝshya tǝ nishya. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Siman tǝ tafadghǝn fǝrɗǝ ƙǝkafek tǝ palth Filibus, ǝnang mbaptisǝma nda. Katǝranggǝn mbusamad Filibus hai kala mbǝrha ndǝnǝn saɗǝ, nanǝn ǝnwulteengya tǝ ǝnsakhkya na Filibus a ǝnaarha wulangga teena.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Fa thlǝnggini na a Urshalima sǝkna nda ndaarha nafiya Samariya thlǝnda laɓar Faara fa, tǝrgha thlǝnang ngganda nda Mbiturus tǝ Yahaya a mbǝɗa ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Sǝlna nda ɗǝ, hwanang Faara nda kanda teena na wal Sǝsǝna nda tǝ Pǝɗǝnda, <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />ƙǝsǝr Sǝsǝna tǝ Pǝɗǝnda terwa tendan hai ˈwan wa, ko nanǝn ǝnang nda mbaptisma kanda hu thlǝm Chinǝm Yeeso. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Tǝrgha Mbiturus tǝ Yahaya ɗǝfang haara nda kanda teena, wal Sǝsǝna nda tǝ Pǝɗǝnda.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Nana Siman fathlǝnggini fǝr nda Sǝsǝnɗi hu ɗǝf haara teena, fǝrang wuɗǝlɓǝla nǝn kanda, <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />ndagha “Nggima fǝreema tur sǝsǝmndǝɗi ya, tǝnǝn narha kala niifa ɗǝfang ni haara teena wal Sǝsǝna nǝn tǝ Pǝɗǝnda.”<verse eid="ACT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Amma ndagha Mbiturus, “Sa tǝ wuɗǝɓǝl wa mǝrama, tamngga ndaarha na mbang heng fǝrra Faara sǝ tǝ wuɗǝlɓǝla wa, wa! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Ma njiɗowa hu tarɗiya, ƙǝsǝr hurwa mbǝ mǝmǝl a mbed Faara wa. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Malang tar mbǝlfed wa hwan Chinǝm na. Asǝmha nǝn choho ǝn mbǝlfedɗa ɗǝ na ahurwa, <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />ƙǝsǝr naɗi sa hur wa sǝsǝɓaɗǝ tǝ ƙǝm thluro ɗimiyirha.”<verse eid="ACT 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Tǝrgha nggǝmangga Siman ndagha, “Hwaneema Chinǝm teena naɗǝ tal ahur ǝnggini thlǝk nun ya wal nggi.”<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />A kwasamadɗi taarang nanda Mbiturus tǝ Yahaya mbǝnda laɓar Faara fa tǝ pǝr laɓar Chinǝm, wuɗa nda Urshalima ɗǝ. A hu kwamana pǝr laɓar ɗa nda na mbǝnggǝn ahu talya Samariya.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filibus tǝ Niif Habasha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Nanǝnya, tǝ thlǝngnda Chinǝm ndanggǝn Filibus, “Thliu sǝ turu kwamana ɗǝgha a man ki pǝlasarya ɗǝ hu kaheerha, kyagha ɓa a Urshalima ɗǝgha Nggaza ɗǝ.” <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />A mbǝɗi kee thlii wiigha, ɗǝgha ƙǝmarha tǝ mamnda niifa tǝ Habasha tǝ ɗǝf wuɗǝɓǝl kwatamnda Habasha na aarha Kandis. Niifɗiya ɗǝnǝn Urshalima ɗǝ ka ɗǝgha ɗǝfang shilee Faara teena. <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />Nanǝn a wutta wureɗǝ tsau ahu keke pǝrshe nǝghǝn a karata ɗeleewar annabi Ishaya a tǝrang uradghǝn sǝ.<verse eid="ACT 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Ndangga Sǝsǝna tǝ Pǝɗǝnda Filibus, “Wiuɗǝ ɗa ƙǝsang muwa niifɗi na tǝ keke pǝrshiɗi.”<verse eid="ACT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Tǝrgha Filibus ɗagha thlǝmadghǝn ɗǝ sǝk fadghǝnǝn a karata ɗeleewar annnabi Ishaya, ndangga Filibus, “Sǝnang na ǝnɗa hai na a karatarha ya wa?”<verse eid="ACT 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Nggǝmanggǝn, “Awo, ƙǝƙǝn ni sǝnang hai? Ƙǝl ma fǝle niifa ndǝn hai.” Tǝrgha aah Filibus nǝn a ɗǝgha tsaurha tǝghǝn. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Niifɗi nǝghǝn a karata mbǝrha ahu ɗeleewar Faara tǝ ndagha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">“Ɗǝgha nda tǝghǝn a mbǝd thlee urarha ɗǝ ƙǝla chaukhrarha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">Ƙǝla na kamnda narha tib a naɗǝ tsǝb ahu haara kanda a tsaɗang wasghǝn ɗǝ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">Mbangwa inang mighǝn hai wa.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Kyala nda tǝghǝn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Ngwang ngwanda kumad ƙǝkafek fa wa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">Mbǝ niifa sǝ mbang kala sǝ aten chichiyighǝn wa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Ƙǝsǝr tǝrang nda yiɓǝdghǝn ma ƙǝshiirha.”<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Mamnda tǝ Habashaɗi ndanggǝn Filibus, “Annabi ɗiya path wun nǝn a thlǝkrha? Yighǝn wa nduwa yi niifa pak?” <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Tǝrgha Filibus katǝranggǝn pǝrang laɓara na mbǝnggǝn aten Yeeso, katǝranggǝn hai a mbǝɗi karatana niifɗa sǝ.<verse eid="ACT 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />(Kanda ahur wiirha nduwang ngganda aama fa, ndagha niifɗi, “Kulo, aama ya. Mani a ˈyaɗe mbaptisǝma fa?” <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Ndagha Filibus, “A fǝr na ƙǝkafek tǝ hurwa heu, niya ǝnorha.” Nggǝmangga niifɗi ndǝghǝn, “Fǝrɗi ƙǝkafek Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti Wan Faara ni.”) <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Fǝr ngyakhrha nǝn a isha nda hai. Tǝrgha kanda kyab tǝra nda hai kya nda ahu aam ɗa hai, ǝnangga Filibus mbaptisǝma.<verse eid="ACT 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Kyana nda sǝ ahur aamɗi Sǝsǝn Chinǝm tǝranggǝn Filibus wiigha tǝghǝn, niifɗi kǝm nggǝrwa naghǝn wa, amma wii fadghǝn nǝn tǝ mbǝnafa. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Ɓa Filibus kyagha ɓa ahu wupǝri Adzotus. Fǝr laɓara nǝn na mbǝnggǝn a mbǝɗi tǝ fingya talya hangga a kwamana ta sǝlgha Kaisariya ɗǝ.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Kyaharra Shawulu hai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Shawulu tǝ hufrha hura aten ɗǝrha mbeeɗǝ tǝ sǝsang nda fatakkwaya Chinǝm ƙǝl ɓǝlang nǝn kanda, ɗǝgha thlǝma mamnda firis ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />Kaɗa ɗeleewar nǝn, ka a ɗǝgha tǝghǝn ƙǝn tsahad Yahudaya ɗǝ na a Nɗimaska, a ɗǝɗǝ wal fatakkwaya Chinǝm nǝn a ƙǝsang kanda nda hǝshya tǝ nishya, ɓagha ƙǝnang kanda a wupǝri Urshalima.<verse eid="ACT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Takh nǝn a ndusang Nɗimaska fa, djargha kukwaryirha tenggǝn hai a fǝrakh amshi hai. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Fǝlgha hweeɗa hai sǝk urarha nǝn a ndang nda, “Shawulu! Shawulu! Kama nda na a sǝseerha?”<verse eid="ACT 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Ndagha Shawulu, “Wunni sa, Chinǝm?” Nggǝmangga uradɗi, “Nggini Yeeso, na a sǝsang nda!”<verse eid="ACT 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />“Nanǝn ya thliusǝ ɗǝna hu wupǝri ɗǝ, na nda a puro ˈya na a ǝnaarha.”<verse eid="ACT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Nafini na wiirha tǝ Shawulu ka ǝnwulteena na nanda mbangwa nda kala sǝ wa, kanda a sǝk urad niifa, amma mba nda a naghǝn wa. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Thliina Shawulu sǝ a hweeɗe, amma inang nǝn yidghǝn hai mbangwa na mana hai wa. Ƙǝs haarghǝn nda kya nda tǝghǝn hur wupǝri hai. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Əna ɓeena nǝn mahan mbǝ namana hai wa. A hu ɓenggini ya ǝnawa ˈya mii wa, sawa aama wa.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />A Nɗimaska na tǝ takkwa Yeeso sǝ thlǝmnggǝn ni Hananiya. Aaghǝna Faara ahu sǝsǝniirha, “Hananiya!” Nggǝmanggǝn, “Kulo nggi ya Chinǝm!”<verse eid="ACT 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Ndangga Chinǝm, “Thliusǝ ɗǝna minda ki Yahuda ɗǝ na a mii kwamanɗi na nda aarha kwamana na ndip, tsakh mee na tǝna niif Tarsus sǝ a mbǝɗi na thlǝmnggǝn Shawulu. Nanǝn ya nǝghǝn a hwan Faara. <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />A hu sǝsǝnirha kyaɗang ɗi niifa na nda aarha Hananiya ɗǝnǝn ɗǝfang haara teena tǝnǝn nggǝr na mana hai.”<verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Nggǝmangga Hananiya ndǝghǝn, “Chinǝm, sǝkɗi laɓar kamshiɗiya aten sǝsaarha nǝn a fǝrang nda nafiya na chahal a Urshalima! <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Ɓanǝn Nɗimaska ɓa tǝ ɗeleewar fǝrang na firis na manggǝn ka ɓagha ƙǝsang nda fatakkwaya Yeeso na a Nɗimaska.”<verse eid="ACT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Amma ndangga Chinǝm Hananiya, “Ɗuwaɗǝ ɗa ǝna ˈya ndani. Ƙǝsǝr Shawulu wurra kari tarna ni ka ɗǝgha tǝ laɓarna a fingya ɗǝ mbuwa Yahudaya, tǝ kutǝrya tǝ nafiya Isǝrela kahad. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Nggi tafanna niya kyaɗang ǝngya heu nǝn a saarha fa ka nggi.”<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Nanǝn kee ɗǝgha Hananiya ɗǝ ɗǝgha wal Shawulu. Ɗǝfang haara nǝn teena ndanggǝn, “Wan mana Shawulu, Chinǝm Yeeso walgha sa a kwamana nana a ɓarha mbǝɗa ɓa ya. Ndǝghǝn thlǝngga nggi ɓa tǝna nggǝr na mana hai tǝ ƙǝm lǝgɗowa Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Tsu a mbǝɗi kee, ˈya ƙǝla ɓar ɗǝfrha mukka hai a yid Shawulu, nggǝrghǝn na mana hai. Tǝrgha thliigha sǝ ǝnang mbaptisǝma nda. <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />A kwasamadghǝn ǝna ˈya nǝn mii wal kanglanggirha nǝn.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Shawulu a Nɗimaska tǝ Urshalima</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Shawulu mǝngga ha a Nɗimaska tǝ fatakkwaya Yeeso. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Tsu kee katǝranggǝn pǝr laɓar Faara ahu ƙǝngya tsahad Yahudaya nagha a ndaarha Yeeso Wan Faara ni.<verse eid="ACT 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Kala fiya sǝkka ndǝn ƙǝsgha ǝnwulteena kanda, tsakh mee nda, “Mbǝ niifɗani na a sǝsang tǝ ɓǝlang nda fa takkwa Yeeso a Urshalima wa? Mbǝ ɓanǝn ɓa ka a ƙǝsanggǝn kanda tsawa nda porsǝngya mamngya firis wa?”<verse eid="ACT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Pǝr laɓar Faara na Shawulu a ǝnaarha aten ɗǝrha mbeeɗǝ tǝ kanglanggirha. Yahudaya na a Nɗimaska mbangwanda ngaal ǝngya kyad nǝn tǝ ndaarha Yeeso ndǝna Ƙǝrǝsti wa. <verse eid="ACT 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />A kwasamad ɓengya hangga, ƙǝnangga mamngya Yahudaya hai a ɓǝlang ngganda Shawulu. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Amma sǝkka Shawulu palthɗi ƙǝnang nanda hai atenggǝn. Nda yan fara tǝ fǝɗikrha na nda narha ƙǝlaghǝn fa a kwatkirǝm wupǝriɗi ka a ɓǝlangganda. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Amma a fǝɗikrha fatakkwaya Yeeso kyang ngganda ƙǝshaaɗǝ fǝrghǝnda hai hu kutasa tǝ kwaarha na a fad kad talɗi.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Sǝlna Shawulu a Urshalima ɗǝ midghǝn sǝ na wumngga hai tǝ fatakkwaya Yeeso, amma kanda a tǝrǝmnggǝn. Nggǝm ngwanda fa tǝ takkwa Yeeso ni wa. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Tǝrgha Mbarnaɓa ɓagha tǝghǝn thlǝmad fa thlǝngya Yeeso ɓa, pǝranggǝnǝn kanda kwamanɗi nana Shawulu Chinǝm ahu kwamana nǝn a ɗǝrha Nɗimaska ɗǝ. Pǝrangga Mbarnaɓa ndǝn kanda ƙǝm ǝnɗi ndangna Chinǝm Shawulu tǝ pǝr laɓar Faara ǝnanǝn tǝ kanglanggirha ahu thlǝm Yeeso a Nɗimaska. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Tǝrgha fa thlǝnggini thlǝ Shawulu nda fa. A kwasamadghǝn nǝn narha ƙǝtsar a thlǝman nda a Urshalima, nagha a pǝr laɓar Faara tǝ kanglanggirha ahu thlǝm Chinǝm. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Nǝn narha ngaala tǝ Yahudaya na a ndikrha tǝ mii Helenaya, kanda ƙǝm a kaɗa kwamana na a ɓǝlang ngganda. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Sǝkna fatakkwaya Yeeso ndǝn, tǝrang ngganda ɗǝnda tǝghǝn Kaisariya ɗǝ puwang ngganda hu talghǝn ɗǝ, na Tarsus.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />A farɗani fatakkwaya Yeeso wumngga teena na a Yahudiya, tǝ Nggalili tǝ Samariya wal nanda tsawud ɗǝɗemnggirha, na nda a tsǝrha tǝ chikrha hu ƙanglanggirha. Tsaukwa fatakkwaya Yeeso tǝ tǝrǝm Faara tǝ tǝk mbǝnda Sǝsǝna fa tǝ Peɗǝnda.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ənwultengya ǝnana Mbiturus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Na Mbiturus a weng mbǝya hai hangga, ɓagha ahu tala ɓa na nafiya Chinǝm sǝ na nda aarha Lidda. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />A mbǝɗi ɓagha wal niifa na nda aarha Iniyas mǝrna fadghǝn hai kalth hu sǝra hurarha wuvaɗa. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Ndangga Mbiturus, “Iniyas, Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti ƙǝnoɗǝ thliusǝ tǝrang ɗǝnggǝlwa!” Tsu a mbǝɗi kee thliigha sǝ. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Tǝrgha hang nda fiya na a Lidda tǝ Sharon kyakhra nda thlǝmad Chinǝm ɓa na nanda Iniyas a wiirha hai.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Na tǝ takkwa Yeeso sǝ a Ndjoppa thlǝmnggǝnni Taɓita, tǝ mii Helenaya na nda aaghǝn Ndokas. Nǝn ǝna nggayirha a fiya tǝ ɗang nda fa yamiya sǝ ƙǝm. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />A hu sayidɗi hadgha mǝrgha. Ngwang nanda fa ka ɗa nda pang nda hunang ngganda hai ahur ƙǝnna tǝn nanda aten shadghǝn. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Nanǝn na Lidda tsau tǝ Ndjoppa fa sǝk ndaarha nda na Mbiturus a Lidda, thlǝn nafiya nda ɗǝ sǝri ka ɗa nda hwanggǝn, ndang ngganda, “Usaai ɓoɓa ƙǝkar!”<verse eid="ACT 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Mbuwa Mbiturus samad ndan ɗǝ, hǝrǝm nǝn ndukrha ɗǝ, ɗǝnda tǝghǝn ahur ƙǝn ɗaɗǝ na aten shadghǝn. Lǝɗang nu mǝrya ƙǝnɗi kanda a tǝrha na nda kyad lukkya tǝ shishamarya imangna Taɓita kanda sǝ nanǝn tǝ yibrha. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Ndangga Mbiturus kanda a kya nda hai ma ƙǝnɗi. Tǝrgha mbǝrgha hai hwan Faara nǝn. Kyahargha man thlǝmad mǝrɗa ɗǝ ndǝghǝn, “Thliu sǝ Taɓita.” A mbǝɗi kee inanggǝn yidghǝn hai! Nanǝn Mbiturus thliigha sǝ! <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Ƙǝsgha Mbiturus harghǝnǝn thlenggǝn sǝ. Tǝrgha aah nu mǝryina nǝn ɓa tǝ fingya fatakkwaya Yeeso, kyaɗanggǝnǝn kanda nǝghǝn tǝ yibrha.<verse eid="ACT 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Sǝkka fiya laɓarɗi ahur talɗi heu, tǝ ƙǝm fiya hangga fǝrgha ƙǝkafek a Chinǝm. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Mǝngga Mbiturus ha a Ndjoppa ɗi, tsauka a ki Siman tǝ huna paama.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Tǝ thlǝnda Faara kalang ɗǝ Koneliwus sǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />A Kaisariya na mamnda sodja Romaya sǝ thlǝmnggǝn ni Koneliwus, ndǝghǝn ni mamnda aten sodjaya haru na nda aarha, Wum ten sodja Italiyaya. <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Tǝ tǝrǝm Faara ni, ƙǝla fingya na ahur mindǝghǝn. Nǝn yakh fǝra a fa yamiya tǝ kǝm nǝn yakh hwan Faara. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Na farɗasǝ yarna faara hai, sǝsǝniigha tǝ ndaarha naɗǝ tǝ thlǝnda Faara ɓayi thlǝmadghǝn ɓa. Aaghǝna tǝ thlǝnda Faara, “Koneliwus!”<verse eid="ACT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Ƙǝlangga Koneliwus ɗǝ tǝ hǝreenga, ndanggǝn, “Paɓa mani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:4">Ndangga tǝ thlǝnda Faara, “Hwanduwa tǝ fǝrrǝwa a fa yamiya thlǝ Faara ndǝn tsauɗǝ ǝn ɗaalani in a fadghǝn! <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Nanǝnya thlǝnu fiya a Ndjoppa ɗǝ ɗa nda oh niifa ɓa na thlǝmnggǝn Siman Mbiturus. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Tsauƙǝn a ki Siman, tǝ huna paama na tǝ tsaurha a mii wuri aama.”<verse eid="ACT 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Wiina tǝ thlǝnda Faara, aagha Koneliwus mafaya wurighǝn ɓa sǝri tǝ ƙǝm sodja tal tǝ takkwa Faara, ahur fingya na a ǝnang taara. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Pǝrang ǝnɗa nǝn kanda katǝragha hai thlǝnanggǝn kanda a Ndjoppa ɗǝ.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbiturus wengɗǝ tala Koneliwus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />A ɓindayidghǝn nana fathlǝngya Koneliwus a ndusang nda wupǝri ɗa fa, tǝrgha Mbiturus a mbǝrha sǝ na ɗangkam ka ɗǝgha hwan Faara. Mǝmǝl yanfaara a sǝrǝkrha, <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />ƙǝsgha miirha ndǝn na midghǝn sǝ a ǝna ˈya nǝn mii. Amma na nanda a furha, tǝrangga ɓeena ɗǝ kyaɗangga Faara ǝnwulteena. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Na fǝrakh amshi nǝn inɗaɗǝ, ˈya ƙǝpakh manggǝn ɓayi hweeɗe hai tǝ kudma faɗa. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />A hu ǝnɗi na ƙǝpakh wu na maɓi ya sǝ ɗǝɗamǝn-ɗǝɗamǝn, tǝ ǝngya na wiirha tǝ hura tǝ wuɗikkya ƙǝm. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Tǝrgha ndangga urarha hai, “Thliusǝ, Mbiturus, ɓulu kanda kiina.”<verse eid="ACT 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Ndagha Mbiturus, “Mbǝ tam narha hai wa, Chinǝm. Ka nani ˈwawi kii ˈya ˈyaɗana ngyakhrha Yahuda yinan wa.”<verse eid="ACT 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Nggǝrgha uradɗi kala sǝ, “A anna ˈya tsaɓang na Faara ɗǝ ǝn tsanda wa.” <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Ənɗi kyaɗang na Faara katǝra mahan nanǝn ndǝn. Tǝrgha ǝnɗi na ƙǝpakh nggǝrghǝn wutta talara ɗǝ.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Tsauka Mbiturus hu ɓillarha, ndǝghǝn tǝ mana ǝnɗi a ndaarha kyadna Faara ya. Tǝrgha a mbǝɗi nafini thlǝnna Koneliwus walang nda mindǝɗi isha nda a ƙǝshi a mii kwatkirma. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Tsakh mee nda tǝ mbǝɗani na Siman Mbiturus sǝ. <verse eid="ACT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Nana Mbiturus a numarha aten ǝnɗi na nǝn, ndangga Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda, “Ɓad nafiya ɓa mahan kanda a kaɗa sa. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Thliu sǝ turu hai, ɗǝna ɗǝ tǝ kanda a karna fa wa. A ɓilladna wa ƙǝsǝr nggi thlǝngga kanda.”<verse eid="ACT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />A mbǝɗi kee tǝrgha Mbiturus hai ndǝghǝn, “Nggini niifɗi nun a kaɗaarha. Kama nda ɓanun ɓa?”<verse eid="ACT 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Ndanggan nda, “Koneliwus mamnda sodja Romaya thlǝngga kan ɓa. Ka niifa ni nǝn tǝrǝm Faara yi Isǝrela Yahudaya heu na nda fǝrang mamnggirha. Tǝ thlǝnda Faara tǝ Peɗǝnda ndangga a ɗǝna minda keeghǝn ɗǝ tǝnǝn sǝk laɓar wa.” <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Tǝrgha Mbiturus aah nafina nǝn ɓa tsawa nda ronggighǝn a fiɗikɗi.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 10:23">Mbiturus a minda ki Koneliwus</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Ɗalthna mbǝrha hai ɗǝgha ɗǝ saman ndan, mbuwa fingya fatakkwaya Yeeso kanda ɓagha ɓa a Ndjoppa.<verse eid="ACT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Ɗalthna mbǝrha hai sǝla nda Kaisariya ɗǝ. Koneliwus a ƙǝla kanda fa ƙǝsǝr aahɗǝ hurfayighǝn ɓa tǝ fingya pashiyighǝn. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Kyana Mbiturus mindǝ ɗahai kee, ǝna Koneliwus thlǝmadghǝn ɗǝ ra kurma nǝn hai a mbedghǝn fǝrang mamnggirha nǝn. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Amma Mbiturus ƙǝs harghǝnǝn sǝ ndanggǝn, “Thliu sǝ! Niifa ni nggi kee ƙǝla sa!” <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />A mbǝɗi kee thliigha Koneliwus sǝ, tsǝ laɓara nda kanda kyab kya nda hu ƙǝnɗa ɗǝ wumna fiya sa hai hangga.<verse eid="ACT 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Ndangga Mbiturus kanda, “Sǝnɗun sǝ ngyakhrha Yahudaya nggǝm ngwa fa ƙǝla nggi ɓee minda ki niifa ɓa mbuwa tǝ Yahudarha ƙǝla yanɗiya wa. Amma Faara keɗee ɗa ndǝn a numaɗi aten niifa tǝ ndaarha ǝn tsandani wa. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Nanǝn kee thlǝn nanda farha ɗǝ a ɓee ɓa karyi fa wa. Nanǝnya pǝremadghǝn ǝnɗi aah nun nggi ɓa.”<verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Ndagha Koneliwus, “Ɓeena faɗa mbǝrgha ɗǝ nggi a hwan Faara ahur kǝnna mǝmǝl yar yan fara hai. Kula sǝndǝna sǝ, na niifa ni ƙǝt tǝ luwudghǝn a chimnda fa a mbenna. <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />Ndeeghǝn, ‘Koneliwus, sǝk Faara hwanduwa, tǝ ƙǝm naɗǝ fǝrrǝwa a fa yamiya! <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Nanǝn kee, thlunu nafiya a Ndjoppa ɗǝ ɗanda aah Siman Mbiturus ɓa. Nǝghǝn tǝ tsaurha a minda ki Siman, tǝ huna paama na tǝ tsaurha a mii wuri aama.’ <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Nanǝn kee ndǝn thlǝnni farha ɗǝ ƙǝkar, nǝghǝn ngga a ɓana ɓa. Nanǝnya kulo ƙǝm ya heu, a mbed Faara ka a sǝk ǝngya nan heu purona Faara.”<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thlǝk Mbiturus pathla a minda kii Koneliwus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Tǝrgha ndagha Mbiturus, “Naɗi ndǝn ngga Faara mbǝ wura ha sǝ wa. <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Amma nǝn thlǝ fiya fa ahu chehweeya heu na a tǝrǝmnggǝn kanda ƙǝm a ǝna ˈya na mǝmǝl. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Sǝnɗisǝ sǝkɗun laɓara na mbǝnggǝn thlǝnang nanda nafiya Isǝrela ɗǝ tǝ ndaarha na tsawud ɗǝɗemnggirha sǝ a thlǝmad Faara ahu thlǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti, na Chinǝm heu. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Sǝnɗun ˈya katǝragha hai a chehweed Yahudiya, ǝnɗiya ˈwaghǝn katǝragha hai a Nggalili a kwasamadɗi katǝrang na Yahaya tǝ Mbaptisǝma pǝr laɓar Faara aten mbaptisǝma. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Mbǝ ngaala sǝ wa sǝnɗun sǝ Faara ndǝn faɗangga Yeeso tǝ Nadzarat tǝ Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda tǝ sǝsǝmnda ƙǝm. Tǝrgha Yeeso nagha a wiirha hai tǝ ǝna nggayirha tǝ ƙǝnang nda fiya heu djithlang na Sheetan kanda hai, ƙǝsǝr na Faara tǝghǝn ha.<verse eid="ACT 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />“Ƙǝm fa thlǝngya Yeeso naɗǝm ǝnggini ǝnanǝn heu tǝ yid nǝm a chehweed Yahudiya tǝ wupǝri Urshalima. Ɓǝlangganda tǝ taurha ɗǝ aten kaɗiirha. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Amma a kwasamad ɓeena mahan thlengga Faara sǝ ahu mǝrra. Tǝrgha Faara malanggǝn kyad fadghǝnǝn, <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />mbǝ a fiya heu wa, amma a ƙǝm ˈwana Faara wura a tsauka ƙǝmni nagha ndǝn. Ƙǝmni hǝbgha tǝ saarha tǝ ndǝghǝn a kwasamadɗi thliinǝn sǝ ahu mǝra. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Ndanggǝn ƙǝm a pǝr laɓar Faara nǝm ko a yanggi ni kyad ndaarha nǝm ndǝghǝn ni wurna Faara a tsauka tǝ ngwa kumarha heu tǝ fa yibya tǝ mǝrya. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Ndǝghǝnni thlǝkna annabiya pathla a tenggǝn ƙǝtǝm, tǝ ndaarha kala niifa fǝrgha ƙǝkafek a ndǝghǝn na Faara a chahang ɗimiyid ndan kanda ɗǝ ahu thlǝmnggǝn.”<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nafiya mbuwa Yahudaya thlǝnda Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Nana Mbiturus aten thlǝk ǝnggini ya, tǝrgha Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda aten nafina hai sǝkka laɓarɗi. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Yahudaya mbuwa samad Mbiturus fǝrgha ƙǝkafek na ǝnwulteena nda tǝ ndaarha fǝrra Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda irɗǝ aten fingya hai mbuwa Yahudaya, ƙǝm. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Ƙǝsǝr sǝk nda fandan a ndikrha tǝ miiya ɗǝɗamǝn-ɗǝɗamǝn na nda a fal Faara.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:46">Tǝrgha Mbiturus tsakh mee nǝn, <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />“Mani ˈyaɗang mbaptisǝma nafina fa tǝ aama ya, nanǝn thlǝnda Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda ƙǝla ƙǝm?” <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Nanǝn kee ndagha Mbiturus a ǝnang Mbaptisǝma nda kanda ahu thlǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti. A kwasamadghǝn hwangga Koneliwus ndǝn a mǝngga ha tǝ kanda.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">Pǝr Mbiturus kwamanɗi tsauna fingya mbuwa Yahudaya fatakkwaya Yeeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Tsǝɓaku fa thlǝnggini tǝ fingya fatakkwaya Yeeso na tǝ tsaurha a Yahudiya sǝk ndaarha nda fingya mbuwa Yahudaya thlǝnda laɓar Faara. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Ɓana Mbiturus Urshalima ɓa, nafiya thleng nanda muwa kanda na nda a kikighǝn fa ndaa nda, <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />“Kyanna a minda ki nafiya hai thlewa muwa tǝ ƙǝm hǝb ǝnnarhami tǝ kanda!”<verse eid="ACT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Tǝrgha Mbiturus pǝrang nggǝnǝn kanda a pǝpal ˈya katǝragha hai heu. <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />Ndǝghǝn, Farɗa sǝ a Ndjoppa, nani a hwan Faara, tǝreegha ɓeena ɗǝ na ˈya ni ƙǝpakh tǝ kudma faɗa a fǝrakh amshi ɓagha thlǝmadna hai. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Ƙǝlang ni ǝnɗi na ƙǝpakh, na maɓiya ni ɗǝɗamǝn-ɗǝɗamǝn na a wuri tǝ yi kaheerha, tǝ fingya a kakhrha tǝ hura, tǝ wuɗikkya. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Sǝk urarha ni tǝ ndaarha, “Thliusǝ Mbiturus, ɓulu kanda kiina.”<verse eid="ACT 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Nggǝmanggi ndee, “Mbǝ tam narha hai wa, Chinǝm. Ka nani ˈwawi kii ˈya ˈyaɗana ngyakhrha Yahudayi nan wa.”<verse eid="ACT 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Nggǝrgha uradɗi kala sǝ yi sǝri, “A anna ˈya tsaɓang na Faara ɗǝ ǝn tsanda wa.”<verse eid="ACT 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Katǝragha ǝnɗa hai ya sara mahan kapa na ǝnɗi na ƙǝpakh na tǝ maɓiyini wutta talara ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />A sayidɗi kee nafiya mahan thlǝn nanda kanda ɓa a Kaisariya nduk nda mindǝɗa ɓa nani sǝ. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Ndeegha Sǝsǝna a karɗi wiirha fa tǝ kanda wa. Wan mamnggini mikki ɗǝfeegha ɗǝ, ɗan kyarha minda ki niifɗa hai tsakhka kan. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Pǝrang laɓar tǝ thlǝnda Faara nǝn kan ɓagha walghǝn a minda keeghǝn, ndang nǝn, “Thlunu farha a Ndjoppa ɗun ndang nda Siman Mbiturus a ɓagha ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Nǝn a puro kwamanɗi na Faara a hǝrworha heu tǝ nafiya wuri wa!”<verse eid="ACT 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Tǝrgha ɗǝgha Mbiturus mbeeɗǝ tǝ ndaarha, A mbǝɗi ɗi mbeeɗǝ tǝ pǝrang Laɓarɗi kanda na Mbǝnggǝn. Katǝrang ni hai kee, tǝrgha Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda atendan hai, ƙǝla ˈwanǝn tǝra tennan hai. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Tǝrgha ɗal teena ni hai tǝ palth Chinǝm ndanǝn, “Ənagha Yahaya mbaptisma tǝ aama, amma na nda a ǝnang mbaptisma kun tǝ Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda.” <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Nanǝn kee, nanǝn fǝrang Faara fingyayini mbuwa Yahudaya tur fǝrrǝɗi fǝrang nǝn kan sayidɗi fǝr nan ƙǝkafek a Chinǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti, wunni nggi na ngaalang nda Faara?<verse eid="ACT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Hǝrǝm nanda sǝkƙǝn kee, wulangga ˈya kanda na a thlǝgha nda. Katǝrang ngganda fal Faara hai ndaa nda, “Faara ƙǝm fǝrang ɗǝ fingya mbuwa Yahudaya kwamana na malang ngganda ɗimiyid ndan wal yibrha nda mbuwa ngwalarha.”<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fa takkwaya Yeeso a Antakiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Nanǝn ya, fatakkwaya Yeeso wel nda hai ka sǝsaarha a kwasamadɗi ɓǝlang nanda Istifanus. Ɗǝnda ɗǝ inggun ta Finikiya ɗǝ tǝ Sayifurus tǝ Antakiya na a chehweed Suriya. Pǝr laɓar Faara nda a Yahudaya katen ndan kee. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Fingya fatakkwaya Yeeso thliigha a Sayifurus tǝ Sayirin ɗǝnda Antakiya ɗǝ, katǝrang nda pǝr laɓara hai na mbǝnggǝn aten Chinǝm Yeeso a fingya mbuwa Yahudaya. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Sǝsǝmnda Chinǝm nǝghǝn tǝ kanda ha, fiya hangga fǝrgha ƙǝkafek kyahar nda thlǝmad Chinǝm ɓa.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Sǝkna fatakkwaya Yeeso na a Urshalima laɓarɗi, thlǝnang ngganda Mbarnaɓa a Antakiya ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Sǝl nǝn ɓa nanǝn nggayid Faara tǝ kanda, tǝk mbǝnda nǝn fa, ndanggǝn kanda a tsawa nda ƙǝtsar tǝ ƙǝkafek fa a Chinǝm. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Mbarnaɓa ka niifa ni, nǝghǝn lǝlǝgɗa tǝ Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda tǝ fǝrƙǝkafek fa ƙǝm. Ɓad nda ɓa tǝ fiya hangga a thlǝmad Chinǝm ɓa.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Tǝrgha Mbarnaɓa ɗǝgha Tarsus ɗǝ ka ɗǝgha kaɗa Shawulu. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Ɗǝnǝn walang nda ɓagha tǝghǝn Antakiya ɓa. Kanda kyab tsawa nda a mbǝɗi hurarha tal kanda tǝ fatakkwaya Yeeso na nda a tsahang fiya ha hangga. A hu tal Antakiya ni ˈwana nda aah fatakkwaya Yeeso Ƙǝrǝstaya.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />A hu sayidɗi, thliigha fingya annabiya a Urshalima ɗǝnda Antakiya ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Tal ahur ndan na thlǝmnggǝn Anggabus thliigha sǝ a fara tal ahu tsawundan hai thlǝk ndaarha nǝn na miirha na kyarha hu chehweed Romaya hai kahat. Lǝghǝdgha palth ɗi ya a thlakh mbǝd kutǝryid Kalaudiyus. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Fa takkwayini kii Yeeso na a Antakiya ƙǝnang ngganda hai na nda a ɗang nda shayindan sǝ na a Yahudiya. Ko wunni fǝr ˈya nǝn nggǝmna hurghǝn. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Ənɗa ǝna nanda ya, thlǝnang ngganda Mbarnaɓa ɗǝ tǝ Shawulu a ɗang ǝn fǝryi ndan nda shingya fatakkwaya Yeeso ɗǝ na a Urshalima.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Kutǝra Hirdus kyang ɗǝ fatakkwaya Yeeso hu sǝsaarha hai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Mǝmǝl ahu sayidɗa niya katǝrang na Kutǝra Hirdus kyang fingya fatakkwaya Yeeso hu sǝsaarha hai. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Fǝr Yakubu nǝn wan man Yahaya a ɓǝlang ngganda tǝ thlaukh ƙǝlaara. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Nanǝn ǝnɗi ǝnanǝn mbǝnang ɗǝ mamngya Yahudayini, ɗǝgha mbeeɗǝ ƙǝsanggǝn Mbiturus ƙǝm. Katǝragha ǝnɗa hai ya ahu sayid Wutsǝfayid Mburodi kula Mekhna. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Muwanggǝn hu porsǝna ɗǝ nagha sodjaya kumkap mikki a ƙǝlaghǝn ha, na nda a mbeɗeghǝn ha sodjaya faɗa-faɗa. Na mid Hirdus sǝ a ngwang kumarha nǝn sǝ a mbed fiya a kwasamadɗi ngwalana wutsǝfayidɗi. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Amma nana Mbiturus ahu porsǝnɗi, nagha fatakkwaya Yeeso a hwan Faara kaan atenggǝn.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tǝthlǝnda Faara hǝrghang ɗǝ Mbiturus ahu porsǝna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />A fǝɗikɗi kapa na mbǝrha ɗathla hai na Hirdus a ngwang kumarha Mbiturus sǝ, Mbiturus kalth a shiirha ƙǝnang nda hai tǝ wuyiwurya sǝri, a pathlang sodjaya sǝri ƙǝƙǝt atenggǝn tǝ fingya sodjaya ƙǝm ƙǝƙǝt a ƙǝla kwatkirǝm porsǝn ɗa ha. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Kula sǝndǝndan sǝ kyagha tǝ thlǝnda Chinǝm ɓa djargha kukwaryirha hai ahu ƙǝn porsǝnɗi. Tsang ˈya nǝn fa a kakh pǝniighǝn mekhnenggen sǝ ndanggǝn, “Thliusǝ ƙǝkar!” Wuyiwur yini na a tsaɓad haaryighǝn tsama nda hai. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Tǝrgha ndangga tǝ thlǝnda Faara, “Kalang luwudwa tǝ paham wa.” Ənagha kee. Ndangga tǝ thlǝnda Faara, “Nanǝnya kawang kootod wa fa mbu samadna na.”<verse eid="ACT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Tǝrgha Mbiturus mal porsǝn ɗa nǝn mbu samadghǝnǝn. Amma ahu sayidɗi wu tamnggǝn ndaarha nǝghǝn a sǝsǝniirha ni. Sǝngwa sǝ ƙǝkafekni ǝnɗi na a katǝrarha hai wa. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Mbǝrang ngganda mbǝd fa ƙǝlaya hai sǝri, ɓa nda kwatkirǝm ɗa ɓa ǝna nanda tǝ ɗǝɓǝlya na a kyarha ƙǝshaaɗǝ. Ingga ɗǝ heu tafadghǝn. Kya nda ƙǝshaaɗǝ. Katǝrang ngganda wiirha hai ahur kwaman talɗi, tǝrgha tǝ thlǝnda Faara kula sǝndǝndan sǝ sahadgha ma yidghǝn.<verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Tǝrgha wudna huten Mbiturus ɓa ndǝghǝn, “Nanǝnya sǝnɗi sǝ mbǝ ngaala sǝ wa Chinǝm thlǝnangga tǝthlǝndǝghǝn ɓa ka a hǝryeghǝn a haar Hirdus tǝ ǝngya heu na mid Yahudaya a ǝneegha nda fa.”<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Sǝnang nǝn hai kee, ɗǝgha minda ki Mairamu ɗǝ man Yahaya na nda aarha Markus, a mbǝɗi wumna fiya sa hai kanda a hwan Faara. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Ishgha a mii kwatkirǝm ɗi ɗǝkƙǝnǝn. Kyagha mafad wutararha ɓa na nda aarha Ruda ka ɓagha nggǝmang nda adɗi na a kwatkirǝm ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Sǝnang nǝn urad Mbiturus hai, tǝk mbǝnda nǝn fa kaan. A meghedghǝn na a inanggǝn kwatkirma hai, wudgha hur minda ɗǝ ka ɗǝgha pǝranggǝn fiya heu tǝ ndaarha, “Mbiturus ƙǝt a kwatkirma!”<verse eid="ACT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Ndangganda, “Kyahar na huten wa?” Djib pǝrrǝghǝn nǝn. A mbǝɗi ndaa nda, “Tǝthlǝnda Faarghǝn ni!”<verse eid="ACT 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Amma ɗǝgha Mbiturus mbeeɗǝ tǝ ɗǝk kwatkirma. Inang nanda kwatkirma hai nana ndan ƙǝsgha ǝnwulteena kanda. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Sahangga Mbiturus haara kanda a nggasa nda hai. Pǝrang kwaman ɗa nǝn kanda hǝrghang na Chinǝm na nǝn ahu porsǝnɗi. Ndanggǝn kanda, “Pǝraman ndǝghǝn Yakubu tǝ fingya wan mangginǝm ǝnɗi katǝragha hai.” Tǝrgha ɗǝgha mbǝrha ɗǝ pak.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Ɗalth na mbǝrha hai, wulangga teena sodja yini aten ǝnɗi katǝragha hai tǝ Mbiturus. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />A kwasamadɗi ndaana Hirdus a kaɗaghǝn nda walang ngwa nanda, ra mu sodja yina nǝn ngga. Fǝr kanda nǝn a ɓǝlang ngganda kanda mbǝɗi. A kwasamadghǝn thliigha Hirdus a Yahudiya ɗǝgha Kaisariya ɗǝ tsǝgha tsǝɓaku a mbǝɗi.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mǝrra Hirdus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Nanǝnya sǝb hur Hirdus ɗǝ tǝ nafiya Taya tǝ Sidǝn. Thlǝn farha nda ɗǝ ka ɗa nda kaɗa kwaman tsawud ɗǝɗemnggirha tǝghǝn, ƙǝsǝr mbǝrsagha nda tǝ ǝnnarhami na hu chehweedghǝn. Nafini thlǝnna nda ɗǝ kaɗa thlaara nda a har Mbilatus, tǝ ɗang nda Hirdus sǝ. <verse eid="ACT 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Sǝlna farɗa ɓa nanda wuma nda hai tǝghǝn, kalangga Hirdus kaɓad kutǝryidghǝn fa tsauka ahu tsǝnggamnggǝn sǝ thlǝghang pathla nǝn kanda sǝ. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Sǝkna fiya ndǝn tǝrang ngganda urandan sǝ ndaa nda, “Urad faarani mbǝ yi niifa ni wa.”<verse eid="ACT 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Tsu a mbǝɗi kee, ka fal waana Hirdus Faara ɗǝkka tǝthlǝnda Chinǝm ndǝn tǝ wan haarha, nagha waaya a kiighǝn pa mǝrgha.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Amma Laɓar Faara na Mbǝnggǝn ƙǝl ɗǝrha mbee ɗǝ nagha fatakkwaya Yeeso a chikrha kaan.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Ngwalang nanda Mbarnaɓa tǝ Shawulu ˈya ɓangga kanda Urshalima ɓa, wuɗa nda Antakiya ɗǝ, tahangganda Yahaya ha ɗǝ na nda aarha Markus.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s">Wur nda Mbarnaɓa tǝ Shawulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />A hur fatakkwaya Yeeso na a Antakiya na annabiya sǝ tǝ famalǝmngya: Nda Mbarnaɓa ni tǝ Siman na nda aarha “Tǝimnda,” Lusiyos tǝsarirarha, tǝ Maana tsǝgha sǝ tal tǝ kutǝra Hirdus Antipas tǝ Shawulu. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Farɗasǝ na nafiniya a tǝrang shilee Chinǝm teena, tǝ kar aama, ndagha Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda, “wureema nda Mbarnaɓa tǝ Shawulu ƙǝsǝr ka taara na manggǝn na minna a ǝneegha nda.” <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Nanǝn kee a kwasamadɗi ngwalang nanda kar aama tǝ hwan Faara, sang haara nda kanda teena yi parka thlǝn kanda nda.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nda Mbarnaɓa tǝ Shawulu a Sayifurus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />A kwasamadɗi thlǝnna Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda nda Mbarnaɓa tǝ Shawulu, ɗǝnda wupǝri Salukiya ɗǝ, tǝra nda hu kombuwol hai ɗǝnda a wutambar Sayifurus ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Sǝl nanda Salamis ɗǝ kya nda hu ƙǝn tsahad Yahudaya ɗǝ pǝr laɓar Faara nda a mbǝɗi. Na Yahaya Markus a samad ndan nagha a ɗang kanda sǝ. <verse eid="ACT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Weng ngganda talyina hai kahat na ahu wutambar chehwedɗi ta Pafos ɗǝ. A mbǝɗani wal nanda tǝmutu Yahudarha sǝ, annabi tǝ nggaɓaarha na thlǝmnggǝn Mba Djeshiwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Thlǝmɗiya tǝ mii Aramayarha ni, ndaarha ni “Wan Djeshiwa”</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Nǝghǝn a ǝnang taara ngwamna, Sardiyus Mbulus sǝ, niifa ni na tǝ sǝnda kaan. Thlǝn farha nǝn ɗǝ ɗa nda aang nda Mbarnaɓa ɓa tǝ Shawulu, ƙǝsǝr na midghǝn sǝ a sǝk laɓar Faara nǝn. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Amma Alimas, tǝmutu ɗi (thlǝmnggǝn ni tǝ mii Helenaya), ndanggǝn ngwamna ɗi a kang ɗǝ thlǝmaarha nda Mbarnaɓa fa tǝ Shawulu aten ˈya nanda a thlǝghang nda wa. Na midghǝn sǝ kyakhranggǝn huten ngwamna ɗa hai a fǝrɗǝ ƙǝkafek wa.<verse eid="ACT 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Tǝrgha Shawulu na nda aarha Mbulus, nǝghǝn lǝlǝgɗa tǝ Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda, ƙǝlanggǝn tǝmutu ɗi hu yidsǝ ndanggǝn, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />“Sa wan Sheetan ni, tǝ tsan ǝngya heu na nggǝngga! Naa lǝlǝgɗa tǝ ǝn hukkya tǝ mbǝlfeerha ƙǝm. A kwan na a malang ishang nda fiya ma takkwa ƙǝkafekkid kwaman Chinǝm? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Nanǝnya, na Chinǝm a ɓang sǝsaarha a tenwa ɓa, Na a tsaurha kwamarha. Na a mǝndaha mba a na yanfara wa.” Tsu a mbǝɗi kee wufiirha tǝ wula tǝrgha atenggǝn hai, nagha a wiirha hai tǝɗak-tǝɗak nagha a kaɗa niifa na a ƙǝs harghǝnǝn tǝnǝn kyaɗang kwamana. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Nana ngwamna ǝnɗi katǝragha hai, fǝrƙǝkafek nǝn, ƙǝsǝr ƙǝs ǝnwulteena ndǝn ahu tsahadɗa ha sǝk nǝn aten Chinǝm.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nda Mbulus tǝ Mbarnaɓa a Antakiya na a chehweed Pishiidiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Tǝrgha Mbulus tǝ ka wiyighǝn mal Pafos nda, tǝra nda ahu kombuwol hai ɗǝnda Pǝrngga ɗǝ na hu chehweed Pamfiliya. A mbǝɗani malna Yahaya Markus kanda wudgha Urshalima ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Amma nda Mbarnaɓa tǝ Mbulus wii nda tǝ saara a Antakiya ɗǝ na a chehweed Pishiidiya. A far yibrha Yahudaya kya nda hu ƙǝn tsahad Yahudaya ɗǝ tsawa nda hai. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />A kwasamadɗi karatang nanda ɗeleewar ngyakhrha Musa tǝ yi annabiya, mamnggini na tǝ ƙǝn tsahadɗa ha thlǝnang farha nda kanda ɗǝ tǝ ndaarha, “Wan manggina, ana laɓara sǝ a mii nun a kan, thlǝgha madghǝn!” <verse eid="ACT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Thliigha Mbulus sǝ, tǝranggǝn harghǝn sǝ ka a nggasa nda hai ndǝghǝn, “Nafiya Isǝreela, tǝ kun fingya mbuwa Yahudaya na a tǝrǝm Faara, keema thlǝmaarha fa. <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Faara yi nafiya Isǝreela ndǝn wurgha chichiyi nǝm, malang ɗǝ kanda a ɗǝnda mbeeɗǝ ahu sayidɗi na nanda a chehweed Masar. Tǝrgha tǝ sǝsǝmndǝghǝn na kanglang kyanggǝn kanda sǝ ahu chehwedɗi. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Ƙǝrǝsgha tǝ kanda ahu hurarha kumnggit faɗa a kaheerha. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Ndǝghǝn ǝnagha ndǝn ɓǝlang nanda chehweeya ɗǝ mǝd na a Kanˈana fǝrang chehwedɗa nǝn Isǝreela tsauka langaad ndan.” <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Ənggini heu ya ǝnaɗǝ huraya 450. “Akwasamadghǝn, fǝrangga Faara fa ngwa kumaya kanda ǝna kutǝryirha nda aten ndan ta hu sayid annabi Samaila ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Tǝrgha nafini hwan kutǝra nda, fǝrangga Faara Shawulu wan Kish kanda, turya Mbenjemen. Əna kutǝryirha nǝn yi huraya kumnggit faɗa. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Amma ƙǝɗangga Faara Shawulu hai faɗanggǝn Ndauda a meyedghǝn, niifɗa ndana Faara, ‘Ndauda wan Djeeshi tur niifɗa ni na mid hurna; nǝn ǝna ǝngya heu na minna a ǝneeghǝn.’” <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />“Ahu turya niifɗa ni ya, ɓang na Faara tǝhǝrǝkrha ɓa, Yeeso ɗa ni ndana Faara nǝn a thlǝnang ɓa! <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Kapa na Yeeso ɓarha ɓa, Yahaya pǝrɗǝ laɓar mal ɗimiyirha tǝ ƙǝm mbaptisma a nafiya Isǝreela heu. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Takhna Yahaya a ngwalang nda targhǝn tsakh mee nǝn, ‘Nuwun a numad ndaarha nggini Ƙǝrǝsti wa? Awo, amma nǝghǝn ɓayi a samanna, tsikki na a kwasanggi sakh pahamnggǝn hai wa.’ <verse eid="ACT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />Wan manggina, kun wangya Ibrahim, tǝ ƙǝm kun fingya mbuwa Yahudaya na a tǝrǝm Faara, laɓar hǝrǝkrǝ ɗi ya thlǝnang nandan ƙǝm ɓa! <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Nafiya Urshalima tǝ mamnggi ndan kukwalang ngwanda Yeeso hai wa, tǝ ƙǝm sǝnang ngwanda laɓar annabiya hai na nda karatang nda kala far yiɓǝd Yahudaya wa. A meyedghǝn ɓǝlang ngganda Yeeso ka a lǝɗang ngganda ǝngya ndaana annabiya. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Ko nanǝn ƙǝsang ngwanda tǝ ˈya ɗimi wa, ndang ngganda Mbilatus a ɓǝlang ngganda. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Ngwalang nanda lǝɗang nda ǝngya heu ndaana ɗeleewar aten mǝrrǝghǝn, tǝrang ngganda hai aten kaɗidɗi pang ngganda ahu kwadɗa hai ra nanda ahu feera. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Amma Faara thlenggǝn sǝ ahu mǝrra! <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />Ahu ɓengya hangga kyad fadghǝnǝn a nafini mbuwa samadghǝn ka a Nggalili ɓa ta Urshalima ɗǝ. Kanda ni nanǝnya na a pǝranggǝn nafinǝm. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Nanǝnya ɓanan ɓa ka a ɓan pǝrang laɓarɗi kun na Mbǝnggǝn ya: ˈya ndaana Faara a chichiyi nǝm tsauɗǝ ƙǝkafek a thlakh mbǝd nan, <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />tsaunǝn thleng Faara Yeeso sǝ. Ƙǝla nanǝn chichirethlee hai ahu ɗeleewar Dzabura yi sǝri tǝ ndaarha,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 13:33" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">‘Waana ni sa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:33">A weeriya tsauɗi tsu.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dzabura 2:7</char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Ƙǝsǝr ndagha Faara nǝn a thleng sǝ ahu mǝrra, ɓalwa nggǝr mǝra wa. Nǝghǝn chichirethlee hai kee ahu ɗeleewar Faara ndaanǝn, ‘Niya furo parkadɗi tǝ Peɗǝnda ndang ni Ndauda.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ishaya 55:3</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />A mbǝrha hu ɗeleewar Dzabura pǝrɗa ndǝn a pǝpal tǝ ndaarha, ‘Mba malang nda tǝ Peɗǝnduwa mǝlthgha hai ahu kwaarha wa.’”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dzabura 16:10</char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />“Ƙǝsǝr a kwasamadɗi ngwalang na Ndauda tarɗi na mid Faara a thlakh mbǝdghǝn, mǝrgha pang ngganda ahu kwat mǝrra chichiyighǝn, mǝlthgha thlu fadghǝn hai. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Amma niifɗi thleng na Faara sǝ ahu mǝra mǝlthwa thlu fadghǝn hai wa. <verse eid="ACT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />Tsaunǝn kee wan manggina, na minna sǝ a sǝnunsǝ ahu Yeeso ɗiya ndǝn nanan a pǝrang ndaarha kun, nun a wal chakh ɗimiyid nun sǝ. <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Kala niifa fǝrgha ƙǝkafek tǝghǝn nǝn a wal hǝrǝkrha a mbed Faara, ˈya mbuwana ngyakhrha Musa mbang ǝnaarha. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Kwarama! A nggǝmɗun fa ˈya ndaana annabiya katǝragha hai tǝ kun wa. Ƙǝsǝr ndagha nda,<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />‘Kaama thlǝmaarha hai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">kun na a waa farha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">nama ǝnwulteena murun ɗǝ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">Ƙǝsǝr niya ǝna ˈya a thlakh mbǝd nun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">ˈya mbuwa nun fǝrƙǝkafek tǝghǝn ko pǝrang na niifa ˈya kun atenggǝn.’ ” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Habakuk 1:5 </char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Na nanda Mbulus tǝ Mbarnaɓa a kyarha hai a ƙǝn tsahad Yahudaya, hwangga nafini kanda a nggǝra nda wutta ɓa ɓanda pǝrang laɓara kanda aten ǝngginiya a far yibrha na ɓayi. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Welna fiya hai, Yahudaya hangga tǝ fingya mbuwa Yahudaya kyagha hu takkwa ǝntin Yahudaya hai mbu samad nda Mbulus nda tǝ Mbarnaɓa. Nafini sǝri ya ndang ngganda kanda a ɗǝnda mbeeɗǝ tǝ mbǝrsaarha tǝ nggayid Faara. <verse eid="ACT 13:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Kyahar na far yiɓǝd Yahudaya ɓa fadɗǝn, fiya hangga kaan a wupǝri ɗi wuma nda thlǝman ndan ɓa ka a sǝk laɓar Chinǝm nda <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Nana mamngya Yahudaya wumngga hai, na nda a sǝrǝkrha, na nda a ngaal ǝngya ndaana Mbulus. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Tǝrgha nda Mbulus tǝ Mbarnaɓa kula hǝreenga ndang ngganda kanda, “Kamɗǝ kwang a pǝrang laɓar Faara nan kun, nanǝn karɗun ndǝn fa tǝ ƙǝm ƙǝlang ɗun fad nun kamngwa a wal yibrha nu mbuwa ngwalaarha wa, nanǝnya nan a kyaharra thlǝma fingya ɗǝ mbuwa Yahudaya. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Ƙǝsǝr kulo ǝnɗi ndang na Chinǝm kan ya:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 13:47" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">‘Ɗǝfang ɗi kun a tsawun kukwaryirha a fingya mbuwa Yahudaya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">a ɓang hǝrǝkrha nun fiya ɓa ta mii ngwala ƙǝshiirha ɗǝ.’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ishaya 42:6, 49:6 </char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Sǝkna fingya yina ndǝn mbuwa Yahudaya, tǝk mbǝnda nda fa usa Chinǝm nda ka laɓarghǝn. Fingya wurna nda ka yibrha mbuwa ngwalaarha fǝrƙǝkafek nda. <verse eid="ACT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Nanǝn kee laɓar Chinǝm welɗa ɗǝ ahu chehwedɗi kahat. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Tǝrgha mamngya Yahudayini shik nishya nda na a tǝrǝm Faara na fiya a fǝrang mamnggirha kanda, tǝ mamngya na ahur wupǝri ɗi. Shighang ngganda fiya fa, thleng ngganda nda Mbulus fa tǝ Mbarnaɓa rǝghang ngganda kanda sǝ ma talɗi. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Amma nda Mbulus tǝ Mbarnaɓa ɗǝghang ngganda tǝnidɗa ɗǝ na a saryi ndan a tsauka yiyi thlǝmaarha ni aten ndan, ɗǝnda Ikoniya ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Fa takkwaya Yeeso na a Antakiya tǝk mbǝnda nda fa tǝ ƙǝm lǝgɗa nda tǝ Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Nda Mbulus tǝ Mbarnaɓa a Ikoniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />A Ikoniya, nda Mbulus tǝ Mbarnaɓa kanda kyab kya nda hu ƙǝn tsahad Yahudaya ɗǝ ƙǝla sǝsǝn nanda sahai. Pǝr laɓar Faara nda tǝ sǝsǝmnda har fiya hangga Yahudaya tǝ fingya mbuwa Yahudaya fǝrƙǝkafek nda. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Amma fingya Yahudayini kargha fǝrƙǝkafek fa, shik fingya yina nda mbuwa Yahudaya kyakhrang ngganda huten nggindan hai ma fa takkwaya Yeeso. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Tsawa nda Mbulus tǝ Mbarnaɓa a mbǝɗi ɓeena hangga, ɗǝnda mbeeɗǝ tǝ pǝr laɓar Chinǝm kula hǝreenga. Chinǝm Yeeso fǝrang ɗǝ sǝsǝmnda kanda a ǝna ǝnwulteengya nda hangga, ahu ǝna ˈya kiya kyaɗang ɗǝ ndaarha fiya laɓarɗi ƙǝkafek ni. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Fiya na a wupǝri ɗi tsaha nda hai pǝmnggǝn sǝri, fingya a samad Yahudayini, fingya ƙǝm fǝrƙǝkafek nda tǝ laɓar nda Mbulus tǝ Mbarnaɓa.<verse eid="ACT 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Tǝrgha Yahudaya tǝ fingya mbuwa Yahudaya heu tǝ mamnggi ndan ƙǝnang ngganda ˈya hai na nda a ǝnang ndaa nda Mbulus tǝ Mbarnaɓa, na mindan sǝ a ƙǝsang ngganda kanda muk kanda nda tǝ ferya. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Sǝkna fathlǝngya Yeeso laɓarɗi kee ɗaa nda tǝ yiɓǝd ndan. Ɗǝnda hu chehweed Likoniya ɗǝ, ahu wupǝri Listra ɗǝ tǝ Ndarɓe tǝ fingya talya. <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />Pǝr laɓar ɗa nda na Mbǝnggǝn a mbǝɗi.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nda Mbulus tǝ Mbarnaɓa a Listra tǝ Ndarɓe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Na nanda Mbulus tǝ Mbarnaɓa a Listra ɓa nda wal niifa sǝfǝnna sarghǝn. Ka nggǝttǝghǝn hai nǝghǝn kee, ˈwawa mbang wiirha wa. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Nǝghǝn a kang thlǝmaarha Mbulus fa nanǝn a pǝr laɓar Faara. Ƙǝlang na Mbulus hu yidsǝ naghǝnǝn na fǝrƙǝkafek sǝ a fadghǝn na a wal ƙǝnda nǝn. <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />Tǝrgha Mbulus tǝranggǝn uradghǝn sǝ aaghǝn ndanggǝn, “Thliu sǝ!” Tǝrgha niifɗi thliigha sǝ harat katǝranggǝn wiirha hai.<verse eid="ACT 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Fiya na kang thlǝmaarha Mbulus fa na nanda ǝnɗi ǝnanǝn tǝrang ngganda urad ndan sǝ ndaa nda tǝ mii nda yi Likoniyaya, “Faarya ni nafini ya, ɓanda thlǝmad nǝm ɓa ahu thlu farha!” <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Ahu numad ndan Mbarnaɓa Ndzeyus ni thlǝm faara yi Nggirkaya, Mbulus ƙǝm tsaunǝn ndǝghǝn ni na a fǝr laɓara, aaghǝn nda Hemes. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Firis yi ƙǝn Ndzeyustǝn nanda a ƙǝsǝr wupǝri ɗi, ɓagha ɓa tǝ thlaarha tǝ shiiya na tǝ fiirha fa a kwatkirǝm wupǝri ɗa ɓa, ƙǝsǝr ndǝghǝn tǝ fiya heu na mindan sǝ a ǝnang sataka nda kanda.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Amma sǝkna nda Mbarnaɓa tǝ Mbulus ǝnɗi na a katǝrarha hai, njarang ngganda lukki ndan ɗǝ ƙǝsǝr mbǝnang ngwa ǝnɗi kanda na mindan ǝnagha wa, ɗaa nda hur fiya ɗǝ na nda ahuhwaarha tǝ ndaarha, <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />“Kun nafiniya, kama nun a ǝna ǝnɗiya? Nafiya ni kan ƙǝla kun! Ɓang nan laɓara kun ɓa na Mbǝnggǝn na a kyakhrun hai malanggun. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Ƙǝtǝm malang ɗǝ fiya heu tǝrang shilee nda faarya teena na mindan, <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />amma ˈwawa mal kanda kula ndǝghǝn kyad fadghǝn tǝ ǝna nggayirha a fiya tǝ ndaarha ndǝghǝn ǝnagha ƙǝshiirha kahat wa. Na ǝngya sǝ nǝn naarha ɗal ƙǝm in, ƙǝla yaara nǝn narha ɓang ƙǝm hai tǝ parkad ǝnnarhami tǝ ƙǝm lǝɗanggǝn hur nun tǝ wutsǝfayirha.” <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Amma ko nanǝn kee, nda Mbulus tǝ Mbarnaɓa pǝrpǝr ˈyaɗang na ndan nafina fa a ǝnanda sataka kanda wa. <verse eid="ACT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Amma fingya Yahudaya ɓagha nda ɓa a Antakiya tǝ Ikoniya fiya wumngga hai sǝk mii ndan nda, muk Mbulus nda, kahang ngganda ƙǝsǝr tala ɗǝ, tamngganda ndaarha mǝrɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Hǝrǝmna fatakkwaya muwang maɗufu, tǝrgha thliigha sǝ wudgha hur wupǝri ɗǝ.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wutta Antakiya ɗǝ tǝ Suriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Akwasamadɗi pǝr nanda Mbulus tǝ Mbarnaɓa laɓar Faara a Ndǝrɓe, wal nda fiya hangga malangga ɗimiyid ndan, wuɗa nda Listǝra ɗǝ, tǝ Ikoniya, tǝ Antakiya na hu chehweed Mbisidiya. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Kanda a fǝrang kaali fatakkwaya, na nda yiyang thlǝmaarha kanda in na a isha nda hu fǝrƙǝkafekkid ndan tǝ shembe. Ndangganda kanda, “Ƙǝl tǝ sǝsaarha kaan ndǝnǝm kyarha hu kutǝryid talara ɗǝ.” <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Akwasamadɗi wurang na nda Mbulus shingya sǝ hu ƙǝngya hwan Faara, hwan Faara nda tǝ kar aama aten ndan na a tsauka Faara tǝ kanda fǝr nanda ƙǝkafek tǝghǝn. <verse eid="ACT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Tǝrgha kya nda tǝ chehweed Mbisidiya ɗǝnda Famfiliya ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Pǝr nanda laɓar Faara a Pǝrngga, ɗǝnda Ataliya ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />A mbǝɗani ya kya nanda hu nggirggi aama hai wuɗa nda Antakiya ɗǝ, a mbǝɗani kaar hwanang nanda Faara kanda in tǝ ndaarha a lafgha nggayid Faara kanda ahu tarɗi ngwalang nanda ya. <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Sǝl nanda ɓa wumangganda fatakkwaya hai pǝr ǝnɗa nda heu ǝnana Faara aten ndan, tǝƙǝm inang kwamana fingya mbuwa Yahudaya kwaminda fǝrƙǝkafek hai. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Mǝna ndaha a mbǝɗi kanda heu tǝ fatakkwaya.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Wum ten mamngya a Urshalima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Na nanda Mbulus tǝ Mbarnaɓa a Antakiya na a Suriya, ɓagha fingya nafiya ɓa a Yahudiya, katǝrang ngganda tsahang Ƙǝrǝstaya ha tǝ ndaarha, “Tǝta ni a thleng muwa nda kun, ƙǝla tsahang na ǝntin Musa ƙǝm ha, a mbǝ kee wa, mbun wal hǝrǝkrha wa.” <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Nda Mbulus tǝ Mbarnaɓa ngaal nda pǝɗaghǝn tǝ kanda. A kwasamadghǝn, thlǝn nda Mbulus nda tǝ Mbarnaɓa tǝ fingya fa fǝrƙǝkafekkya a Urshalima ɗǝ, a thlǝma fathlǝngya Yeeso ɗǝ tǝ shingya aten palthɗi. <verse eid="ACT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Thlǝnna fa fǝrƙǝkafekkya a Urshalima ɗǝ, isha nda hai a kwamana ahu talya Finikiya tǝ Samariya, pǝrang nggǝnda kanda tǝ ndaarha fingya mubuwawa Yahudaya fǝr nda ƙǝkafek a Faara. A ten palthɗiya fa fǝrƙǝkafekkya ƙǝl ǝna wutsǝfayirha.<verse eid="ACT 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Sǝl nanda Urshalima ɗǝ, nda Mbulus tǝ Mbarnaɓa thlǝgha fa fǝrƙǝkafekkya kanda fa heu tǝ fathlǝngya tǝ shingya. Pǝr ǝnɗa nda ǝnana Faara tǝ kanda. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Amma fingya nafiya na a takkwa Farisaya thlii nda sǝ ndaa nda, “Tǝta ni a thleng muwa nda nafini mbuwa Yahudaya tǝ ƙǝm takkwa ngyakhrha ɗeleewar Musa nda.”<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Fathlǝnggini tǝ shingya tsawa nda hai ka tsǝ laɓara nda aten palthɗiya. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />A kwasamadɗi ndik nanda atenggǝn kaan, thliigha Mbiturus sǝ ndǝghǝn, “Wan manggina, sǝnɗunsǝ kaar yi wurgha Faara nggi ahur nun sǝ, ka a pǝrang laɓar Faara ni fingya mbuwa wa Yahudaya tǝna nda sǝk Laɓarɗi na Mbǝnggǝn fǝrƙǝkafek nda. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Faara, ndǝghǝnni sǝngga hur kowunni, kyadɗǝ ndaarha thlǝɗǝ kanda fa fǝrang nǝn Sǝsǝna kanda tǝ Peɗǝnda ƙǝla fǝrang nǝn ƙǝm. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Wurwa ha sǝ a pathlang nǝm tǝ kanda wa, ƙǝsǝr tsuthlang ɗǝ hur ndan ɗǝ ƙǝsǝr ka fǝrƙǝkafekkid ndan. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Nanǝn kee, kama na minnun sǝ ƙǝƙǝrang nda Faara nun ɗǝfang rǝfrha na haaghǝn a urad nafiya mbuwa wa Yahudaya fǝrgha ƙǝkafek, mbuwana ƙǝm nduwa chichiyinǝm mbang ngwanda tǝrang wa? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Awo! Fǝr ɗǝm ƙǝkafek tǝ ndaarha ahu nggayid Chinǝm Yeeso ni wal nǝm hǝrǝkrha, ƙǝla wal nanda.”<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Fiya wumngga hai nggasa nda hai tǝtip, na nda a kang thlǝmaarha nda Mbarnaɓa fa tǝ Mbulus na nanda a pǝrang pathla kanda aten ǝnsakhkya tǝ ǝnwultengya, ǝnana Faara tǝ kanda ahur nafini mbuwa wa Yahudaya.<verse eid="ACT 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Ngwalana nda, tǝrgha thliigha Yakubu sǝ ndǝghǝn, “Wan manggina, Keema thlǝmaarha fa. <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Siman Mbiturus saghang ɗa ndǝn ƙǝm kwaman ɗi na mid Faara a wurgha hasǝ ahur nafini mbuwa Yahudaya tsawa nda yighǝn. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Kyaharrǝ ɗa hai ki nafini mbuwa wa Yahudaya mǝmǝlɗǝ tǝ laɓar annabiya na chichirethlee hai ahu ɗeleewar Faara tǝ ndaarha.”<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />“ ‘Akwasamad ǝnɗiya niya wutta ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">Nggǝryi tǝnang wuri Ndauda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">Chaɗa hai niya nggǝr tǝnang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">Nggǝryi thleng nda sǝ.<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />Fiya takhka na nda kaɗa Chinǝm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">Fingya mbuwa wa Yahudaya heu aah ni a tsawa nda yina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">Ndagha Chinǝm kee, ǝnagha ǝngginiya,’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amos 9:11-12 </char></note><verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />Kyad nǝn ka ƙǝtǝm.”<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />“Niyi a ndang nda kun, tama malanggǝm ɓilla nafini mbuwa Yahudaya na a kyaharra thlǝmad Faara ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />A meghedghǝn, nǝm a chireethleng kanda ɗǝ a malang ngganda kii ƙala ǝnnarhami paa nanda ɗahaya sǝ, tǝ kulafayirha tǝ ƙǝm kii thlu maɓiya tefreng nanda urad ndan tǝ saa fara<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɗeleewar Kyarha ɓa 34:15-17; Ɗeleewar Firistaya 17:10-16, 18:6-23</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Ƙǝsǝr na nda karatang nda ahu ɗeleewar ngyakhrha Musa ahu ƙǝngya tsahad Yahudaya tǝ kala wupǝri tǝ kala far yiɓǝd Yahudaya ka chichiiya hangga.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chireelth nda ɗeleewar a Nafiya mbuwa wa Yahudaya fǝrgha ƙǝkafek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Tǝrgha fathlǝnggini tǝ shingya, tǝ fatakkwaya Yeeso heu ƙǝla nda hai kamɗǝ a wur nafi ndan nda thlǝnang ngganda kanda a Antakiya ɗǝ heu nda Mbulus tǝ Mbarnaɓa. Wur Yahuda nda na nda aarha Mbarnaɓa tǝ Sila, mamngya ni kanda ahur fatakkwaya Yeeso. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Kulo ɗeleewar ɗi chireelth nanda haaɗǝ ya:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 15:23" />
  <para style="mi" vid="ACT 15:23">Ɗeleewar ɗiya ɓaghǝn ɓa a har fathlǝngya Yeeso tǝ shingya, wan mamngginun na a Urshalima.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 15:23">A nafiya mbuwa wa Yahudaya fǝrgha ƙǝkafek tǝ Yeeso na a Antakiya, Suriya, tǝ Ƙǝlikiya, nan a ndangˈya kun fa. <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Sǝkɗan ndaarha ɗǝd fingya ɗǝ a mbǝɗa ɗǝ ya, ɓillad nda kun tǝ tsang teena kun tǝ tsahan ndan ha, amma thlǝngwan kanda a ndang ngganda kun kee wa. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Nanǝn kee, kan heu tsauɗan hai nggǝman fa a wur nafiya nan thlǝnanggan kanda a thlǝmannun ɗǝ tǝ pashiyi nan nda Mbarnaɓa tǝ Mbulus, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />nafini hengga yiɓǝd ndan ɗǝ ka thlǝm Chinǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Tsaunǝn kee, nan a thlǝnang Yahuda tǝ Sila kun ɗǝ ka ɗa nda pǝrang ǝnggini kun chireethleng nan kun ɗǝ atenggǝn tǝ mii ndan.<verse eid="ACT 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />“Nǝghǝn ngga a Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda tǝ kan ƙǝm mbǝ ka a fǝrang rǝfrha nan kun pak ma fingyayini na chichireethlee hai ya wa. <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />Malaman hǝb ǝnnarhami pang nanda ɗaharha, tǝ saa fara tǝ kii thlu maɓiya tefreng nanda urayindan tǝ ƙǝm kulafayirha. A laf ɗun ǝngginiya, na tsawud nun a narha ngga. Mal ɗan kun hu ɗǝɗemnggirha.”<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Nafini wii nda a Antakiya ɗǝ, ɗa nda wumang nda fatakkwaya Yeeso hai fǝrang ɗeleewar ɗa nda kanda. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Karatangga nafini tǝk mbǝnda nda fa ka laɓarɗi sǝk nda.<verse eid="ACT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Nda Yahuda tǝ Sila annabiya ni kanda, thlǝk palthya nda hangga a Ƙǝrǝsta yini tǝ fǝrang kanglanggirha kanda. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />A kwasamadɗi mǝn nanda ɓeena ha a mbǝɗi, ɗǝfangganda kanda ɗǝ hu ɗǝɗemnggirha wuɗa nda a thlǝmad nafina ɗǝ thlǝngga kanda ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fingya chirethya na nda tǝ mbǝdghǝn 34 ndaanǝn: Amma ƙǝlana Sila hai nǝghǝn mǝmǝl tsauka hai a mbǝɗi </char></note> <verse eid="ACT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Amma nda Mbulus tǝ Mbarnaɓa tsawa nda a Antakiya, a mbǝɗi kanda tǝ fingya hangga na nda a tsahang fiya ha tǝ pǝr laɓar Chinǝm a kanda.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsakh nda Mbarnaɓa hai tǝ Mbulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />A kwasamad ɓengya ndangga Mbulus Mbarnaɓa, “Tam wuɗum ɗǝm weng tala fatakkwaya Yeeso na ahu tal yini ˈwanǝm pǝr laɓar Chinǝm sǝ, ɗǝm na kanda tǝnaa nda ƙǝn.” <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Na mid Mbarnaɓa sǝ a tahang ngganda Yahaya Markus ha ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Amma Mbulus mbǝ midghǝn sǝ a tahang ngganda Yahaya Markus haaɗǝ wa, ƙǝsǝr malɗǝ kanda a Pamfiliya tǝ ƙǝm karɗa fa na a ɗǝnda mbeeɗǝ tǝ tarɗi. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />A mbǝɗi kya nda hu ngaala hai kaan pa ɗǝgha nda hai. Tǝrangga Mbarnaɓa Yahaya Markus kya nda hu kombuwol hai ɗǝnda Sayifurus ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Amma Mbulus wur Sila nǝn wii nda, fa fǝrƙǝkafekkya hwan nggayid Chinǝm nda a tǝranggǝn kanda ɗǝ ɗǝɗem. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Kya nda tǝ Suriya tǝ Kilikiya ka ɗa nda fǝrang kanglanggirha fatakkwaya Yeeso.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Tahang nda Mbulus tǝ Sila Timoti haaɗǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Nda Mbulus tǝ Sila ˈwa ɗǝrha nda Ndarɓe ɗǝ a ɗǝnda Listǝra ɗǝ. A mbǝɗi na tǝ tsaharha ha sǝ, thlǝmnggǝnni Timoti man tǝ Yahudarha ni fǝrgha ƙǝkafek, amma chin tǝ Helenarha ni. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Fa takkwaya Yeeso na a Listǝra tǝ Ikoniya kanda a falghǝn. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Nanǝn kee, na mid Mbulus sǝ a tahang ngganda Timoti haaɗǝ, thleng muwanǝn ƙǝsǝr ka Yahudaya na a mbǝɗi, kowunni sǝndasǝ chin tǝ Helenarha ni. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />A sayidɗi nanda a wiirha, na nda a takkwa tala-tala kanda a thlǝghanggǝn fiya ˈya ƙǝnang na fathlǝngya hai tǝ shingya na a Urshalima na a laf kanda nda. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Fa takkwaya Yeeso na nda aten chikrha hu fǝrƙǝkafek tǝ hang nda fiya kafad ɗalthla mbǝrha fa hai.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aagha Faara Mbulus a Makidoniya ɗǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Mbulus tǝ ka wiiyighǝn weng ngganda chehweed Firijiya hai tǝ Nggalatiya, ƙǝsǝr Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda ˈyaɗang ɗǝ thlǝk laɓar Faara kanda fa a chehweed Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Sǝlnanda mii chehweed Misiya, tǝr mindan sǝ ɗǝrha a Mbitiniya ɗǝ, amma Sǝsǝn Yeeso nggǝmangwa kanda fa wa. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />A meghedghǝn, kya nda tǝ Misiya sǝla nda a Turuwas ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />A fǝɗikrha, sǝsǝniigha Mbulus tǝ niif Makidoniya ƙǝt nagha a hwanggǝn tǝ ndaarha, “Ɓo Makidoniya ɓa, ɓa ɗang nda kan sǝ.” <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Nanǝn kee, ngwan fa ka a ɗan Makidoniya ɗǝ, tǝ numad ndaarha Faara aagha kǝm a ɗǝm thlǝghang Laɓara na Mbǝnggǝn a kanda.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fǝr ƙǝkafekkid Lidiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Kyan ahu kombuwol hai a Turuwas, ɗan Samutarki ɗǝ, ɗalthna mbǝrha hai tǝran hai a Niyapolis. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Thlen a mbǝɗi ɗan Filibi ɗǝ manda wupǝri na ahu chehweed Makidoniya. Wupǝri ni tǝnna kutǝryid Roma; tsawan yi ɓeena hangga a mbǝɗi. <verse eid="ACT 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />A far yiɓǝd Yahudaya ɗan ƙǝsǝr wupǝri ɗa ɗǝ a mii kufaarha, a mbǝɗi nan a numad ndaarha nan a wal mbǝd hwan Faara. Tsawan hai, katǝranggan kalang nishya sǝ wumngga hai a mbǝɗi. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Tal ahur nishyini na a kang thlǝmaarha kan fa thlǝmnggǝn Lidiya na heng kaɓaya na tǝ wuɗǝɓǝla fa, ɓaghǝn ɓa a wupǝri Tayatira, nǝn tǝrang shilee Faara teena. Chinǝm inanggǝn hurghǝn ɗǝ thlǝ laɓar Mbulus nǝn fa. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Ənang mbaptisǝma nda heu tǝ nafiya wurighǝn, hwan kan nǝn a ɗan wuri keeghǝn ɗǝ ndǝghǝn, “A nggǝmɗun fa tǝ fǝrƙǝkafek ni nggi a Chinǝm, ɓama ɓa ɓun tsaurha a wuri kyana.” Djib hwan kan nǝn pa ɗan ɗǝ.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbulus tǝ Sila ahu porsǝna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Na farɗa sǝ kan ɗiye a mbǝd hwan Faara ɗǝ, ƙǝman tǝ mafad wee nuwun nǝghǝn tǝ ǝnkaheerha fa yi kularha. Walang ɗǝ ƙǝna turighǝn sǝ kaan ahu tar kuladɗi. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Nǝn takkwa samad nan nagha ahuhwaarha tǝ ndaarha, “Nafiniya mafaya Faara Amshi ni, ɓa nanda ɓa ka a pǝrang kwaman wal hǝrǝkrha nda kun!” <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Ɓengya hangga nǝn naarha ndaarha kee. Tǝrgha Mbulus sǝbgha hurghǝn ɗǝ, kyahargha hai ndanggǝn ǝnkahedɗi, “A hu thlǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti nduwu hai tǝghǝn!” Tsu ƙee ndǝkka hai tǝghǝn. <verse eid="ACT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Kǝlaana turid mafad wee nuwun ɗa hai kwaman wallǝnɗan nggǝlɗǝ, kǝsang ngganda Mbulus tǝ Sila ɗǝnda tǝ kanda ahu kasuɗǝ a mbed fa ngwa kumaya ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Ɗǝnda tǝ kanda a mbed mamngya fa ngwa kumaaya ɗǝ, ndaa nda, “Nafiniya Yahudaya ni, na nda tsang teena nafinan kaan. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Na nda tsahang ǝntingya kanha mbuwa mǝmǝl tǝ ƙǝm Romaya.” <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Fiya wumngga hai a mbǝɗi katǝrang ngganda har nda Mbulus tǝ Sila tǝ yanda, mamngya fa ngwa kumaaya ndanggǝn fingya fiya a ƙǝɗang ngganda kanda hai tawalth, ɗǝk kanda nda. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />A kwasamadɗi ɗǝk nanda kanda muwang ngganda kanda hu porsǝna ɗǝ ndang ngganda fa kǝla mbǝɗa ha a ƙǝla kanda nda ha ngga. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Tǝ ƙǝla ƙǝn porsǝn ɗaha kǝm hǝrǝm nǝn sǝkkǝn kee muwanggǝn kanda a kambǝrhaɗǝ kaan pang ngganda saryindan ahu ɗǝfrha hai. <verse eid="ACT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />A manad fǝɗikrha nda Mbulus tǝ Sila na nanda a hwan Faara tǝ aagha amshe yi fal Faara, nagha fingya porsǝngya a kang thlǝmaarha kanda fa. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Kula sǝndǝndan sǝ, rǝbgha chehweerha fa heu tǝ sar ƙǝn porsǝn ɗi. Tsu kee kwat mingya porsǝn ɗi heu ina nda ɗǝ, wuyiwurya ƙǝnang nanda porsǝngya sǝ heu kwasa nda hai <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Mehenna tǝ kǝla mbǝɗa ha a ɓeena, kǝla hai kwatmingya heu inda ɗǝ. Ƙǝɗanggǝn thlau ƙǝlarghǝn sǝ na midghǝn sǝ a ɓǝlanggǝn fadghǝn, ahu numadghǝn tamnggǝn ndaarha porsǝnggini heu kyanda sǝ. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Amma tǝrangga Mbulus uradghǝn sǝ kaan ndanggǝn, “A ǝnang na wundǝrha fadwa fa wa, kan heu nan a mbǝɗiya!”<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Tǝ kǝla porsǝn ɗa ha ndaagha a ɓang patilla nda ɓa, mbǝngga a ƙǝnɗa ɗǝ ɓǝrgha hweeɗa hai tǝ kurumnggǝn a mbǝd nda Mbulus tǝ Sila, nagha fadghǝn heu a rǝbrha fa. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Kyagha tǝ kanda ƙǝshaaɓa tsahang mee nǝn kanda, “Kun mamngya, mani ǝnaarha tǝni hǝrǝkrha?”<verse eid="ACT 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Ndang ngganda, “Furu ƙǝkafek a Chinǝm Yeeso, na wal hǝrǝkrha heu tǝ wuriwa.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Tǝrgha pǝrang laɓar Chinǝm nda tǝ fingya heu na a minda keeghǝn. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />A fǝɗikɗi wu tǝ ƙǝla porsǝn ɗaha haranggǝn kanda, tsaɓang wundǝyi ndan nǝn kanda ɗǝ. A mbǝɗi kǝm ǝnang mbatisǝma nda heu tǝ wurighǝn. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Tǝrgha ɓagha tǝ kanda minda keeghǝn ɓa fǝrang ǝnnarhami nǝn kanda. Ndǝghǝn tǝ fa wurayighǝn heu na nda a ǝna wutsǝfayirha ƙǝsǝr kanda heu fǝr nda ƙǝkafek a Faara.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Ɗalthna mbǝrha hai, thlǝngga fa ngwa kuma yini farha a thlǝmad tǝ ƙǝla porsǝn ɗaɗǝ tǝ ndaarha: “Kalu hǝshyina hai ya.” <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Tǝ ƙǝla porsǝn ɗaha ndanggǝn Mbulus, “Fa ngwa kumaaya thlǝngga ɓa a kal sa ni hai tǝ Sila. Nanǝnya weema ahu ɗǝɗemnggirha.” <verse eid="ACT 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Amma nggǝrangga Mbulus nafina sǝ thlǝn nanda kanda ɓa, “Ɗǝk nda kan a pǝpal kula kanda ngwang kumarha kan sǝ, muwang ngganda kan ahu porsǝna ɗǝ kan ƙǝm wangya Romaya ni kan. Nanǝnya na mindan sǝ kee ween ɓǝɓee? Ƙǝkafek mbǝ ǝnaarha hai kee wa! Ndaaman kanda a ɓa nda ɓa tafandan ɓa nda kal kan hai.” <verse eid="ACT 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Nafini thlǝn nanda ɓa ɗǝnda ɗǝ ɗa nda pǝranggǝn fa ngwa kumaaya, sǝk nanda ndaarha nda Mbulus tǝ Sila wangya Romaya ni tǝrma nda. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Ɓanda hu ƙǝn porsǝn ɗa ɓa hwan kanda nda a chahanggǝn nda kanda ɗǝ, kyang ngganda kanda sǝ ma porsǝn ɗi mal wupǝri ɗa nda. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />A kwasamadɗi kya nanda Mbulus sǝ tǝ Sila ahu porsǝn ɗi, ɗǝnda wuri ki Lidiya ɗǝ. A mbǝɗani wumna nda sa hai tǝ fatakkwaya Yeeso fǝrang kanglanggirha nda kanda a wii nda.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">Nda Mbulus tǝ Sila a Tasalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Kya nanda Mbulus tǝ Sila tǝ Amfipolis tǝ Apoloniya, ɓa nda Tasalonika ɓa na ƙǝn tsahad Yahudaya sǝ. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Ƙǝla sǝsǝnna Mbulus sa hai kyagha hu ƙǝn tsahad Yahudayina ɗǝ, a far yiɓǝd Yahudaya katǝra mahan a miighǝn a miighǝn tsǝ laɓara nǝn tǝ fiya ahu ɗeleewar Faara. <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />Pǝrang nggǝnǝn kanda a pǝpal ˈya ndana ɗeleewar Faara tǝ ndaarha Ƙǝrǝsti sǝsaaɗǝ tǝ ƙǝm thliiɗa sǝ hu mǝra. Ndanggǝn kanda, “Yeeso ɗi niya pǝrang nda kun ya Ƙǝrǝsti ɗa ni.” <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Fingya Yahudaya nggǝmnda fa wum teena nda tǝ nda Mbulus tǝ Sila, ƙǝla ǝnana Helenaya hangga na a tǝrǝm Faara tǝ man nishya na tǝ thlǝma in.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Amma nagha Yahudayini a sǝrǝkrha, ɗa nda wumang fa thlǝmǝngya ɓa ahu kasu, thliigha kakyathlanga sǝ a wupǝri ɗi. Ɗa nda minda ki Djason ɗǝ na nda a kaɗa nda Mbulus tǝ Sila ka a kyang ngganda kanda ahur fiya ɓa wumngga hai. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Amma nawa nanda kanda, kahang ngganda Djason ɓa tǝ fingya fatakkwaya Yeeso ɓa nda tǝ kanda a mbed mamngya wupǝri ɗa ɓa na nda ahuhwaarha, “Nafini ya kanda ni na a tsang teena fiya hu ƙǝshiirha kahat nanǝnya kulo kanda ya. <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />Djason thlǝɗǝ kanda fa a minda keeghǝn. Kanda heu kar nda ǝna taara tǝ ngyakhrha Kaisar, na nda a ndaarha wai na kutǝra sǝ pak, yanɗi na nda aarha Yeeso.”<verse eid="ACT 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Sǝk nanda kee, fiya wumngga hai tǝ mamngya wupǝri ɗi sǝbgha hur ndan ɗǝ tsangga teena kanda. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Tǝrgha ndang ngganda Djason tǝ fingya a fǝr wuɗǝɓǝla nda a malang ngganda kanda wii nda.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nda Mbulus tǝ Sila a Mberiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Tsǝna fiɗikrha hai, Fa takkwaya Yeeso thlǝnang ngganda nda Mbulus tǝ Sila a Mberiya ɗǝ. Sǝl nanda a mbǝɗa ɗǝ, kya nda ahu ƙǝn tsahad Yahudaya ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Nafiya Mberiya kal nda Tasalonikaya hakkilo, ƙǝsǝr thlǝnda laɓar ɗa fa tǝ haara kikyab na nda naarha huleu laɓar Faara ƙǝtsar tǝna nda sǝn ƙǝkafekkid palthɗi pǝrang na Mbulus kanda. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Yahudaya hangga fǝrgha ƙǝkafek, ƙǝla ǝnana Helenaya, man nishya na tǝ thlǝma in tǝ hǝshya hangga.<verse eid="ACT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Sǝkna Yahudaya na a Tasalonika ndaarha na Mbulus a pǝr laɓar Faara a Mberiya, ɗǝnda mbǝɗaɗǝ ƙǝm, ɗa nda shighang fiya fa wumngga hai tǝna nda thleng yanda. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Fa takkwaya Yeeso na a mbǝɗi thlǝnang ngganda Mbulus a mii wuri aama ɗǝ, amma nda Sila tǝ Timoti tsawa nda a Mberiya. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Nafini ɗǝfangga Mbulus a Atina ɗǝ ndanggǝn kanda ɗa nda pǝrang ndaarha Sila tǝ Timoti ɓa nda walghǝn wed.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbulus a Atina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Nana Mbulus a ƙǝla kanda fa a Atina, thleegha hurghǝn nanǝn talɗi lǝghǝdɗǝ tǝ ɗahaya. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Nanǝn kee, ɗǝgha hu ƙǝn tsahad Yahudaya ɗǝ ka ɗǝgha tsǝ laɓara tǝ kanda tǝ Helenaya na a tǝrǝm Faara. Ka fad ɗathla mbǝrha fa hai nǝn naarha ɗǝrha hu kasu ɗǝ nagha a kalang fingya sǝ wal nǝn a mbǝɗi.<verse eid="ACT 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Fingya fa malǝmngya Abikuriyaya tǝ Sǝtokiyaya katǝrang ngganda ngaala hai tǝghǝn ka pǝrang nǝn laɓar Yeeso kanda tǝ thliidghǝn sǝ ahu mǝrra.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 17:18">Nanǝn kee tsakhka fingya mee, “Mana tǝ pǝpethɗi a ndaarha ya?” Tǝ ƙǝm ndagha fingya, “Na midghǝn sǝ pǝr laɓar weerǝnda faarya nǝn.”<verse eid="ACT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Tǝrgha ɗǝnda tǝghǝn ahu wum ten fa sǝngya ɗǝ a mbǝrha na nda aarha Aropaggus ndang ngganda, “Pǝrang laɓara kan ngga aten weerǝnda tsahadɗa ha kyawa ɓana ɓa tǝghǝn ya. <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Nana a lǝɗang thlǝman nan tǝ palthya pak, na minnan sǝ a sǝn ǝnggina nan ya ngga.” <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />(Atinaya heu tǝ rongya na tǝ tsaurha a mbǝɗi na nda naarha tsaurha hai kee ƙǝl tsǝ laɓara aten weerǝnda palthɗi kyagha ɓa.)<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Thliigha Mbulus sǝ ahu wum tenɗi na a Aropaggus ndǝghǝn, “Nafiya Atina! Naɗi kun nafiya ni na mindan tǝrang shilee faarya teena hangga. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Ƙǝsǝr a naɗi a wiirha hai ahur talɗi ya ni naarha ƙǝlang nda ǝnggini nun naarha tǝrang shilee kanda teena, tǝ ƙǝm naɗi mbǝd nji sataka tǝ chireethla a man tenggǝn tǝ ndaarha, ‘A Faara sǝngwa wa nǝm’. Tur faarɗi nun a tǝrang shilee teena sǝngwa wa nun, ndǝghǝnni ni a pǝrang nda kun.”<verse eid="ACT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />“Faarɗi ǝnagha ƙǝshiirha tǝ ǝngya heu na ahurghǝn ndǝghǝnni Chinǝm yi talara tǝ hweeɗe, mbǝ tsaurha ahu ƙǝnna tǝnna fiya wa. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Mbǝm fǝrang ˈya tǝ haara wa, mbǝ kaɗa thlaara a haar niifa wa, ƙǝsǝr ndǝghǝn tafadghǝn nǝn fǝrang yibrha fiya tǝ fingya ǝngya heu. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />A fad niifa tǝtal ndǝn ǝnanǝn turya fiya ɗǝɗamǝn-ɗǝɗamǝm ahu ƙǝshiirha kahat. Kapa nǝn ǝna kanda sǝnɗǝ sayi kamngga tǝ kanda tǝ ƙǝm mbǝrha kamngga a tsawa nda sǝ.”<verse eid="ACT 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />“Ənana Faara ndǝn kee tǝna fiya kaɗaghǝn asǝmha na nda walang ngganda, ko nanǝn mbǝ inggun ma ƙǝm wa.” <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />“Ƙǝsǝr nǝghǝm tǝ tsaurha ahurghǝn, tǝ wiirha hai, ndǝn nanǝm sǝ a weeriya.”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 17:28">Ƙǝla ndaana fa amshiiyi nun, “Ƙǝm wanggighǝn ni.”<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />“Tsaunǝn ƙǝm wangya Faara ni, mǝmǝlwa numam tǝ ndaarha Faara nǝghǝn ƙǝla ɗaharha taksa fa mbǝr ǝngya tǝ ɗǝɓǝla, nduwa feera nduwa ɗǝfrha wa. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Ƙǝtǝm djiɗangwa Faara tǝ yamid sǝnda fiya wa, amma nanǝnya ndanggǝn fiya heu ko a yanggini a malang ngganda ɗahayi ndan kyakhra nda thlǝmadghǝn ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Ƙǝsǝr ɗǝfang ɗǝ fara hai nǝn a ngwang kumarha ƙǝshiirha yi ƙǝkafek tǝ haar niifɗi wur nǝn. Kyaɗang ɗǝ niifɗi kowunni a pǝpal tǝ thleng nǝn sǝ ahu mǝrra.”<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Hǝrǝm nanda sǝk laɓara aten thliirha sǝ ahu mǝrra, fingya waghǝn nda, fingya ndanda, “Na minnan sǝ a nggǝrgha pǝrang palthɗi kan ya.” <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Tǝrgha malgha Mbulus kogna yini. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Amma fingya mbu samadghǝn nda tsawanda fa fǝrƙǝkafekkya. A hur ndan na Ndiyonisiyus sǝ nǝghǝn tal ahur kogna yini, tǝ nuneefa ƙǝm na thlǝmnggǝn Ndamaris tǝ fingya hangga.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">Mbulus a Koronti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />A kwasamadghǝn, malgha Mbulus Atina ɗǝgha a Koronti ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />A mbǝɗi wal tǝ Yahudarha nǝn sǝ na thlǝmnggǝn Akila, wan chehweed Pontus. Ɓaghǝn ɓa a Italiya kanda tǝ nukkun Pǝrisila, ƙǝsǝr kutǝra Ƙǝlaudiyus ndanggǝn Yahudaya heu a mal Roma nda. Ɗǝgha Mbulus ɗǝ ka a na kanda nǝn, <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />ƙǝsǝr nanǝn targhǝnni taksa chaama ƙǝla na nanda, tsauka a thlǝman ndan ǝna taara nǝn tǝ kanda.<verse eid="ACT 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Kala Far Yibrha nǝn tsǝ laɓara tǝ Yahudaya tǝ Helenaya ahu ƙǝn tsahad Yahudaya, na midghǝn sǝ a lǝm kanda nǝn fa. <verse eid="ACT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Ɓana nda Sila ɓa tǝ Timoti a Makidoniya, ɗǝfgha Mbulus teena hu pǝr laɓar Faara hai, nagha a kyaɗanggǝn Yahudaya tǝ ndaarha Yeeso ndǝna Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Amma ngaalang ngganda Mbulus na nda a ˈyarghǝn, ɗǝghanggǝn tinid ɗa ɗǝ na a fad luwudghǝn ndanggǝn kanda, “A tsauka hakked nun atennun! Mbǝ ɗimiyirha sǝ a fanna wa. Nanǝnya niya ɗǝrha a ki nafiya ɗǝ mbuwa wa Yahudaya.”<verse eid="ACT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Tǝrgha Mbulus mal ƙǝn tsahad Yahudayina nǝn ɗǝgha minda ki Titiyus Djustus ɗǝ, tǝ tǝrang shilee Faara teena. Na kwatkirǝm nggǝn tal tǝ ƙǝn tsahadɗa fa. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Tǝrgha Ƙǝripus mamnda ƙǝn tsahad Yahudaya, heu tǝ wurighǝn fǝr nda ƙǝkafek a Chinǝm. Fingya Korontiyaya hangga sǝkka ndǝn fǝrƙǝkafek nda ǝnang mbaptisǝma nda kanda.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Farɗa sǝ a fiɗikrha kyaɗangga Faara ˈya Mbulus ahu sǝsǝniirha, ndanggǝn, “A tǝrǝmna wa; ɗuwa mbeeɗǝ tǝ laɓar wa, a nggasna hai wa. <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />Niyi tǝ sa ha, mbǝ niifa sǝ ɗǝk sa nduwa ǝno ˈya nǝn fa wa, ƙǝsǝr na nafina sǝ hangga ahu wupǝriɗi ya.” <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Nanǝn kee, tsauka Mbulus yi hurarha tal tǝ mbeera, nagha a tsahang laɓar Faara kanda ha.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Amma a thlakh mbǝdɗi na Nggaliyo ngwamna a chehweed Akaya, wumangga Yahudaya tendan ka a thlengganda Mbulus fa ɓa nda tǝghǝn mbed ngwamna ɓa ka a ngwang kumarha nǝn sǝ. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Ndanda, “Niifɗiya nǝghǝn a lǝm fiya fa a tǝrang shilee nda Faara teena ahu kwamana ˈyaɗana ngyahad nǝm.” <verse eid="ACT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Nana Mbulus a kalgha sǝ kee, ndangga Nggaliyo Yahudaya, “Kun Yahudaya, a ndam ƙǝsanggun kamshiɗiya tǝ ɗimiyirha fa nduwa ǝnaɗǝ ˈya na manggǝn mbuwa wa ngga, kam niya kang thlǝmaarha kun fa. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Amma nanǝn nǝghǝn aten tsakh mee ni ahu laɓara tǝ aten thlǝmngya tǝ ƙǝm ngyahad nun, ngwalaman palthɗi tafad nun, mbi ngwa kumarha aten ǝngya kiya wa.” <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Nanǝn kee, rǝghanggǝn kanda ɗǝ ma ƙǝn ngwa kumadɗi. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Tǝrgha kyakhrang ngganda Sostanus teena mamnda ƙǝn tsahad Yahudaya ɗǝkƙǝnda a kwatkirǝm ƙǝn ngwa kumadɗi. Amma djiɗangwa ˈya Nggaliyo wa.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wud Mbulus a Antakiya ɗǝ na a Suriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />A kwasamad ǝnɗiya mǝngga Mbulus ha a Koronti. Tǝrgha mal fatakkwaya Yeeso nǝn kyagha hu kombuwol hai, mbugha nda Pǝriskila tǝ Akila samadghǝn, ɗǝna nda Suriya ɗǝ. (Kapa nǝn wiirha thlǝrɗang ɗǝ tenggǝn ɗǝ a Kankiriya ƙǝsǝr ka ɗǝfmee ǝnanǝn.) <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Sǝla nda a Afisa ɗǝ, a mbǝɗi malgha Mbulus Pǝriskila hai tǝ Akila. Tǝrgha ndǝghǝnggi tafadghǝn kyagha ahu ƙǝn tsahad Yahudaya ɗǝ ka a tsǝ laɓara tǝ Yahudayini. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Hwanggǝnda a mǝngga ha, amma kargha fa. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Amma kapa nǝn wiirha ndanggǝn kanda, “A nggǝm Faara fa, niya nggǝr wutta ɓa.” Tǝrgha kyagha ahu kombuwol hai mal Afisa nǝn. <verse eid="ACT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Tǝrnǝn hai a Kaisariya, ɗǝgha ka ndangˈya fatakkwaya Yeeso ɗǝ na a mbǝɗi a mbǝrgha a Antakiya ɗǝ.<verse eid="ACT 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />A kwasamadɗi mǝnnǝn ha a Antakiya, thliigha ɗǝgha mbǝya ɗǝ hangga a Nggalasiya tǝ Pilisiya, nagha a ɗang nda fatakkwaya Yeeso sǝ na a tsawa nda tǝ kanglanggirha hu chinǝm.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pǝr Apolos laɓar Faara a Afisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Na tǝ Yahudarha sǝ thlǝmnggǝnni Apolos, ɓagha Afisa ɓa. Nggǝtgha ndan a wupǝri Aledzandariya, tǝ mbǝrmee ni sǝnɗǝ laɓar Faara kaan. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Tsahang nda kwaman Chinǝm ha, tǝ ƙǝm nǝghǝn a tsahang fiya ha tǝ mbǝnafarha fa. Tsahadghǝn ha aten Yeeso nǝghǝn mǝmǝl. Ko nanǝn, mbaptisǝma yi Yahaya ndǝn sǝnnǝn kee. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Katǝranggǝn ndikrha hai tǝ kanglanggirha hu ƙǝn tsahad Yahudaya. Sǝkna nda Pǝriskila tǝ Akila ndǝn aaghǝn nda a minda kyandan ɗǝ pǝrang kwaman Faara nda mǝmǝl.<verse eid="ACT 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Nana mid Apolos ɗǝrha a Akaya ɗǝ, fatakkwaya Yeeso chighang kanglanggirha nda tǝ ƙǝm chireethleng ngganda fatakkwaya Yeeso ɗǝ na a mbǝɗi tǝna nda thlǝghǝn fa. Sǝlnǝn mbǝɗaɗǝ, thlar fingya nǝn kaan fǝrgha ƙǝkafek tǝ nggayid Faara. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Ƙǝsǝr kalɗǝ Yahudayina mu ngaal nǝn tǝ kanda hu yid fiya hangga, kyaɗanggǝnǝn kanda tǝ ndaarha hu ɗeleewar Faara Yeeso ni Ƙǝrǝsti.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Mbulus a Afisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Nana Apolos a Koronti, tǝr Mbulus kwamana ahu chehwedɗi ɗǝgha Afisa ɗǝ. A mbǝɗani ɗǝnǝn wal fatakkwaya Yeeso sǝ. <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />Tsahang mee nǝn kanda, “Fǝr nun ƙǝkafek thlǝɗun Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda fa wa?” Nggǝrang ngganda sǝ, “Awo, kyawan sǝn ndaarha na Sǝsǝnasǝ tǝ Peɗǝnda wa.”<verse eid="ACT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Tsakhka Mbulus mee, “Tur yanggi mbaptisǝma ǝnang nanda kun?” Ndang ngganda, “Mbaptisǝma yi Yahaya.”<verse eid="ACT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Ndagha Mbulus, “Mbaptisǝmad Yahaya yi mal ɗimiyirha ni. Ndanggǝn fiya a fǝrƙǝkafek nda tǝ niifa na ɓayi a samadghǝn, ndǝna Yeeso.”<verse eid="ACT 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Sǝk nanda kee, ǝnang mbaptisǝma nda kanda ahu thlǝm Chinǝm Yeeso. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Ɗǝfang na Mbulus haara kanda teena, ɓagha Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda tendan hai, na nda a ndikrha tǝ miiya pak tǝ ƙǝm na nda thlǝk laɓara ɓagha hai a thlǝmad Faara ƙǝla annabiya. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Kanda hǝshya kumkap sǝri ni.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Tǝrgha Mbulus kyagha hu ƙǝn tsahad Yahudaya ɗǝ nagha a pǝr laɓar Faara tǝ kanglanggirha yi ndǝree mahan, nagha a lǝm kanda fa tǝ thlǝghang laɓar Kutǝryid Faara kanda. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Amma fingya kar nda laɓarghǝn fa. Na nda a ndikrha mbuwa ngga a pǝpal aten kwaman Chinǝm. Malangga Mbulus kanda, wiigha tǝ fatakkwaya Yeeso ɗa nda naarha tsǝ laɓara ƙǝtsar a mbǝd tsaharha ha na a Tǝranus. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Huraya sǝri kanda a ǝnaarha kee, tǝna Yahudaya tǝ Helenaya na tǝ tsaurhahu chehweed Asiya sǝk laɓar Chinǝm.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wangya Skiva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Fǝrang Faara sǝsǝmnda Mbulus a ǝna ǝnwulteengya nǝn na mǝmanggǝn. <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />Ko ǝn pa farha nduwa shishimar tsuwargha ndǝn fa, a ɗang ndan haaya ɗǝ, na nda ƙǝnda tǝ ƙǝm ǝnkaheeya na a fad ndan a kyarha sǝ.<verse eid="ACT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Fingya wumten Yahudaya na a wiirha hai tala-tala kanda a kyang ǝnkaheeya sǝ katǝrang ngganda ǝna taara hai tǝ thlǝm Chinǝm Yeeso. Na nda a ndaarha, “Niyi a ndorha hu thlǝm Yeeso, na Mbulus a pǝr laɓarghǝn, kyosǝ!” <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Wangya hǝshya mǝd yi Skiva mamnda firis Yahudaya kanda na a ǝna ǝnɗiya. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Farɗasǝ nggǝrangga ǝnkahedɗi kanda sǝ, “Sǝnɗi Yeeso, tǝ ƙǝm sǝnɗi Mbulus, amma wunni kun?” <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Tǝrgha niifɗi na tǝ ǝnkahedɗa fa pǝrgha tendan ɗǝ har kanda nǝn yanda kal kanda nǝn mu heu. Ɗǝk kanda nǝn kya nda sǝ tǝ ɗaarha ahur mindǝɗi tawalth tǝ wundiya fa a fad ndan.<verse eid="ACT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Sǝkna Yahudaya ndǝn tǝ Helenaya na tǝ tsaurha a Afisa, tǝrma nda heu, fǝrang mamnggirha nda thlǝm Chinǝm Yeeso kaan. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Fingya hangga fǝrgha ƙǝkafek kya nda pǝpal ɓa na nda a thlǝk ǝn mbǝlfeeya ndan. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Fa kulaya hangga kyagha ɓa tǝ ɗeleewar kulayid ndan njang ngganda ɗǝ a yid fiya. Kirasang nanda ɗeleewar kula yini nǝn sǝl wuɗǝɓǝl rapathlaarha yi ɓeena haru kumnggidghǝn tuf (50,000). <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Nanǝn kee, laɓar Chinǝm aten ɗǝrha mbeeɗǝ fiya hangga kaan a fǝrƙǝkafek.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakyathlaanga a Afisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />A kwasamad ǝnɗi katǝragha hai ya, mid Mbulus ɗǝrha Urshalima ɗǝ, nǝn a kyagha tǝ Makidoniya tǝ Akaya. Ndǝghǝn, “A kwasamadɗi ɗini mbǝɗa ɗǝ, tsauɗǝ tǝta a ɗi Roma ɗǝ.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Thlǝn nafiya nǝn ɗǝ sǝri na a ɗang sǝ nda Timoti tǝ Irastus a ˈwa nda mbee, a Makidoniya ɗǝ, ndǝghǝnggi tsǝgha tsǝɓaku hu chehweed Asiya.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Mǝmǝlla sayidɗi thliigha kakyathlaanga aten takkwa kwaman Chinǝm. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Tǝ ɓǝla na nda aarha Ndemetiriyus, na ɓǝl ƙǝn ɗahad Atemis nggu-ngguchit tǝ wurirha, walang ɗǝ tar wuɗǝɓǝla fa ɓǝlya sǝ hangga. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Wumanggǝn kanda thlǝmadghǝn ɓa tǝ fingya na a ǝna tur tarɗi, ndanggǝn kanda, “Waya, sǝnɗunsǝ nǝghǝm a wal wuɗǝɓǝla ahu tar ɗi kyanǝm ya.”<verse eid="ACT 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Kǝla nanun ndǝn tǝ ƙǝm sǝknun na niifɗiya Mbulus a lǝm fiya fa hangga a Afisa ɗi ya tǝ chehweed Asiya heu. Ndǝghǝn, faarya ǝnana niifa mbǝ faarya ni wa sam. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />“Na wad sǝ mbǝ ka tar nǝm na thlǝmnggǝn a weela ɗǝ katenggǝn wa, amma ƙǝn ɗahad Atemis nǝn a sǝbrha ɗǝ, tǝ ƙǝm Atemis tafadghǝn na nda a ɗǝfang shilee teena ahu chehweed Asiya heu tǝ ƙǝshiirha, nǝn a ƙǝɗeng mamnggidghǝn.”<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Sǝk na ndan kee, sǝbgha hur ndan ɗǝ katǝrang ngganda ahuhwaarha hai, “Atemis yi Afisaya nǝn tǝ mamnggirha!” <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Tsǝɓaku hur wupǝri heu tsǝ teena nda. Kǝsangga fiya nda Nggayus tǝ Aristakus kawiya Mbulus a Makidoniya ɓa, kowunni ƙǝl ɗaarha mbǝd wumteena ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Na mid Mbulus sǝ a kyagha hur fiya ɗǝ wumngga hai, amma karang fatakkwaya Yeeso fa. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Ko fingya mamngya na hu chehwedɗi, pashiya Mbulus, thlǝnang laɓara nda ɗǝ a kyaɗǝ a mbǝd wumten ɗa ɗǝ wa.<verse eid="ACT 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Fiya wumngga hai na nda ahu tsǝ teena. Fingya na nda ahuhwaarha aten ˈya tǝtal, fingya aten ˈya pak. Fiya hangga sǝngwanda ǝnɗi ɓangga kanda mbǝɗa ɓa wa. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Yahudayini puwang ngganda Aledzanda a mbeeɗǝ, na a thlǝk ˈya nǝn a fiya. Tǝranggǝn harghǝn sǝ na a nggasgha fiya hai ka kalanggǝn kanda sǝ aten ˈya wumangga kanda hai. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Amma sǝnang nanda hai tǝ Yahudarha ni, kanda heu tǝrang ngganda urad ndan sǝ na nda a mbeela fa yi sayi sǝri tǝ ndaarha, “Atemis yi Afisaya nǝn tǝ mamnggirha!”<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Tǝ chirethla wupǝri ɗi nggasanggǝn fiya hai wumngga hai ndǝghǝn, “Nafiya Afisa, ƙǝshiirha heu sǝnda sǝ wupǝri Afisa ndǝghǝnni tǝ Mamnda Atemis ha, tǝ shishing ndǝghǝn mukka hai a talara a ƙǝm. <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Tsaunǝn kee, mbǝ ngaala sǝ ahu palthɗi ya wa, nggasama hai a ǝnaɗun ˈya kula numaarha wa. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Ɓa ɗun tǝ nafini mbǝɗa ɓa ya, mbǝ ngaar nanda a ƙǝn ɗahad nǝm wa tǝ ƙǝm sar wa nda ɗahadnǝm wa. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />A naɗǝ Ndemetirus tǝ fa taryighǝn na nda tǝ ɓillaarha aten kowunni, na ƙǝn ngwa kumarha sǝ, ɗǝnda ɗǝ ɗa nda huhwaarha. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Ana ˈya sǝ pak na minnun a thluwun ɗaama tǝghǝn a mbed shingya wupǝri ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Ƙǝla nanǝnya, nǝghǝm ahu waarha a naɗǝm a mbeela fa kiya wa ƙǝsǝr ka ǝngya na a wiirha hai a weeriya. Nanǝn mbǝ ten palth kakyathlang ɗa sǝ ya wa, mbǝ ˈyasǝ nǝm thlǝkrha aten ǝnɗi nun a ǝnaarha nanǝnya wa.” <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />A kwasamadɗi ngwalang nǝn palthghǝn kal fiya nǝn hai.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Kyad Mbulus Makidoniya hai tǝ Helas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Ngwalana kakyathlaanga, tǝrgha Mbulus aah fatakkwaya Yeeso nǝn, a kwasamadɗi fǝrang nǝn kanglanggirha kanda, ɗǝgha Makidoniya ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Ɗǝgha mbǝya ɗǝ hangga nagha fǝrang kanglanggirha fatakkwaya Yeeso tǝ palthya hangga ta sǝlgha a Helas ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />Tsauka a Helas yi ndǝree mahan. Nanǝn a ngwarha fa nǝn a tǝra ahu kombuwol hai ka a ɗǝgha Suriya ɗǝ, ashe Yahudayini kǝnang nda hai na a ǝnang ˈya nda fa, tǝrgha wudgha kyagha tǝ Makidoniya.<verse eid="ACT 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Nda Sufata wan Farus a Mbiriya, tǝ Aristakus, tǝ Sakundus, nafiya Tasalonika, tǝ Nggayus niif Ndarɓe, tǝ Timoti, kanda nda Tikikus tǝ Tarofimus, nafiya Asiya, na mindan sǝ a ɗǝnda Suriya ɗǝ tǝghǝn. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Nafiniya ˈwa nda mbeeɗǝ ƙǝla kan nda fa a Torawus. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Ngwalana wutsǝfayid mburodi kula mekhna thlen a Filibi tǝ nggirggi, akwasamad ɓeena tuf ɗan wal fingyayini a Torawus tsawan a mbǝɗi yi ɓeena mǝd.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngwala mii wii tal Mbulus a Torawus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />A katǝra thlǝtta ɓeena wuman hai ka a ndǝghanggan mburodi hai. Tǝrgha Mbulus pǝrang laɓar Faara nǝn kanda. Na midghǝn sǝ mal kanda a ɗalth mbǝrha hai ɗǝgha mbeeɗǝ tǝ pǝr laɓar Faara ta manad fiɗikrha ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />A hu ƙǝnɗi tǝnna nda aten shadghǝn wumnan sa hai na patillaya sǝ hangga. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Na niifa sǝ tsauka hai a kwat ƙǝnna thlǝmnggǝn Yutikus, na ɓeena a sǝsang nda a sayidɗi na Mbulus a pǝr laɓar Faara. Tǝrgha tǝrangga ɓeena Yutikus ɗǝ, mukka hai a kwat ƙǝnɗi tǝnna nda aten shadghǝn yi mahan, tǝrang ngganda sǝ mǝmǝra. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Nanǝn kee, tǝrgha Mbulus hweeɗa hai, ɓǝrgha ten wanɗa hai fǝɓanggǝn, ndagha, “A ɓillaɗun wa, ɓalghǝn tǝ yibrha.” <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Tǝrgha nggǝrghǝn wutta talara sǝ kyanggǝn mburodi ɗa hai kyan heu. Ɗǝgha mbeeɗǝ tǝ pǝrang laɓar Faara kanda har ɗalthgha mbǝrha hai a wiigha. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Tǝrgha nafini tǝrang ngganda wundǝladɗi wure ɗǝ tǝ yibrha na nda a ǝna wutsǝfayirha.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thliigha Mbulus a Torawus ɗǝgha Militus ɗǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Wiigha Mbulus tǝ saara a Asus ɗǝ. Kan ƙǝm ɗan mbǝɗaɗǝ tǝ nggirggi ka a tǝranggan. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Ɗǝnǝn wal kan a Asus, tǝranggan tǝ nggirggi a Mitilin ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Ɗalthna mbǝrha hai thlen tǝ nggirggi sǝlan Kiyos ɗǝ. Nggǝrna mbǝrha ɗathla hai tǝɗan a Samos ɗǝ. A kwasamad ɓeena tal sǝlan a Militus ɗǝ.<verse eid="ACT 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Mbǝ mid Mbulus sǝ a ishgha hai a Afisa wa, ƙǝsǝr mbǝ midghǝn sǝ a mbǝdgha hai a Asiya wa, nǝghǝn a yawiirha na a sǝlgha a Urshalima ɗǝ wed, a naɗǝ a ǝnaarha hai a far Wutsǝfayid Pentikos.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndik Mbulus tǝ shingya Ƙǝn Faara a Afisa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />A Miletus ni thlǝnna Mbulus farha ɗǝ a ang shingya Ƙǝn Faara nda ɓa na a Afisa ɓa nda walghǝn. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Ɓa nanda walghǝn, ndanggǝn kanda, “Kun tafad nun sǝnɗun tur tsawud na a sayidɗi nani tǝ kun ka a farɗi ɗǝfang ni sarna a chehweed Asiya hai. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Ənangɗi taara Chinǝm kula manang alteena tǝ thlee hura ƙǝm, ko nanǝn saaɗi ƙǝƙǝrra fa tǝ tar mbǝlfeerha ǝneena Yahudaya fa. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Sǝnɗun sǝ karwi pǝrang ˈya kun na thlar kun wa, tǝ ƙǝm tsahangɗi kun ha a pǝpal tǝ wure-wure. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Pǝrangɗi ndǝn Yahudaya tǝ fingya mbuwa Yahudaya na a malangganda ɗimiyid ndan kyakhra nda thlǝmad Faara ɓa fǝrƙǝkafek nda a Chinǝm Yeeso.”<verse eid="ACT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />“Nanǝnya, Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda a shik nggi, ka a ɗi Urshalima ɗǝ, sǝngwi ǝnɗi ɗǝgha katǝrarha hai tǝ nggi a mbǝɗi wa. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />ˈYa sǝnni sǝ kee kala wupǝri ɗǝni saaɗǝ na Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda naarha ƙǝs thlǝmanna tǝ ndaarha nda ɗǝrha hu porsǝna ɗǝ tǝ sǝsaarha na nda a ƙǝla nggi fa. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Amma nggi mbiyi a ƙǝlang yiɓǝnna ƙǝla ˈya ni wa, na minna sǝ kee a ngwalanggi tarɗi fǝree na Chinǝm Yeeso a ǝnee, tar pǝr Laɓara na Mbǝnggǝn yi nggayid Faara.”<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />“Nanǝnya, sǝnɗisǝ mbusǝ ahur nun pǝrang ni laɓar Kutǝryid Faara na nggǝr na nggi wa. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Tsaunǝn kee, niya pǝrang ndaarha kun a weeriya mbǝ hakked niifa sǝ atenna wa. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Pǝrangɗi ˈya kun heu na mid Faara a sǝnggunǝn.”<verse eid="ACT 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Kǝlama altennun ha tǝ nafiya fǝrangna Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda kun a laf kanda nun. Tsawama ƙǝla falafya nafiya Faara. Chiɓǝdghǝn ni hiinǝn tǝ far Wanggǝn. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />“Sǝnɗi sǝ a kwasamadɗi malni kun, na mǝmereeya a kyarha hur nun hai mba nda a mal chiɓǝdɗi wa. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />A hur nun ƙǝm na fingya sǝ na a thliirha sǝ thlǝk palth nggaɓaarha nda ka a kyang ngganda fingya sǝ ahu fǝrƙǝkafekkidɗi, tǝna nda mbu samandan. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Nanǝn kee kwarama! Ɗalama teena hai hurarha mahan ˈwawi malang ƙǝs thlǝman nun nda fiɗikrha tǝ yanfaara tǝ aam yirha wa.”<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />Nanǝnya wumangɗi kun tǝ Faara tǝ laɓar nggayidghǝn, na mbang tǝnang kunsǝ fǝrang langaarha nǝn kun heu tǝ fingya ɗǝfang nǝn haara teena.<verse eid="ACT 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />“ˈWawi suna wuɗǝɓǝl niifa nduwa karidghǝn wa. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Sǝnɗunsǝ ǝnayi taara tǝ harna ƙǝrni fadna sǝ tǝ fingya nani tǝ kanda. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />A hu ǝngya ǝnani heu, kyaɗang ɗi ndǝn kun tǝ ndaarha, tǝta ni a ǝna taara nun kiya tǝnun thlar fingya mbuwa tǝghǝn ha. Nam a ɗal teena hai tǝ palth Chinǝm Yeeso ndaanǝn, ‘Nagha parka sǝ kaan hu fǝra ma thlǝrha.’”<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />A kwasamadɗi ngwalang nǝn laɓara, ɓǝrgha hai tǝ kanda heu hwan Faara nda. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Kanda heu muk tǝrha nda fǝbghǝn nda. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />ˈYa sǝɓangga hur ndanɗǝ kaan ƙǝsǝr ka laɓarghǝn ndanǝn mba nda a nggǝr nang yirha fa wa. Tǝrgha ɗǝfang ngganda ahu nggirggi ɗǝ.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Wii tal Mbulus a Urshalima ɗǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />A kwasamadɗi mal nan kanda, kyan hu nggirggi hai ɗan Kos ɗǝ. Ɗathna mbǝrha hai sǝlan Rodes ɗǝ thlen a mbǝɗi ƙǝm ɗan Pataara ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Ɗan wal nggirggi na a ɗǝrha Finikiya ɗǝ, kyan sa hai wen. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Akwasamad ɗi na nan Sayifurus mbǝran ɗǝ tsanggan a man kodnan ɗǝ, ɗan Suriya ɗǝ. Tǝran hai a Taya, mal nggirggi ɗa nan ka haarang ngganda rǝfrha hai ahurghǝn. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />A mbǝɗi wal fatakkwaya nan tsawan tǝ kanda yi ɓeena mǝd. Nagha Sǝsǝn Faara a shik kanda ndang ngganda Mbulus a ɗǝɗǝ Urshalima ɗǝ wa. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Amma lǝghǝdna ɓen tsawud nan tǝ kanda, wuɗan ɓan wal nggirggiɗi ɗan mbeeɗǝ tǝ winnan. Fa takkwayini heu kanda tǝ nishyindan tǝ wanggindan ɗǝfang ngganda kanɗǝ ma wupǝriɗi. A mii wuri aamɗi ɓǝran hai hwan Faara nan. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />A kwasamad ɗi ndǝk nan hai tǝ ndan, kyan hu nggirggi hai kanda ƙǝm wuɗa nda wure ɗǝ.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Ɗan mbeeɗǝ tǝ winnan a Taya sǝlan Tolemayis ɗǝ, a mbǝɗi ndangˈya nan fa fǝrƙǝkafekkya. Tsawan tǝ kanda yi ɓeena tal. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Ɗalthna mbǝrha hai, nduwan Kaisariya ɗǝ, tsawan a minda ki Filibus tǝ pǝr laɓar Faara. Nǝghǝn tal ahur nafini mǝd wur nanda na a ndǝk ǝnnarhami ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Na wutarayighǝn sǝ faɗa na nda thlǝk ˈya na a katǝrarha hai a mbee.<verse eid="ACT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />A kwasamadɗi tsau nan a mbǝɗi yi ɓeena hangga ɓagha annabi ɓa a Ndjudiya thlǝmnggǝn ni Anggabus. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Ɓana Anggabus thlǝman nan ɓa, tǝranggǝn ǝn ƙǝnda mu Mbulus, ƙǝnanggǝn saryighǝn tǝ haryighǝn tǝghǝn. Tǝrgha ndǝghǝn, “Ndagha Sǝsǝn Faara, ‘Na mamngya Yahudaya a ƙǝnang nda tǝ ǝn ƙǝn muwa ƙǝla yanɗiya a Urshalima fǝranggǝnda nafiya mbuwa wa Yahudaya.’ ” <verse eid="ACT 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Sǝknan ndǝn kee, kan tǝ fingya fatakkwaya na a mbǝɗi, hwan Mbulus nan a ɗǝɗǝ Urshalima ɗǝ wa.<verse eid="ACT 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Amma ndagha Mbulus, “Kama nun a tǝrha? Kun a thleng hurna! Nggi ngwaɗi fa mbǝ ka muweeghanda hu porsǝna ɗǝ a Urshalima kee wa, amma a mǝri ka Chinǝm Yeeso.” <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Mbang ngwanan kyakhrang hurghǝn hai, ndan kee, “Ƙǝl ˈya ǝnana Faara.”<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sǝl Mbulus a Urshalima ɗǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Akwasamad ǝnɗiya ngwanggan rǝf yinan ɗan Urshalima ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Fingya fatakkwaya na a Kaisariya mbunda samannan. Ɗǝnda tǝ kan minda ki Manason ɗǝ, tǝ Sayifurus tal ahur fatakkwaya ƙǝtǝm. <verse eid="ACT 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Sǝl nan Urshalima ɗǝ thlǝgha fatakkwaya kan fa ngga.<verse eid="ACT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Ɗalthna mbǝrha hai, kan nda Mbulus ɗan thlǝmad Yakubu ɗǝ, shingya Ƙǝn Faara heu na nda a mbǝɗi. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Ndangga Mbulus ˈya kanda pǝrang ˈya nǝn kanda heu ǝnana Faara ahur nafiya mbuwa wa Yahudaya ahu targhǝn.<verse eid="ACT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Sǝk nanda ǝnɗi kee fal Faara nda. Tǝrgha ndang ngganda Mbulus, “Nannan, wan man, Yahudaya hangga fǝrgha ƙǝkafek, kanda heu tǝr mindan sǝ a takkwa ngyakhrha Musa. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Amma pǝrang ndan kanda tǝ ndaarha, na tsahang Yahudaya ha na tǝ tsaurha ahur fingya mbuwa wa Yahudaya a malangganda tsahad ɗeleewar Musa. Nana a ndang nda kanda a thleng nda muwa wanggindan wa nduwa ƙǝm takkwa ǝntin nǝm nda wa. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Nanǝnya ma nǝm ǝnaarha? Ƙǝsǝr na nda a sǝk ndaarha ƙǝkafek ɓanna ɓa.”<verse eid="ACT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Nanǝn kee ǝno ˈya nan a thlǝworha. Na nafiya sǝ faɗa a thlǝman nǝm a mbǝɗiya ɗǝfgha mee. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Ɗuwaɗǝ tǝ kanda ahu Ƙǝn Faara ɗǝ yi Yahudaya ɗa wumteena tǝ kanda ahu tsuthlang kanda ɗǝ tǝ ƙǝm tii wuɗǝɓǝl thlǝrǝttǝ ndan. A ǝnanna kee na fiya sǝnda sǝ palthɗi na nda a sǝkrha atenwa nggaɓaarha ni, sa ƙǝm ǝna taara na tǝ ˈya ndaana ngyakhrha Yahudaya.<verse eid="ACT 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />“Amma fatakkwaya mbuwa Yahudaya, chireethleng ɗan kanda ɗǝ tǝ ndaarha: A malang ngganda ǝna ˈya mii thleng nanda ɗaharha, tǝ saa faara, tǝ kii maɓi tefreng nanda uradghǝn tǝ kulafayirha.”<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Ɗalthna mbǝrha hai harangga Mbulus nafini tsaɓanggǝn fadghǝn ɗǝ heu tǝ kanda. Tǝrgha ɗǝgha hu Ƙǝn Hwan Faara ɗǝ yi Yahudaya ka a pǝrang ndaarha nǝn kanda ɓad far lǝghǝtta ɓen tsabrha fandan ɓa, farɗa ni na nanda a ǝna sataka a kowunni ahur ndan.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ƙǝsang nda Mbulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Takhna ɓenɗi mǝd a lǝghǝtta, fingya Yahudaya ɓagha ɓa a chehweed Asiya na Mbulus nda ahu Ƙǝn hwan Faara yi Yahudaya. Shik fiya nda a ƙǝsang ngganda, <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />tǝrang ngganda urad ndan sǝ, “Nafiya Isǝreela, ɗaaman kan sǝ! Niifɗani ya na tsahang fiya ha heu ko a yanggi ni aten tsan nafinǝm tǝ ngyakhrǝ nǝm tǝ mbǝɗiya ƙǝm. Mbǝ kee ma wa ɓa ɗa ɓa tǝ Helenaya a ƙǝn ɗa ɓa ya nagha a sǝɓang nda mbǝɗa ɗǝ na tsǝtsaɓaɗǝ ya. <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Nanda Trofimus tǝ Afisarha ahu wupǝri tǝ Mbulus tamngga nda ndaarha ɓa Mbulus tǝghǝn ƙǝn hwan Yahudaya ɓa.”<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Thliigha wupǝriɗi kahad na nda a kyarha ɓa a mbǝya ɓa ɗǝɗamǝn. Ƙǝsang ngganda Mbulus kahang ngganda ƙǝsha ɓa ma ƙǝn hwan Faarɗi nggǝlang ngganda kwatkirma ƙǝkar. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Nana mindan a ɓǝlang ngganda, sǝlgha laɓara thlǝmad mamnda sodjaya Roma ɗǝ tǝ ndaarha wupǝri ahu tsǝteena. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Tsu kee har fingya sodjaya nǝn tǝ mamnggindan ɗaa nda mbǝɗa ɗǝ wumna fiya sa hai. Nana fiya mamnda sodjaɗi tǝ sodjayighǝn, malang ngganda ɗǝk Mbulus. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Ndagha Mamnda sodja yini a ƙǝsang ngganda ƙǝnang ngganda tǝ wuyiwurya sǝri. Tǝrgha tsakh mee nǝn tǝ wunni ndǝghǝn mani ǝnanǝn. <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Fingya ahur fiya wumngga hai thlǝk ˈya nda kiya, fingya ƙǝm pak. Nanǝn mamnda sodja ɗi walwa ƙǝkafekkid palthɗi wa ƙǝsǝr ka mbeela, ndǝghǝn a ɗǝnda tǝ Mbulus a mbǝd tsawud sodjaya ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Ɗǝna Mbulus a mbǝd tǝra sǝ, kakyathlaanga mulɗa hai kaan, tǝrgha tǝrangga sodja yini ura ka hang nda fiya. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Fiya wumngga hai na a mbu samad ndan tǝrang ngganda urad ndan sǝ na nda a ndaarha, “Ɓǝla man, ɓǝla man!”<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kalang Mbulus fiya sǝ wumngga hai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Na sodja yini a ɗǝrha tǝ Mbulus a mbǝd ndan ɗǝ, tsahang mee nǝn mamnda sodja yini, “na nggǝm fa a kaloyi sǝ wa?” Nggǝrangga mamnda sodja ɗa sǝ, “Mbang na mii Helenarha wa? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Mbǝ sa ni tǝ Masar ɗi thlengga yanda tǝ ƙǝm ɓangga fa ɓǝl faaya haru kumnggidghǝn faɗa a kaheerha ɓa ahu ɓenggini mbǝrgha ɗǝ wa?”<verse eid="ACT 21:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Nggǝrangga Mbulus sǝ, “Nggi tǝ Yahudarha ni, ɓayi ɓa a Tarsus na a chehweed Silisiya, wupǝri na manggǝn. Niya hwan sa, male kalanggi nafina sǝ ya.” <verse eid="ACT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Wal nǝn kwamana a haar mamnda sodja ɗi, ishgha a mbǝd tǝra tǝrang haara nǝn fiya sǝ a nggasa nda hai. Nggasa nanda hai, ndanggǝn kanda tǝ mii Aramayarha:<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />“Kun na wanmanggina tǝ chinggina keema thlǝmaarha fa pǝrang ǝnɗani kun katǝragha hai, ka kyaɗang ndaarha ni kun ǝna wii ˈya na ɗimi wa.” <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Sǝk nandan kalang ɗǝ kanda sǝ tǝ mii Aramayarha, nggǝrghanda nggasa titib. <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />Tǝrgha Mbulus ndanggǝn kanda, “Tǝ Yahudarha ni nggi, nggǝtgha nda nggi a Tarsus, a wupǝri Silisiya. Manggi sǝ a Urshalima, a kamu Nggamaliyel ni tsaha ni ǝngya heu aten ngyakhrha tǝ ǝntin chingginǝm. Sǝrǝkɗi fǝrang mamnggirha Faara, kǝla nanun a ǝnaarha a weeriya. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Sǝsang ɗi nafiya na a takkwa kwaman Yeeso. Nggi a fǝr kanda a ɓǝlang ngganda kanda, nggi a kǝnang nda fiya hǝshya tǝ nishya, muwanggi kanda ahu porsǝna ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Mamnda Firistayini tǝ kwagnaya hǝu na nda pǝr ˈya atenna. Ƙǝsǝr a haar ndan ni thlǝni ɗeleewar ɗi a ɓanggǝni wanmangginǝm ɓa Yahudaya na a Ndimaska. Ɗǝni mbǝɗaɗǝ ka ƙǝsanggi fatakkwaya, a ɓee tǝ kanda a Urshalima ɓa, ka a sǝsang ngganda kanda.”<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />“Nani aten kwamana, takhɗi a sǝla Ndimaska ɗǝ yanfaara a sǝrǝkrha, tǝrgha djargha kukwaryirha a mbǝɗa hai nani sǝ. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Fǝli hweeɗa hai sǝk urarha ni a ndeerha, ‘Shawulu, Shawulu, kama nda na a sǝseerha?’”<verse eid="ACT 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />“Nggini na Yeeso tǝ Nadzarat na a sǝsang nda.” <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Nafini na a thlǝmadna nanda kukwaryidɗi, amma sǝnangwanda uradɗa hai na kalee sǝ wa.<verse eid="ACT 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />“Tǝrgha tsakh mee ni ndee, ‘Chinǝm, ma ni ǝnaarha?’ Ndagha, ‘Thliusǝ, kyo ahur Ndimaska hai, a mbǝɗani nanda pǝro ˈya na a ǝnaarha.’”<verse eid="ACT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />“Kwamaɗi ka djarra kukwaryidɗa hai, nafini nani tǝ kanda ndǝn ƙǝsgha harna ahur Ndimaska ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />Na niifasǝ tǝ tsaurha a mbǝɗi thlemnggǝn Hananiya, ɓagha thlǝmanna ɓa. Niifani na a tǝrang shilee Faara teena tǝ ƙǝkafekkirha tǝ ƙǝm a laf ngyahad nǝm, Yahudaya hǝu a falghǝn. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Ɓagha thlǝmanna ɓa ndeeghǝn, ‘Wanmana Shawulu, no mana hai!’ Tsu a mbǝɗi kee nee a naghǝn.”<verse eid="ACT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Tǝrgha ndagha Hananiya, “Faara yi chichiyinǝm wurɗǝ sa ka a sǝn ˈyana na midghǝn tǝ ƙǝm na Nggayid Yanɗa na sǝk uradghǝna. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Na a tsaurha tǝ pǝr laɓarghǝn ɗǝ a fiya heu aten ˈya naa nana tǝ sǝk nana. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Nanǝnya mana a ƙǝlaarha? Thliusǝ ǝno mbaptisǝma nda tsaɓo ɗimiyid wa nda ɗǝ tǝna naarha aah thlǝm Chinǝm.”<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />“Wud ni a Urshalima ɗǝ, nggi a hwan Faara ahu kǝn Yahudaya kyaɗeegha Faara ˈya ahu sǝsǝniirha. <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />Na Yeeso ni a ndeerha, ‘Thliu sǝ ƙǝkar! Malu Urshalima wed, ƙǝsǝr nafini a mbǝɗiya mba nda fǝrƙǝkafek tǝ laɓarɗi na a thlǝkrha atenna ya wa.’”<verse eid="ACT 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Nggi kǝm ndee, “ ‘Chinǝm, nafini ya sǝndasǝ ni naarha ɗǝrha hu ƙǝn tsaharha ɗǝ tǝtal, tǝtal nggi a kǝnang tǝ ɗǝk fingya fǝrgha ƙǝkafek a sa. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Ɓǝlang nanda tǝ pǝr laɓar wa Istifanus, nggi tǝ altenna ƙǝt a mbǝɗi, kǝnang pama ni kanda mu, nggi ƙǝm ƙǝlagha karid nafina ha ɓǝlangga.’<verse eid="ACT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />“Tǝrgha Chinǝm ndeeghǝn, ‘Ɗuwaɗǝ, niya thlǝn sa a mbǝrha ɗǝ iunggǝn a thlǝmad nafiya ɗǝ mbuwa wa Yahudaya.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Nafini wumngga hai kang thlǝmaarha nda Mbulus fa ta mii ngwala palthghǝn ɓa. Tǝrgha tǝrang ngganda urad ndan sǝ, “Weema tǝ niif ɗiya ɗun ɓǝlang nda! Kamngwa a mal kamshi ɗa nǝm tǝ yibrha hu ƙǝshiirha ya wa!” <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Na nda a huhwarha kanda a muwang parkoyindan ɗǝ, nanda a thleng tǝniirha sǝ.<verse eid="ACT 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kyad Mbulus fadghǝn tǝ Romarha ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Nanǝn kee, mamnda Sodja Romaɗi ndagha a ɗǝnda tǝ Mbulus a mbǝd tsawud sodjaya ɗǝ a tsahang mee nda ha tsaɗaghǝn nda tǝ wutǝteerha, ka a sǝn ˈya nda katǝragha hai na fiya a huhwarha kee. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Amma a kwasamadɗi kǝnang nanda ka tsaɗaghǝn nda, tǝrgha ndangga Mbulus mamnda sodja na ƙǝt a mbǝɗi, “Ashe nǝn mǝmǝl ndana ngyakrha a tsaɗa niifa nda tǝ Romarha, sa kula ngwang kumarha sǝ wa?”<verse eid="ACT 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Sǝkna sodja Roma yi ndǝn kee, tǝrgha ɗǝgha thlǝmad mamndǝɗa ɗǝ ndanggǝn, “Mana ǝnaarha miya? Niifɗiya fa tǝ Romarha ni,”<verse eid="ACT 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Tǝrgha mamnɗǝɗi ndanggǝn Mbulus, “pǝre ƙǝkafek, tǝ Romarha ni sa wa?” Nggǝmangga Mbulus, “Ghǝng.”<verse eid="ACT 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Tǝrgha ndagha mamndǝɗi, “Nggi fa tiiɗi wuɗǝɓǝla hangga ka a tsawi tǝ Romarha.” Ndagha Mbulus, “Nggi nggǝtta tǝ Romarha ni.”<verse eid="ACT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Nafini na mindan sǝ a tsahang mee nda ha nggǝranda samarha ɗǝ tsu. Mamnɗǝɗi tǝ altenggǝn sǝnnǝnsǝ Mbulus tǝ Romarha ni tǝrǝmngga, ƙǝsǝr ˈwaɗǝ teena ndaɗǝ a kǝnang ngganda tǝ ƙǝm tsaɗaghǝnda.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbulus a mbed kognaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Ɗalthana mbǝrha hai mamɗǝɗi na midghǝn a sǝn ƙǝkafekkid huhwad Yahudaya aten Mbulus, tǝrgha kwasanggǝn hai, aah mamngya firistaya nǝn tǝ kognaya heu a wuma nda ɓa. Tǝrgha ɓaghaɓa tǝ Mbulus ishanggǝn a mbendan.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Tǝrgha Mbulus irang yirha nǝn kognayina fa ndagha, “Kun wanmanggina, ngwalangɗi tarna a Faara ahu kwamana na mǝmǝl heu ta weeri ɗa ɓa ya.” <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Sǝkna Hananiya palthɗi keeghǝn kee ndanggǝn nafini na tsau tǝ Mbulus fa a mbighǝnda. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Tǝrgha Mbulus ndanggǝn, “Na Faara a mbi sa, sa fad kǝnna ni kǝmonda tǝ penti pǝpet, tsauna a mbǝɗi nana a ngwe kumarha sǝ aten ngyakhrha, amma sa tǝ altenwa hwasang na ngyahadɗi ndana a ndǝk nggi nda!”<verse eid="ACT 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Fingya na ƙǝƙǝt tsau tǝ Mbulus fa ndang ngganda, “Firis na manggǝn yi Faara ndǝna ˈyaara?”<verse eid="ACT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Ndangga Mbulus kanda, “Wanmanggina sǝngwi sǝ ndǝghǝnni firis na manggǝn wa, ƙǝsǝr ndagha ɗeleewar Faara, ‘A thlǝkna ˈya na ɗimi aten mamnda nafiwa wa.’ ” <verse eid="ACT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Kǝlaana Mbulus hai, fingya kognaya Sadukiyaya ni, fingya kǝm Farisaya, tǝranggǝn uradghǝn sǝ ndagha, “Wanmanggina, tǝ Farisarha ni nggi, chichiyina wai kee. Niyi ahu kǝkǝrra ƙǝsǝr ka nana mbǝrsad na aten thliirha sǝ ahu mǝrra.”<verse eid="ACT 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Ndana Mbulus kee, thliigha kakyathlaanga sǝ a pathlang Farisaya tǝ Sadukiyaya, ndǝkka kognayina hai mbǝdghǝn sǝri. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />Ƙǝsǝr ndagha Sadukiyaya mbǝ thliirha sǝ hu mǝrra wa, mbǝ fathlǝngya sǝ wa, nduwa sǝsǝngya, amma Farisaya fǝr nda ƙǝkafek tǝ ǝnggini hǝu. <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Tǝrgha thliigha kakyathlaanga sǝ kaan, fingya fa malǝmgya ngyakhrha Musa na Farisaya thlii nda sǝ ƙǝt ngaala nda tǝ kanglanggirha. Ndanda, “Nawan ˈya na ɗimi a fad niifɗiya wa. Ana sǝsǝna ni nduwa, tǝthlǝnda Faara ndikka tǝghǝn wu?” <verse eid="ACT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Kakyathlang ɗi mul ɗa hai kaan har mamnda sodja ɗi tǝrǝmngga na ɗa nda thlusang nda Mbulus hai kushir-kushir. Ndanggǝn sodja yini a ɗa nda tǝrang Mbulus tǝ kanglanggirha ma thlǝmad ndan, ɓa nda tǝghǝn mbǝd tsawud sodjaya ɓa.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Tsǝna fiɗikrha hai ishgha Chinǝm ƙǝt a thlǝmad Mbulus ndanggǝn, “Ishiu tǝ kanglanggirha, kǝla pǝrna laɓarna a Urshalima, tsawo ɗa fa tǝta a pǝrghǝnna a Roma.”<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kǝnang nda hai a ɓǝlang ngganda Mbulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Ɗalthna mbǝrha hai, kǝnangga Yahudayina hai tǝ ɗǝf mee mba nda a hǝbrha nduwa saarha wa ƙǝl ma ɓǝlang nda Mbulus. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Nafini ǝnagha tar mbǝlfedɗi kal nda kumnggit faɗa. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Ɗǝnda thlǝmad mamngya firistaya ɗǝ tǝ shingya ndanda, “Ƙǝnang ɗan hai tǝ ɗǝf mee tǝ ndaarha mban a hǝbrha tǝ sarha wa kǝl ma ɓǝlang ɗan Mbulus.<verse eid="ACT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Nanǝnya, kun tǝ kognaya ndaman mamnda sodjaya a ɓagha tǝghǝn a mbed nun ɓa, kǝla na minnun sǝ a nggǝrwun tsahang mee ha ngga, kanggi kǝm nan nggungwa fa a ɓǝlanggan kapa nǝn ɓarha ɓa.”<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Amma sǝkna yangan Mbulus pathla ɗi kǝnang nanda hai, ɗǝgha mbǝd tsawud sodja yina ɗǝ pǝrang nggǝnǝn Mbulus.<verse eid="ACT 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Tǝrgha Mbulus aah tal nǝn ahur sodja Romayini ndanggǝn, “Ɗuwa tǝ wundǝladɗi a thlǝmad mamnda ɗǝ na pathla sǝ na midghǝn pǝrang nda.”<verse eid="ACT 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Nanǝn kee, sodjaɗi tǝranggǝn wundǝladɗi ɗǝgha tǝghǝn thlǝmad mamnɗǝɗa ɗǝ. “Mbulus wan tǝ porsǝnɗiya, ndǝn aagha nggi, hwan nggi nǝn a ɓee tǝ wundǝladɗi a thlǝmad wa ɓa ya, ƙǝsǝr na ˈya sǝ miighǝn nǝn a pǝrorha.”<verse eid="ACT 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Tǝrgha mamnɗǝɗi kǝsanggǝn har wundǝladɗi ɗǝgha tǝghǝn man patu ɗǝ, tsahang mee nǝn ha, “Mani a mii wa?”<verse eid="ACT 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Ndagha, “Mamngya Yahudaya kǝnang nda hai nanda hwan sa ɗǝna tǝ Mbulus a mbed kognaya ɗǝ a ɓinda, kǝla na mindan sǝ a nggǝrgha nda tsahang mee ha ngga. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Amma a nggǝmang kanda fa wa, ƙǝsǝr fiya kal nda kumnggit faɗa tsǝb nda hai ka a ɓǝlang ngganda. Nanǝnya ɗǝf nda mee mba nda a hǝbrha tǝ sarha wa kǝl ma ɓǝlang nda. Na nda a kǝla sa fa kee a nggǝmana fa,”<verse eid="ACT 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Tǝrgha mamndǝɗi ƙǝs thlǝmadghǝnǝn ndanggǝn, “Ma pǝrang nan niifa tǝ ndaarha thlǝyed nan wa.”<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thlǝnang nda Mbulus a thlǝmad Ngwamna Felis ɗǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Tǝrgha aagha mamnda sodja yini sǝri ahur sodjayighǝn ndanggǝn kanda, “Ngwama fa ƙǝsǝr nun a ɗǝrha Kaisariya ɗǝ a fiɗikrha, tǝ sodjaya haru kumnggit sǝri, tǝ sodjaya a ƙǝsǝr pǝrsaya kumnggit mǝd, tǝ sodjaya na yanda tǝ peela haru kumnggit sǝri. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Kaɗaman pǝrsaya Mbulus sǝ nǝn a tǝrha ɗun tǝghǝn thlǝmad Ngwamna Felis ɗǝ kula ˈya tsǝwarghǝn.” <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Tǝrgha chireelth ɗeleewar ɗa nǝn ya a ngwamna:<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />A har Kalaudiyus Lisiyas, a Alvari, Ngwamna Felis. Nda ˈya fa hangga. <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />“Kamshiɗiya, kǝsang Yahudaya, takh nda a ɓǝlang, ɗiya ɗǝ tǝ sodjaya ƙǝkar thlanggi sǝ, ƙǝsǝr sǝkɗi ndaarha tǝ Romarha ni. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Na minna sǝ a sǝn ˈya ni ǝnanǝn ndǝn ɗǝni tǝghǝn a mbed kogna yindan ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Walanggi ǝnɗi ndana nda ǝnaɗǝ nǝghǝn aten ngyahad ndan ni, amma ǝnɗi nda nanda ǝnaɗǝ tsǝkkwa a kǝnang ngganda nduwa ɓǝlang ngganda wa. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Ndee nanda kǝnang nda mee na nda a ɓǝlang nda, ndǝn thlǝnang ni a thlǝmad wa ɓa ƙǝkar. Tǝ kǝm ndang nggi nafini huhwaagha ndǝn a pǝro ǝnɗa nda ǝnanǝn.”<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Nanǝn kee, sodja yini tǝrangganda Mbulus a Antifatiris ɗǝ a fiɗikrha kǝla ndang nanda kanda. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Ɗalthna mbǝrha hai mal sodjaya na a tǝr pǝrsaya ɗǝnda mbee ɗǝ tǝghǝn, kanda nggi kǝm wuɗa nda mbǝd tsawud sodjaya ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Sǝlna sodja yini na tǝr pǝrsaya a Kaisariya ɗǝ, fǝrang ɗeleewar ɗa nda ngwamna, mal Mbulus nda a harghǝn. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Karatang na ngwamna ɗeleewarɗi, tsahang mee nǝn Mbulus tǝnǝn tǝ tsaurha a manggi. Sǝknǝn ndaarha nǝn a Kilikiya, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />ndagha, “Niya ko thlǝmaarha fa a ɓad nafina ɓa huhwagha sa.” Tǝrgha ngwamna ndagha a ƙǝsghǝn nda ha ahu porsǝna na a wuri ki Hirdus tǝn nǝn.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Ngwang nda kumarha Mbulus a mbed Felis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Akwasamad ɓeena tuf tǝrgha mamnda Firis Hananiya ɓagha ɓa tǝ fingya mamngya Yahudaya, tǝ kǝm tǝ tǝngwa kumarha nanda aarha Tartulus, a huhwa Mbulus nda a mbed ngwamna. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Aah nanda Mbulus a ƙǝnɗǝ, katǝrang ngga Tartulus huhwa Mbulus hai a mbed ngwamna ndagha, “Alfari, tsauɗan ɗǝɗemnggirha kaan a kamuwa, ƙǝsǝr sa na ƙǝlarha mbeeɗǝ, mbeɗeng na ǝngya hai ahu chehwedɗiya.”<verse eid="ACT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />“Ƙǝsǝr ka ǝnggini na heu ya, Alfari, nan tǝ usaarha kaan a thlǝmadwa ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Amma mbǝ midna sǝ a ɗahanggi midwa ɗǝ wa, hwanni sa a kee thlǝmaarha na fa tǝ ˈya niya pǝrorha aten niifɗiya. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Walang ɗan kamshiɗiya na pǝpeethla sǝ miighǝn, nǝn ɓarha tǝ kakyathlaanga a pathlang Yahudaya ɓa ko a yanggini ahu ƙǝshidɗiya. Ndǝghǝnni mamnda aten Nadzaraya ndǝna nafiya na mbu samad Yeeso. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Har ma na midghǝn sǝ a kyalgha tǝ Ƙǝn Faara na a Urshalima, ndǝghǝnni kǝsang nan. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fingya chirethya na nda tǝ mbǝdghǝn 6b ndaanǝn: Ndaan kwang a ngwang kumarha nan sǝ ƙǝla ndaana ngyahad nan. Tǝ ƙǝm mbǝdghǝn 7 ndaanǝn: Amma mamnda Lisiya ɓagha ɓa thlanggǝn sǝ a har nan tǝ kanglanggirha.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />A ranna mu palthɗa ha ya na walang ƙǝkafekkidghǝn tafadwa.” <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Yahudaya kǝm kǝnang nda pama kanda mu, nggǝma nda fa tǝ ndaarha nǝghǝn kee.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Fǝrang na ngwamna kwamana Mbulus a kalgha sǝ, ndagha, “Alvari, sǝnɗi sǝ sani tǝ ngwa kumarha yi chehwedɗiya yi huraya hangga; tǝ wutsǝfayirha niya kyang altenna sǝ. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />A rad na mughǝn ha ngga na sǝnda sǝ kalwa ɓeena kumkap sǝri ɗǝni Urshalima ka hwan Faara ɗǝ wa. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Nafiya huhwagha nggi nawa nda nggi a ngaala tǝ niifa ahu Ƙǝn Faara na a Urshalima wa nduwa ƙǝm thlenggi kakyathlanga ahu kǝn tsahad Yahudaya wa, nduwa kǝm ahu wupǝri wa. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Mba nda mbang kyaɗo ˈya huhwana nda nggi atenggǝn wa.”<verse eid="ACT 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />ˈYa tal nggǝmni fa atenggǝn, niya takkwa Faara yi chichiyinǝm tǝ kwamanɗi nda nanda mbǝ ƙǝkafek ni wa, tǝ kǝm niya fǝrƙǝkafek ahu ˈya chireethlǝng nanda ha a ɗeleewar ngyakhrha Musa tǝ ɗeleewar Annabiya. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Fǝrɗi ƙǝkafek a Faara, ƙǝla ǝnana nafini ya, tǝ ndaarha na thliirha sǝ ahu mǝrra, nda nafiya ǝnagha nggayirha tǝ fa mbǝlfeeya. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Nanǝn kee, djitiirha na a tsawi tǝ nggayirha a mbed Faara tǝ fiya.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />“A kwasamad huraya hangga, ɓee Urshalima ɓa tǝ ǝn fǝrra nafina a fa yamiiya tǝ ƙǝm ǝna sataka ni a Faara. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Nafini huhwaagha nggi nanda nggi ahu Ƙǝn hwan Faara na a Urshalima nani a ngwalang tsaɓang altenna ɗǝ. Mbǝ fiya sǝ wumngga hai a thlǝmanna wa tǝ ƙǝm mbǝ kakyathlaanga sǝ wa. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Amma na fingya Yahudaya sǝ ɓagha ɓa a chehweed Asiya a mbǝɗi, ana ˈyasǝ a mii ndan na nda a thlǝkrha atenna, kamɗǝ nanǝnya a na nda a mbǝɗiya. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Tsahang mee nafini na a na a mbǝɗiya ɗimiyid ma walna kognaya Yahudaya atenna, <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />ana palth ɗani thlǝkni na tǝtal keeya, tǝrang ni uradna sǝ a mbed ndan tǝ ndaarha, ‘A ten palth thliirha sǝ hu mǝrra na nanda a ngwee kumarha sǝ a mbed nun a weeriya.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ƙǝs nda Mbulus ha a Kaisariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Felis kǝm sǝnɗǝ ǝngya hangga aten kwaman Yeeso, ishanggǝn ngwa kumadɗi ndagha, “Ƙǝl ma ɓad mamnda Lisiyaya ɓa ˈwan ndǝn ni a ngwalang ngwa kumad nun.” <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />“Ndangga Felis mamnda sodja Romaya a kǝla Mbulus nǝn ha, amma malanggǝn kal farha nǝn hai tǝ ƙǝm a ˈyaɗang ɗǝ kwamana pashiyighǝn a fǝrang ˈya nda na midghǝn wa.”<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Akwasamad ɓengya ngguchit, ɓagha Felis ɓa tǝ nukkun Durusila tǝ Yahudarha. Thlǝn farha nǝn a ɓa nda ɓa tǝ Mbulus, kang thlǝmarha nda fa thlǝk nǝn pathla aten fǝrƙǝkafek a Ƙǝrǝsti Yeeso. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Nana Mbulus a tsǝ laɓara tǝ kanda aten nggayirha, tǝ ƙǝs alteena, tǝ ƙǝm ngwa kumarha na ɓayi. Ƙǝsgha hǝreenga Felis ndagha, “Tsǝkɗǝ kee nanǝnya wiu. A walɗi kwamana niya nggǝr aagha sa ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Na midghǝn sǝ a fǝrangga Mbulus wuɗǝɓǝla, nanǝn kee nagha a thlǝn farha a thlǝmadghǝn ɗǝ atenggǝn, atenggǝn nagha a tsǝ laɓara tǝghǝn.”<verse eid="ACT 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />A kwasamad hurarha sǝri, Pokiyus Festus tsaukwa ngwamna a meghed Felis. Felis kǝm na midghǝn sǝ a wal nggayirha nǝn a mbed Yahudaya malanggǝn Mbulus ahu porsǝna.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Mbulus a mbed Festus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Akwasamad mbeena mahan sǝlna Festus a Kaisariya ɓa ka a ƙǝs targhǝnnǝn yi ngwamna, thliigha a Kaisariya ɗǝgha Urshalima ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />A mbǝɗani huhwaana mamngya firistaya tǝ fingya mamngya Yahudaya Mbulus a mbedghǝn. <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />Hwan Festus nda ƙǝkar a wuɗang ngganda Mbulus Urshalima ɗǝ ƙǝsǝr ngwanda fa a tsǝbghǝn nda fa a kwamana ka ɓǝlang ngganda. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Amma Festus nggǝranggǝn kanda sǝ ndagha, “Ƙǝs nda Mbulus ha a Kaisariya, nggi tafanna tsǝɓaku niya ɗǝrha mbǝɗa ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Fingya mamngginun mbu samadna nda ɗa nda thlǝk ˈya atenggǝn, a ǝnaɗǝ ˈya na ɗimi huhwa ghǝnun.”<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />A kwasamadɗi tsaunǝn mbeena uvaɗa nduwa kum tǝ kanda, wudgha a Kaisariya ɗǝ. Ɗalthana mbǝrha hai kyagha ƙǝn ngwa kumadghǝn ɗǝ ndagha a ɓang Mbulus ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Sǝlna Mbulus ɓa, Yahudayini ɓagha ɓa a Urshalima thlii nda sǝ muwang ngganda maɗufu, na nda a ɗahang palthya fa, mbuwa ƙǝkafek. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Amma Mbulus ngaal ǝnggina nǝn thlǝk nanda atenggǝn ndagha, “Ənayi ˈya na ɗimi aten ngyakhrha Yahudaya, nduwa a Ƙǝn hwan Faara na a Urshalima, nduwa a Kaisar wa.”<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Tǝrgha Festus, na midghǝn sǝ a ǝna ˈyanǝn na a mbǝnanggǝn Yahudayini, ndanggǝn Mbulus, “Na midwa sǝ a ɗǝna Urshalima ɗǝ ɗi nggo kumarha sǝ aten ǝngginiya wa?”<verse eid="ACT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Nggǝmangga Mbulus, “Nanǝnya niyi a ƙǝn ngwa kumad Kaisar, mbǝɗa niya kamngga a ngwee kumarha nda sǝ. Mbǝ ˈyasǝ na ɗimi ǝnang ni Yahudaya fa wa, sa tǝ altenwa ma sǝnnasǝ. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Ana ˈyasǝ na ɗimi ǝnani kamngga a ɓǝleewun, karwi fa wa. Amma ana palthyini ɗeheena Yahudayina fa ya mbǝ ƙǝkafek sǝ wa, mbǝ niifa sǝ tsǝkka a fǝrang nggi nǝn kanda wa. Niyi a hwan Kaisar!”<verse eid="ACT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />A kwasamadɗi ƙǝnang na Festus pathla hai tǝ kogna yini, ndanggǝn Mbulus, “Hwanna a nggǝrgha huhwad wa a mbed Kaisar ɗǝ, na ɗǝrha mbed Kaisar ɗǝ.”<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />A kwasamad ɓǝngya ngguchit, Kutǝra Anggiripa tǝ wan man Mbanis ɓanda Kaisar ɓa ka ɓa nda ndang Festus aalee. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Nanǝn na nda a mǝndaha a mbǝɗi, tsǝgha Festus laɓara aten ngwa kumad Mbulus tǝ kutǝra. Ndagha, “Na niifa sǝ a mbǝɗiya malena Felis ahu porsǝna. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Nani a Urshalima, mamngya firistaya tǝ fingya shingya Yahudaya huhwanda niifɗiya na a ngwang kumad mǝrra ni sǝ. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Ndanggi kanda, mbǝ ǝntin Romaya ni ƙǝnang nggǝm niifa kapa nǝm ngwang kumarha wa, kǝl ma fǝrang ɗǝm kwamana kalgha sǝ aten ǝnɗi huhwa na ndan kamanggǝn ka a thlanggǝn fadghǝn sǝ.”<verse eid="ACT 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />“Ɓa nanda tǝ nggi mbǝɗa ɓa ya, mbǝd wii hai tǝ palthɗi wa, amma ɗalthna mbǝrha hai thlǝn farha ni ɓee niifɗa nda ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Thliina nafina sǝ huhwaagha ndǝn, mbǝ pathla sǝ na ɗimi thlǝk nanda atenggǝn niya kya numaarha wa. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Ameyedghǝn, na palthya sǝ yi ngaala thlǝk nanda aten takkwad ndan tǝ ƙǝm niifa mǝrgha na nda aarha Yeeso na Mbulus a ndaarha nǝghǝn tǝ yibrha. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Wuleegha ˈya na a ǝnee na a ramu palthɗa ni ha ya, tsakh mee ni tǝnǝn nggǝm fa ɗǝgha Urshalima ɗǝ ɗa nda ngwang kumarha sǝ a mbǝɗi aten palth yini ya. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Amma ndagha Mbulus a malghǝn nda ahu porsǝna, ƙǝl sayidɗi ngwalang na Kaisar ngwang kumarha. Nanǝn kee fǝrghǝni a ƙǝsghǝn nda ha ta sayidɗi niya thlǝnanggǝn Kaisar ɗǝ.”<verse eid="ACT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Tǝrgha Anggiripa ndanggǝn Festus, “Na minnasǝ a sǝk fad niifɗa ni ya tafadna.” Nggǝrangga Festus sǝ, “A ɓinda na sǝk fadghǝn.”<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbulus a mbed Anggiripa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Ɗalthna mbǝrha hai sǝla nda Anggiripa ɓa tǝ Mbanis tǝ karid kutǝryid ndan fa nagha fiya a fǝrang mamnggirha kanda, mamngya sodjaya tǝ mamngya wupǝri ɗi a samad ndan. Thlǝngga Festus farha a kya nda ɓa tǝ Mbulus. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Ndagha Festus, “Kutǝra Anggiripa, tǝ fingya na a mbǝɗiya, naɗun niifɗiya! Yahudaya heu huhwan ndan a mbenna a Urshalima tǝ mbǝɗiya ƙǝm na mindansǝ a ɓǝlang ngganda. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Amma ƙǝlang ni nawi ˈya ǝnanǝn tsǝkka a ɓǝlang ngganda wa. Nanǝn kee, ndǝghǝn a ɗa Kaisar ngwang kumarha sǝ, ndǝn ndani niya thlǝnang a Roma ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Amma mani a chireethleng nda Kaisar ɗǝ? Ƙǝsǝr mbǝ pathla sǝ tefen ƙǝsang ni tǝghǝn wa. Nanǝn kee, ndǝn ɓani tǝghǝn mbennun ɓa heu, mbǝ ƙǝla sa mawa kutǝra Anggiripa, a raɗǝm mughǝn ha ngga, niya wal ˈya niya chireethleng nda hai. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Ƙǝsǝr ahu numadna mbǝ mǝmǝl thlǝnang nda niifa na ahu porsǝna a Kaisar ɗǝ kula ˈya ɗimi atenggǝn wa.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Tǝrgha ndangga Anggiripa Mbulus, “Fǝronda kwamana na a kalana sǝ.” Tǝrangga Mbulus haarghǝn sǝ katǝranggǝn ndikrha hai ndǝghǝn,<verse eid="ACT 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />“Kutǝra Anggiripa, pet fanna a weeriya mbang ni isha a mbedwa ka a kyanggi altenna sǝ aten palthya thlǝkna Yahudaya atenna. <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />Nanǝn sǝnang ǝntin Yahudaya hai tǝ fingya ǝngya na nanda a ngaalang nda teena. Nanǝnya niya hwan sa ƙǝrsu kee thlǝmaarha na fa.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />“Yahudaya heu sǝnda tur tsawud na ka nggi ngguchit, ka a katǝradghǝn a kyanan, tǝ ƙǝm a Urshalima. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Ka ƙǝtǝm sǝnda nggi na nda mbang thlǝk ˈya atenna, ana mindan sǝ, ahu takkwa ƙǝkafekkid nan, tǝ Farisarha ni nggi. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Nanǝnya niyi a mbedwa ka a ngwee kumarha na ƙǝsǝr fǝrɗi ƙǝkafek tǝ ˈya ndangna Faara a chichiyinǝm ka ƙǝtǝm. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Nda fǝɗikrha tǝ yanfaara tur yinǝm kumkap sǝri ɗǝfang nda shilee Faara teena kaan, kanda a ƙǝla parka fa ndanǝn. Kutǝra Anggiripa, ƙǝsǝr ka numadɗiya, fingya mamngginǝm ndǝn huhwaanda nggi. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Mani nǝn naarha sǝ ahur nun na ndaarha mbǝ ǝnaarha hai thlengga Faara mǝrya sǝ wa?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />“ˈWaɗi numad ndaarha a ǝna ˈyani heu ni mbang ka a ˈyaɗa thlǝm Yeeso ni tǝ Nadzarat. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Ənɗani ǝnani a Urshalima. Tǝ sǝsǝmnda mamnda firistaya muwangɗi fatakkwaya Yeeso ahu porsǝna ɗǝ. Har ma nggǝmɗi fa a ɓǝlang nda kanda. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Saara hangga ni naarha kyarha hu ƙǝn tsahaya Yahudaya ɗǝ ka a sǝsang ngganda kanda, tǝ ƙǝm ni naarha thlǝghang palthya kanda fa na ɗimi. A hu tǝɓǝnggid na a tendan, ni ɗǝrha hu chehweed ƙǝshi ɗǝ nee a sǝsang kanda.”<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />“Farɗasǝ nggi ahu kwaman ɗǝrha Nɗimaska ɗǝ, nggungwa fa tǝ sǝsǝmnda mamnda firistaya. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Yanfara a sǝrǝkrha, Alvari, nani hu kwamana, na kukwaryirha ni a talara hai, kukwaryidghǝn kalɗǝ yanfaara, djargha tenna hai tǝ kawiyina. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Kan heu fǝlan hweeɗa hai, sǝk urarha ni tǝ mii Aramiya, ‘Shawulu, Shawulu, kama nda na a sǝseerha? Nǝghǝn pǝɗaghǝn a fadwa a yana aten ˈya na minna.’<verse eid="ACT 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />“Tǝrgha tsakh mee ni, ‘Wunni sa Chinǝm?’ Ndagha Chinǝm, ‘Nggini Yeeso na a sǝsang nda. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Nanǝnya thliusǝ! Keɗo ni fanna ka a furo taara ni (mafayirha ni) tǝ ƙǝm pǝr ǝnɗa na nana tǝ ˈya niya kyaɗorha. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Niya hǝrworha a haar nafiwa tǝ fingya mbuwa Yahudaya. Niya thlǝn sa a thlǝmad ndan ɗǝ, <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />ɗa inang yiyi ndan ɗǝ tǝ ƙǝm kyakhrangga kanda ahu kukwaryirha ɓa. Thlangga kanda sǝ a haar Sheetan ɓana tǝ kanda a thlǝmad Faara ɓa tǝna nda wal chakh ɗimiyirha a thlǝɗang ngganda kanda ahur nafiya Faara hai fǝrgha ƙǝkafek a nggi.’”<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />“Nanǝn kee, Kutǝra Anggiripa, nggǝm ɗi fa tǝ sǝsǝnidɗi ɓagha hai a talara. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />ˈWayi katǝrang pǝr laɓar Faara hai a Nɗimaska, tǝ a fingya na a Urshalima tǝ chehweed Yahudiya heu tǝ ƙǝm nafiya mbuwa Yahudaya, tǝ ndaarha a malang ngganda ɗimiyid ndan kyakhra nda thlǝmad Faara ɓa a ǝna ǝngya nda kyadgha ndaarha malang nda ɗimiyid ndan. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Ndǝghǝnni ƙǝseena Yahudaya a pǝpal Ƙǝn Faara na a Urshalima na mindan sǝ a ɓǝleegha nda. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Amma ɗed Faara sǝ ta weeri ɓa ya, ndǝn nani ƙǝt a mbǝɗiya ka a pǝranggǝni wundakhnaya tǝ shingya. Pǝrangɗi ndǝn kanda ˈya ndaana annabiya tǝ Musa nǝn a katǝrarha hai. <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />Ƙǝkafekni Ƙǝrǝsti nǝn a sǝsaarha, nǝn a ˈwa thliirha sǝ ahu mǝra, nǝn a ɓang kukwaryirha nafiyighǝn ɓa tǝ fingya mbuwa Yahudaya.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Mbulus kula ngwalang palthghǝn kee tǝrgha Festus tǝranggǝn uradghǝn sǝ ndǝghǝn, “Sa Mbulus kyahar huten wa! Karatadwa mulda hai kyakhrang ɗǝ huten wa hai.”<verse eid="ACT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Nggǝrangga Mbulus sǝ ndǝghǝn, “Kyaharwa hutenna hai wa, Alvari, ˈya niya thlǝkrha ƙǝkafek ni. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Sǝn kutǝra ǝnggina sǝ ya, ndǝn niya kal farha hai tǝ thlǝkrǝghǝn. Sǝnɗisǝ kutǝra Anggiripa sǝnɗǝ ǝnggini niya thlǝkrha heu ya ƙǝsǝr ǝna wa ndan ɓǝɓee wa. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Kutǝra Anggiripa fǝrna ƙǝkafek tǝ annabiya wa? Sǝnɗisǝ fǝrna ƙǝkafek.”<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Tǝrgha ndangga Anggiripa Mbulus, “Tamngga ndaarha a sayi ngguchit kiya na mbang lǝm nggi fa tsawi Ƙǝrǝsta wa?”<verse eid="ACT 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Ndangga Mbulus, “Ko sayi ngguchit nduwa ɓeena hangga, niyi a hwan Faara tǝ ndaarha mbǝ sa katenwa wa, heu tǝ fingya na a kee thlǝmaarha fa a weeriya tsawa nda ƙǝla nggi, amma mbǝ tǝ wuyiwurɗi ya wa.”<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Tǝrgha kutǝra, tǝ ngwamna tǝ Mbanis tǝ fingya tsau nanda a mbǝrha tal wii nda. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Mal ƙǝnɗa nda, na nanda a ndikrha tǝ ndan, ndanda, “Niifɗiya mbǝ ˈyasǝ ǝnanǝn tsǝkka a ɓǝlanggǝm wa, nduwa muwang nggǝm ahu porsǝna ɗǝ wa.” <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Kutǝra Anggiripa ndanggǝn Festus, “A mbǝ nggǝrna kamshiɗi huhwaarha a mbed Kaisar wa, kam nǝm a kalghǝn hai.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Ɗǝnda tǝ Mbulus a Roma ɗǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Sǝlna farɗa ɓa ngwan fa ɗan Italiya ɗǝ ahu kombuwol, Mbulus tǝ fingya porsǝnaya fǝr kanda nda a haar mamnda sodja Romaya hai na nda aarha Djuliyos nǝghǝn tal ahu sodjaya na a haar Kaisar. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Kya nan ahu kombuwol hai a Adǝramitiyom, na a ɗǝrha ahu fingya talya ɗǝ na chehweed Asiya, thlii wiirha nan a ten wuri aamɗi. Aristakus niif Tasalonika na a chehweed Makidoniya nǝghǝn ahur nan.<verse eid="ACT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Ɗalthna mbǝrha hai sǝlan a Sidon ɗǝ, Djuliyos ǝnang nggayirha nǝn Mbulus malanggǝn ɗǝgha wal pashiyighǝn tǝna nda fǝrang ˈya na midghǝn. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Mal nan Sidon, nagha ɓereurha a tsang hura kan fa, ɗan ɗǝ tsau tǝ wutambar Sayifurus fa tǝnan hǝrǝkrha ma ɓereuɗi. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Mbǝrang nan wuri aamɗa hai na a Silisiya tǝ Pamfiliya, sǝlan a Mira ɗǝ na a chehweed Lisiya. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />A mbǝɗani walna mamnda Sodja Romaya ɗi kombuwol yi Aledzandǝriya na ɗǝrha Italiya ɗǝ, kyanggǝn kan sa hai.<verse eid="ACT 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Əna ɓengya nan hangga a kwamana ƙǝsǝr naghan a wiirha samma-samma pǝrpǝr sǝl nan a Ƙǝnidus ɗǝ. Malang ngwana ɓereuɗi kan ɗǝrha mbeeɗǝ, kyan tǝ man fad wutambar Ƙǝriti na tsau tǝ Salmoni fa. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Pǝrpǝr mbǝrang nan mbǝɗa hai ɓan mbǝrha ɓa na nda aarha, mbǝd hǝrghang nda kombuwol, tsau tǝ tal Lasiya fa. <verse eid="ACT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Mbǝd ɗan hai kaan a mbǝɗi, tsauka wiin nan pǝɗaghǝn ƙǝsǝr nanǝnya mbǝr kar aama ɗǝ. Nanǝn kee, ƙǝsgha Mbulus thlǝman ndan ndǝghǝn,<verse eid="ACT 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />“Waya, ahu widɗi kyanǝm ya na ǝn tǝrǝmnda sǝ a mbee nanǝnya, kombuwol nǝm tǝ rǝfǝnnǝm na nda a sǝbrha ɗǝ kaan, heu tǝ yibya hangga na nda a sahatta.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Amma mamnda sodja Romaya ɗi karɗǝ kang thlǝmaarha Mbulus fa ƙǝl yi tǝ hur kombuwolɗi tǝ niif Kombuwolɗi. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Nanǝn mbǝd hǝrǝkrha nggirggi Likiya mbǝ ngga na a ǝnagha nggirggiya fegrha sǝ wa, ƙǝsǝr ka ǝn ɗiya, hang ndǝndan ndanda a nggushi ɗǝnda mbeeɗǝ tǝ wiirha tǝna nda sǝla Finikiya ɗǝ anaɗǝ a ǝnaarha hai ǝna fegrha nda a mbǝɗi. Finikiya mbǝd isha nggirggiya ni na a Ƙǝriti na a man kii pǝlasarya tǝ hǝmnda yanfaara fa tǝ ƙǝm man kii wufaya tǝ hǝmnda yanfaara fa.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓereu ˈyaara hu wuri aama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Katǝrang na ɓereurha ɓarha ɓa a man kii pǝlasarya ɓa, tamngganda ndaarha wal nda ǝnɗi na mindan; tǝrgha kwasang ngganda nggirggi ndan hai wii nda tǝ mii wuri aam Ƙǝriti. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Tsǝɓaku, ɓereurha ɓagha ɓa kaan a wutambar ɗa ɓa a man kii wufaya tǝ man kyad fara. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Ƙǝsangga ɓereu ˈyaarɗi nggirggi ɗa hai mbangwa nji teena ahu ɓereu ɗaɗǝ wa, malanggan kee nagha ɓereuɗi a pughang kanɗǝ.<verse eid="ACT 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Mbǝrang nan wutambar ɗa hai ngguchit na nda aarha Kauda, pǝrpǝr mbang nan ƙǝnang nda nggirggi ɗa hai na ngguchit na a saman nan. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />A kwasamadɗi kahang nanda Nggirggi ɗa ɓa na ngguchit ƙǝnang ngganda sakhkya a fad kombuwol ɗi na manggǝn amanǝn ɗǝ fǝla ɗǝ. Na nda a tǝrǝmnda na ɗa nda ɗǝrha hu chehweed Sǝrtis ɗǝ.<verse eid="ACT 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Nana aamɗi a ǝna kuɗufulla, nagha a tǝtǝnang kan, ɗalthna mbǝrha hai katǝrang ngganda thlahang fingya rǝf yinan haaɗǝ na ahur nggirggi ɗi ahu aama ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Afar ɓeena yi mahan muwang ngganda fingya kari taara ɗǝ yi nggirggi ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Ɓengya hangga kyawa yanfaara ɓa wa, nduwa wufǝlngaarya, nagha ɓereurha a piirha kaan, numan tǝ ndaarha mban a hǝrǝkrha wa.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />A kwasamadɗi mǝnna nafina ha na ahur nggirggi ɗi kanda kula wal ǝnnarhami, tǝrgha Mbulus thliigha sǝ a mbed ndan ndǝghǝn, “Waya, a ndam kwang kee ɗun thlǝmaarha fa ƙǝla ndangni kun a mal ɗun wutambar Ƙǝriti wa, kam kya wum hu sǝsadɗa hai ya wa. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Amma nanǝnya, niya ndang nda kun ƙǝrsaama, ƙǝsǝr mbǝ niifa sǝ na a ƙǝɗeng yiɓǝdghǝn wa, ƙǝl nggirggi ɗi kee ndǝn nǝm a ƙǝɗeng nda. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Fǝɗik ɗi mbǝrgha ɗǝ tǝ thlǝnda Faara nani yighǝnni tǝ ƙǝm niya tǝrang shilee teena ishɗǝ a thlǝmadna, <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />ndeeghǝn, ‘A tǝrǝmna wa, Mbulus. Na isha a mbed Kaisar nggo kumarha nǝn sǝ. Faara hu nggayidghǝn fǝrɗǝ hǝrǝkrha a fiya heu ka sa.’” <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Nanǝn kee ƙǝrsaama ƙǝsǝr fǝrɗi ƙǝkafek a Faara nǝn a katǝrarha hai ƙǝla pǝree nǝn. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Amma tǝtani a puwangga ɓereurha ƙǝm a wutambarra ɗǝ.<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tim Nggirggi hai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />A fiɗik kumkap faɗa nagha ɓereuɗi aten puwang kanɗǝ a ten wuri aam Adǝriyatik, a manad fiɗikrha fa hur nggirggi yini sǝnang ngganda hai takhɗan a ndusang chehweerha fa. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Ƙǝƙǝrang ngganda kuɗim ndǝghǝn sǝlɗǝ saara haru tǝ kumnggit sǝri. Tsǝɓaku nggǝrgha nda ƙǝƙǝrang nda kuɗim ndǝghǝn ƙǝla nda hai saara kumnggit wutarihe. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Ka tǝrǝmnda naɗǝ nggirggiɗi ɗǝk ferya fa, kal ɗǝɓǝlya nda hai faɗa na hǝhaaghǝn a kamu wuri aamɗa hai tǝ man samadghǝn ka a ˈyaɗang wiirha nǝn fa, hwan Faara nda a ɗalthgha mbǝrha hai wed. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Tǝrgha fa hur nggirggi ɗi na mindansǝ a ɗa nda, tǝra nda hu kombuwol ɗa hai na ngguchit ƙǝla nanda a kal ɗǝɓǝla hai na haaghǝn a man mbee. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Amma ndangga Mbulus mamnda sodjaɗi tǝ fingya sodjaya, “A ishwa nafini a thlǝmad nggirggiɗi ya wa, mbun a hǝrǝkrha wa.” <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Nanǝn kee sodja yini thleng nggand sahad kombuwolɗi ƙǝsgha ndǝn ha malghǝnda hwagha ɗǝ.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Takhna mbǝrha a ɗathla hai ndangga Mbulus kanda heu a hǝb ǝnnarhami nda. Ndǝghǝn, “Ɓengya kumkap faɗa mbǝrgha ɗǝ nuwun ahu ɓillarha kaan ǝnawun ǝnnarhami wa. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Niya ndang nda kun nanǝnya, ǝnama ˈya mii tǝnun wal kanglanggirha. Mbǝ niifa sǝ na a ƙǝɗeng ko was tenggǝnni wa.” <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Tǝrgha tǝranggǝn mburodi sǝ usa Faara nǝn a mbendan heu. Kyanggǝn hai nagha a kiighǝn. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Wal kanglanggirha nda ǝna ǝnnarhami nda mii. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Kan heu haru sǝri tǝ kumnggit mǝd kap mikki na ahur nggirggiɗi. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Ngwalang nanda hǝb ǝnnarhami, thlahang ngganda haad nggirggiɗa ha ɗǝ na nda a irang wan hwalirha ɗǝ ahur wuri aama hai.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Ɗalthna mbǝrha hai, sǝnangwanda chehwedɗa hai na nanda sǝ wa. Amma na mbǝd tsǝchelhomnda, ndanda a nggushi ɗǝna nda tǝ nggirggiɗi a mbǝɗaɗǝ ananda a mbang nda. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Tǝrgha thleng ngganda sakhkini na tǝ ɗǝɓǝl yini hǝhaaghǝn mal kanda nda ahu wuri aamɗi, tǝ ƙǝm kwasangganda sakhkina hai na kyakhrang nda nggirggiɗi. Tǝrgha thlengganda shishamarɗa sǝ na a mbed nggirggiɗi a ɓereurha tǝnǝn puwang kanda a mii ƙǝƙǝshɓangnda ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Amma nggirggiɗi tsuwar chehweerha nǝn kyagha kamughǝn ɗǝ mbangwa tsǝ ˈya fa wa. Tǝrgha nggirggiɗi nagha a fǝlaɗǝ ka kuɗufulla aamɗi.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Sodja yini na mindan sǝ a ɓǝlang ngganda porsǝn nggini ama nanda pǝpeethla hǝrgha nda. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Amma mamnda sodja Romaɗi na midghǝn sǝ a hǝrghanggǝn Mbulus karanggǝn kanda fa. Ndanggǝn kanda yi mbangga aama ˈwa pǝra nǝn pǝpelthgha a mii ƙǝƙǝshɓangnda ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />Tǝrgha ndanggǝn fingya ƙǝs katako ndan nduwa kukutathla nggirggiɗi. Kanda heu hǝrgha nda sǝla nda mii ƙǝkǝshɓang nda ɗǝ.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">Mbulus a wutambar Malta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />A kwasamadɗi hǝrǝk nan kan a ƙǝƙǝshɓangnda, ndǝn sǝk nan tǝ ndaarha nan a wutambar Malta. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Nafiya wutambar ɗi ǝnang nggayirha nda kan kaan. Thlǝn nda kan fa, dzǝghang waarha nda kan sǝ, ƙǝsǝr na ˈyaara a ɓaarha heu tǝ mbiirha.<verse eid="ACT 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Ɗamna Mbulus hwarirha ɓa, nanǝn a sang nda hu waarha hai kyagha kwadwasaarha sǝ ka thlerra wadɗi ɓillagha ndǝn, ƙǝtghǝnǝn a haarghǝn. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Nafiya wutambar ɗi na huthlin ɗa nda nggawal-nggawal a haar Mbulus ndangganda ndan, “Niifɗiya tǝ ɓǝl farha ni, ko nanǝn hǝrǝk ɗǝ ahu wuri aama, faar ngwa kumarha mbǝ a malang tǝ yibrha wa.” <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Amma Mbulus yiranggǝn huthlin ɗa ɗǝ mukka ahu waarha hai ko ˈya walghǝn. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Fiya a numad ndaarha nǝn a hǝthla hai nduwa fǝlgha hai mǝrgha. Amma tsǝna nda tsǝɓaku mbǝ ˈyasǝ walgha ndǝn wa, nggǝrang ngganda numad ndan hai ndanda kamshiɗiya faara ni.<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Tsau tǝ mbǝɗi katǝrana ǝnɗa hai tǝ Mbulus na wure sǝ manggǝn yi Pubiliyus, mamnda wutambar ɗi. Thlǝ kan nǝn fa a minda keeghǝn tǝ wutsǝfayirha, ɓeena mahan ndǝghǝn a fǝrang ǝnnarhami kan. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Chin Pubiliyus ahu sǝra, fadghǝn ɓee tǝ ƙǝm fau a ɓillaghǝn. Kyagha Mbulus thlǝmadghǝn ɗǝ, hwan Faara nǝn, sang haara nǝn fa ƙǝngga. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Katǝrana ǝnɗa hai kee, tǝrgha haaya na ahu wutambar ɗi ɓa nda ɓa wal ƙǝnda nda. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Nagha nafini a fǝrang mamnggirha kan ahu kwamangya hangga. Takh nan a wiirha, fǝrang ǝngya nda kan hangga na minnan.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbulus a Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />A kwasamad ndǝree mahan kyan hu nggirggi Alidzandariya tsauka hai a wutambarɗi a ndǝri mbiirha. Na nggirggiɗi tǝ tǝnda muɗad faarya Kasto tǝ Polus. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Kya nan Sirakus hai ǝna ɓeena nan mahan a mbǝɗi. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Thlen ɗan Rigiyum ɗǝ. Ɗalthna mbǝrha hai piigha ɓereurha ɓa a man ki pǝlasarya. Akwasamad ɓeena sǝri sǝlan Putiyoli ɗǝ. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />A mbǝɗi ɗan wal fingya fatakkwaya, hwan kan nda ǝna ɓeena nan mǝd tǝ kanda a ɗan Roma ɗǝ.<verse eid="ACT 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Sǝkna fatakkwaya ndaarha naghan ɓayi, thlii nda hwathla kanda fa hu Kasu Apiyus, fingya ƙǝm ɓa nda wal kan a mbǝrha na nda aarha Ƙǝn rongya mahan. Nana Mbulus nafini kee usa Faara nǝn wal kanglanggirha nǝn.<verse eid="ACT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Sǝl nan a Roma ɗǝ, malangganda Mbulus tsauka hu ƙǝn rongya katenggǝn tǝ sodjaɗi na a ƙǝlaghǝn ha.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pǝr Mbulus laɓar Faara a Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Akwasamad ɓeena mahan, aagha Mbulus shingya Yahudaya ɓa. Wumna nda ɓa, ndangga Mbulus kanda, “Wanmanggina, ko nanǝn mbǝ ˈya sǝ ǝnang ni nafinǝm fa nduwa ǝntin chichiyi nǝm wa, ƙǝseegha nda a Urshalima fǝr nggi nda a Romaya. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Tsahe mee nda ha ngga, na mindan sǝ a kal nggi nda hai, ƙǝsǝr mbǝ ˈya sǝ ǝnani tsǝkka a ɓǝleegha nda wa. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Amma mamngya Yahudaya kara nda fa, tsaweeghǝn fa tǝta a ɗi a mbed kutǝra Kaisar ɗǝgha ngwee kumarha sǝ, ko nanǝn ɓawi mbǝɗa ɓa ya ka huhwa nafinani wa. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Nanǝn kee, ndǝn kaɗa ni kwamana a na kunni ka a kalanggi kunsǝ kiya, ƙǝsǝr ƙǝneegha nda tǝ wuyiwurɗi ya aten niifɗi na Isǝrelaya a ƙǝlarha fa, Ƙǝrǝsti. Fǝrɗi ƙǝkafek ˈwaɗǝ teena ɓaɗa ɓa.”<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Ndang ngganda, “Wal wan ɗeleewar a Yahudiya ɓa atenwa wa, mbǝ nafinǝm Yahudaya ɓagha ɓa a mbǝɗi thlǝkka ˈya atenwa nduwa tsǝgha laɓara mbuwa ngga atenwa wa. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Amma na minnan sǝk ˈya nan fǝrna ƙǝkafek atenggǝn, ƙǝsǝr sǝn ɗan sǝ fiya ko a yanggini a thlǝk ˈya ɗimi aten takkwad Yeeso.”<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Farɗasǝ ngwa nda fa kanda hangga ka ɗa nda wal Mbulus, ɓa nda mbǝɗa ɓa nanǝn sǝ tǝ tsaurha. Ka a tsar ta figrha ɗǝ, ndǝghǝn a thlǝghang laɓar kutǝryid Faara kanda. Na midghǝn sǝ a lǝm kanda nǝn fa ka a thlǝ Yeeso nda na fa. Ənaghǝn taara tǝ ɗeleewarya Musa tǝ yi annabiya. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Fingya nggǝm nda fa tǝ laɓarghǝn, amma fingya fǝr wa nda ƙǝkafek wa. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Nggǝmngwa nda fa tǝ ndan wa katǝrang ngganda wiirha hai a kwasamadɗi ngwalana Mbulus palthghǝn tǝ ndaarha, “Pǝr Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda ƙǝkafek a chichi yinun ndanǝn ahu ɗeleewar Ishaya,<verse eid="ACT 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />‘Ɗuwa thlǝmad nafina ɗǝ ndangga kanda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">Nun sǝk ˈya amma mbun a sǝnang hai wa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">Nun a na ˈya amma mbun kukwalang hai wa.<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Ƙǝsǝr hur nafiniya nǝghǝn kakrak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">Mba nda sǝk ˈya tǝ thlǝma yi ndan wa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">Tǝ ƙǝm nggǝlang nda yiyi ndan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Kam nandan tǝ yiyi ndan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">Sǝgha nda ƙǝm tǝ thlǝma yi ndan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">Sǝnang ngganda hai tǝ hur ndan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Kyakhra nda hai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">Ƙǝnanggi kanda.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ishaya 6:9,10</char></note><verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Tsaunǝn kee, na minna sǝ a sǝnunsǝ ˈwanda teena thlǝnang nda laɓar hǝrǝkrha Faara a fingya ɗǝ mbuwa wa Yahudaya, na nda a kang thlǝmaarha fa!” <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />Hǝrǝm nǝn ndaarha kee, tǝrgha thliigha Yahudaya sǝ na nda a ngaala kaan a pathlang ndan.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fingya chireelthya kaar mba nda tǝ mbǝɗiya wa </char></note><verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Hurarha sǝri Mbulus tsau ahu mindǝɗi nanǝn a tiirha, nagha a thlǝ fiya fa heu ɓagha thlǝmadghǝn ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Kula tǝrǝm nda ndǝghǝn a pǝr laɓar kutǝryid Faara tǝ tsaharhaha aten Chinǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti, mbǝ niifa sǝ mbangga ˈyaɗanggǝn fa wa.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>